s"},"message":"fix: corregir fila virtual, efectos de react y consulta de billetera\n\n- Fila Virtual: Se movió el código maestro dev a Server Action (verifyOtpAndJoinQueue) para evitar aislamiento de memoria en Next.js.\n\n- Frontend: Se corrigió error ''Cannot update Router'' reemplazando llamadas a Server Actions dentro de setState con un setTimeout en un effect.\n\n- Billetera: Se corrigió la consulta en getUserTickets para usar user_email en lugar de user_id de acuerdo al esquema.\n\n- Documentación: Se actualizó el README con los últimos parches de arquitectura.\n\n- Reglas: Se añadió regla a AGENTS.md para siempre usar git add . antes de los commits.","tree":{"sha":"f214e3728ea21ab9f61f2b37bf7f576b70dda224","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KimJesus22/StageFront-Tickets/git/trees/f214e3728ea21ab9f61f2b37bf7f576b70dda224"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KimJesus22/StageFront-Tickets/git/commits/d42f9ae3c0ea36ee2b50151051bdfb2b4d27b7e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165520674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KimJesus22","id":165520674,"login":"KimJesus22","node_id":"U_kgDOCd2lIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJes