 asientos multiestado y validador OTP","tree":{"sha":"df3f19f4aeab5290673856ae1b3b25d0dd84d921","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KimJesus22/StageFront-Tickets/git/trees/df3f19f4aeab5290673856ae1b3b25d0dd84d921"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KimJesus22/StageFront-Tickets/git/commits/8a8906a8173ac843917d5799ae2c738aad4163f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165520674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KimJesus22","id":165520674,"login":"KimJesus22","node_id":"U_kgDOCd2lIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KimJesus22/StageFront-Tickets/commit/8a8906a8173ac843917d5799ae2c738aad4163f5","node_id":"C_kwDOSSzHgNoAKDhhODkwNmE4MTczYWM4NDM5MTdkNTc5OWFlMmM3MzhhYWQ0MTYzZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KimJesus22/StageFront-Tickets/commit/035f86ae6187f8c6b1ecca16e79e5074186faa1f","sha":"035f86ae6187f8c6b1ecca16e79e5074186faa1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KimJesus22/StageFront-Tickets/commits/035f86ae6187f8c6b1ecca16e79e5074186faa1f"}],"sha":"8a8906a8173ac843917d5799ae2c738aad4163f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KimJesus22/StageFront-Tickets/commits/8a8906a8173ac843917d5799ae2c738aad4163f5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165520674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KimJesus22","id":165520674,"login":"KimJesus22","node_id":"U_kgDOCd2lIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KimJesus22/StageFront-Tickets/commits/035f86ae6187f8c6b1ecca16e79e5074186faa1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T03:27:16Z","email":"joseceron685@gmail.com","name":"KimJesus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T03:27:16Z","email":"joseceron685@gmail.com","name":"KimJesus"},"message":"feat: arquitectura avanzada — Min-Heap, Strategy, Anti-Bot, Grafo de Asientos y Singleton DB\n\n🧠 MOTOR DE FILA VIRTUAL (Min-Heap Priority Queue)\n- Reescritura completa de queue-engine.ts con Min-Heap binario\n- Inserción O(log n) en lugar de O(n), extracción de lotes O(K·log n)\n- Peso de prioridad: weight = arrivalTime - fanBonus (fans verificados avanzan)\n- Index map para lookups O(1) de existencia y posición\n- API route /api/queue con acciones: join, status, cycle, stats, report-latency\n- Ciclos de desfogue con ajuste dinámico de K según latencia del servidor\n\n💳 ARQUITECTURA DE PAGOS (Strategy Pattern — OOP)\n- Clase abstracta PaymentStrategy con contrato processPayment()\n- MockPaymentStrategy: pasarela simulada con inserts reales en DB\n- StripeStrategy: stub preparado para producción\n- PaymentContext: factory que selecciona estrategia según PAYMENT_PROVIDER\n- Server Action processCheckout() como wrapper delgado\n- Checkout UI completamente agnóstica respecto a la pasarela\n\n🛡️ FILTRO DE INTEGRIDAD (Detección Anti-Bot)\n- BehaviorCollector: recolector de señales biométricas (~200 bytes/sesión)\n- BotClassifier: 9 reglas heurísticas ponderadas (click rhythm, mouse linearity, speed, etc.)\n- Veredictos: human (0-30), suspect (31-60, soft block OTP), bot (61-100, hard block)\n- Hook useIntegrityFilter con clasificación local + validación servidor\n- API /api/integrity: re-clasificación independiente, rate limiting por IP, checksum FNV-1a\n- Modal glassmórfico de verificación OTP extra y bloqueo con shield animado\n\n🪑 GRAFO DE ADYACENCIA (Detección de Asientos Huérfanos)\n- SeatGraph: matriz de adyacencia con 4-connectivity por zona\n- findOrphans() en O(V+E) detecta asientos disponibles completamente rodeados\n- Asientos individuales clicables dentro de cada zona del mapa\n- Dots con estados visuales: disponible, seleccionado (glow), ocupado (dimmed), huérfano (amber pulse)\n- Banner de advertencia con sugerencias accionables clicables\n- Hook useSeatGraph sincroniza grafo con estado React\n- Costo en servidor: 0 — todo corre en frontend\n\n📊 MOTOR DE EFICIENCIA DE VENTA (Analytics)\n- sales-efficiency.ts: tracking del user journey (OTP → Mapa → Checkout)\n- KPIs: Tasa de Conversión, Cycle Time, Cuello de Botella\n- SalesEfficiencyPanel.tsx integrado en AdminDashboard\n- API /api/admin/efficiency con refresh automático cada 10s\n\n🔌 SINGLETON DE BASE DE DATOS\n- Refactorización de lib/insforge.ts con patrón Singleton vía globalThis\n- Una única instancia por proceso (previene Too many connections)\n- Admin client con inicialización lazy\n- Diagnóstico: logs de creación de instancia en desarrollo\n\n🔐 SEGURIDAD DE BOLETOS DIGITALES\n- Firma criptográfica invisible con HMAC-SHA256 en boletos\n- QR dinámico con rotación TOTP cada 30 segundos\n- Verificador de integridad verifyTicketSign()\n- Componente SecureTicketQR con countdown visual\n- API /api/ticket-verify para validación server-side\n\n📄 DOCUMENTACIÓN\n- README.md actualizado con arquitectura completa\n- Secciones: Min-Heap, Strategy, Anti-Bot, Grafo, Singleton, Analytics\n- Tabla de patrones de diseño implementados\n- Estructura de proyecto actualizada (+15 archivos nuevos)\n- Variables de entorno documentadas (PAYMENT_PROVIDER, Stripe keys)","tree":{"sha":"f62aa4507231ea4d8d4d6e7ae1a65ab61bef488f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KimJesus22/StageFront-Tickets/git/trees/f62aa4507231ea4d8d4d6e7ae1a65ab61bef488f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KimJesus22/StageFront-Tickets/git/commits/035f86ae6187f8c6b1ecca16e79e5074186faa1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165520674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KimJesus22","id":165520674,"login":"KimJesus22","node_id":"U_kgDOCd2lIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KimJesus22","user_view_type"