domain-scoped semantic search), list_domains, get_domain_info, get_document_status\n- mcp_server/auth.py: MCPAuthMiddleware validates X-API-Key; 401 for missing/invalid keys; sets mcp_user_context ContextVar\n- Mounted at /mcp; global RateLimitMiddleware applies to /mcp requests (no duplicate rate limiting needed)\n- .planning/phases/09-mcp-integration/09-01-PLAN.md: phase plan document\n\nBackend fixes:\n- adapters/__init__.py: complete get_embedding_adapter() factory (was stub with pass); auto-detects Ollama/Gemini/Mock based on env vars\n- adapters/embedding/gemini.py: fix Gemini batch embed URL (models/ prefix required); add debug logging on 404/400 errors\n- api/ontology.py: fix concept/property path params to use {id:path} converter (URIs contain slashes)\n- db/database.py: remove auto-commit from get_db() (services commit explicitly); add finally: close() for proper cleanup\n- services/search_service.py: replace asyncio.gather for hybrid search with sequential await (single AsyncSession not safe for concurrent operations)\n- api/.env.example: document all environment variables\n- api/src/scripts/: utility scripts for DB migrations and data seeding\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8516199343c71d18201efb363355e698a4562b1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/trees/8516199343c71d18201efb363355e698a4562b1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/commits/6a2a9fc2721a2111f4a8e9fb962828828c3591f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/6a2a9fc2721a2111f4a8e9fb962828828c3591f1","node_id":"C_kwDOSS0RV9oAKDZhMmE5ZmMyNzIxYTIxMTFmNGE4ZTlmYjk2MjgyODgyOGMzNTkxZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/cd43673b138233ebc3a8a6596156cc778544818f","sha":"cd43673b138233ebc3a8a6596156cc778544818f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/cd43673b138233ebc3a8a6596156cc778544818f"}],"sha":"6a2a9fc2721a2111f4a8e9fb962828828c3591f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/6a2a9fc2721a2111f4a8e9fb962828828c3591f1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/cd43673b138233ebc3a8a6596156cc778544818f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T02:45:45Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T02:45:45Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix: robustness fixes in Neo4j adapter and DB session factory\n\n- neo4j_adapter.py: use .get() with defaults for optional node fields (uri, label, property_type) to avoid KeyError on partial graph data\n- database.py: pool_pre_ping=True to detect stale connections; rollback on Exception (not BaseException to avoid catching SystemExit); remove asyncio.shield() wrappers that were incorrectly shielding rollback/close calls\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"13d5e9237bedd26b118f1e1c504fce4ed332b7b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/trees/13d5e9237bedd26b118f1e1c504fce4ed332b7b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/commits/cd43673b138233ebc3a8a6596156cc778544818f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/cd43673b138233ebc3a8a6596156cc778544818f","node_id":"C_kwDOSS0RV9oAKGNkNDM2NzNiMTM4MjMzZWJjM2E4YTY1OTYxNTZjYzc3ODU0NDgxOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/4f7356c5dc3cd26eacf4bca3e82d03ff558ddf95","sha":"4f7356c5dc3cd26eacf4bca3e82d03ff558ddf95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/4f7356c5dc3cd26eacf4bca3e82d03ff558ddf95"}],"sha":"cd43673b138233ebc3a8a6596156cc778544818f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal