"date":"2026-05-10T02:25:42Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"message":"chore: add FEAT4 spec and design files; remove debug script\n\n- features/FEAT4.md: login page improvements spec (kb-summary, intel-status, news endpoints)\n- features/design/: design reference assets\n- features/examples/informe_ventas.md: sample document for ingestion testing\n- Removed debug_search.py (ad-hoc debugging script, no longer needed)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b51762a5c1cc75b17a3563f3293ce0babc48ac25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/trees/b51762a5c1cc75b17a3563f3293ce0babc48ac25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/commits/4daf124fdc154fe38001bd8333a74e6749702c85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/4daf124fdc154fe38001bd8333a74e6749702c85","node_id":"C_kwDOSS0RV9oAKDRkYWYxMjRmZGMxNTRmZTM4MDAxYmQ4MzMzYTc0ZTY3NDk3MDJjODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/49f80ad761ce4f23b8b6d1d615b4baccfca72d92","sha":"49f80ad761ce4f23b8b6d1d615b4baccfca72d92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/49f80ad761ce4f23b8b6d1d615b4baccfca72d92"}],"sha":"4daf124fdc154fe38001bd8333a74e6749702c85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/4daf124fdc154fe38001bd8333a74e6749702c85"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/49f80ad761ce4f23b8b6d1d615b4baccfca72d92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T02:20:59Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T02:20:59Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: FEAT3 ontology UI improvements + FEAT4 login page redesign\n\nFEAT3 ontology UI:\n- domains-ui/OntologyProperties.vue: edit class metadata and manage data attributes inline\n- domains-ui/ontologyApi.ts: typed API client for concepts/properties/diagrams\n- domains-ui/stores/ontology.ts: split semantic state from visual diagram state\n- domains-ui/types/ontology.ts: OWLClass, OWLProperty, OntologyDiagram TypeScript types\n\nFEAT4 login page:\n- shell/LoginRequired.vue: redesigned with news sidebar, intel status dot, platform stats; fetches live BFF data on mount\n- shell/services/loginApi.ts: fetchKbSummary/fetchIntelStatus/fetchNews with mock fallback\n- shell/index.html: Material Symbols Outlined font for icon set\n- shell/vite.config.ts: adminUi remote registered at port 5104\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f5efda6c38275b22fd5a717230711c8d4c960d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/trees/7f5efda6c38275b22fd5a717230711c8d4c960d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/commits/49f80ad761ce4f23b8b6d1d615b4baccfca72d92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/49f80ad761ce4f23b8b6d1d615b4baccfca72d92","node_id":"C_kwDOSS0RV9oAKDQ5ZjgwYWQ3NjFjZTRmMjNiOGI2ZDFkNjE1YjRiYWNjZmNhNzJkOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/07266434e488797f8239f0a2f05fa3477d78ebe6","sha":"07266434e488797f8239f0a2f05fa3477d78ebe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/07266434e488797f8239f0a2f05fa3477d78ebe6"}],"sha":"49f80ad761ce4f23b8b6d1d615b4baccfca72d92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/49f80ad761ce4f23b8b6d1d615b4baccfca72d92"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/07266434e488797f8239f0a2f05fa3477d78ebe6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T02:16:43Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T02:16:43Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: improve BFF auth proxy and add FEAT4 public endpoints\n\n- bff/routes/api.ts: add public endpoints /v1/kb-summary, /v1/intel-status, /v1/news (mock data for FEAT4 login page)\n- bff/middleware/auth-proxy.ts: robust session validation with proper 401 propagation\n- bff/middleware/session.ts: session save-before-redirect guard (fixes PKCE state race)\n- bff/proxy/core-api.ts: JWT forwarding with X-User-* headers for Core API\n- bff/auth/keycloak.ts: token refresh and PKCE flow hardening\n- bff/cache/middleware.ts: Redis cache with tag-based invalidation\n- bff/app.ts: middleware ordering (session + auth + cache + proxy)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"551ff54e42eebfaf294d581c57abae6a503aadca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/trees/551ff54e42eebfaf294d581c57abae6a503aadca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/commits/07266434e488797f8239f0a2f05fa3477d78ebe6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/07266434e488797f8239f0a2f05fa3477d78ebe6","node_id":"C_kwDOSS0RV9oAKDA3MjY2NDM0ZTQ4ODc5N2Y4MjM5ZjBhMmYwNWZhMzQ3N2Q3OGViZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/1141ca3f9d9b65b83aab87352eaadb65ec4d0710","sha":"1141ca3f9d9b65b83aab87352eaadb65ec4d0710","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/1141ca3f9d9b65b83aab87352eaadb65ec4d0710"}],"sha":"07266434e488797f8239f0a2f05fa3477d78ebe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/07266434e488797f8239f0a2f05fa3477d78ebe6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/1141ca3f9d9b65b83aab87352eaadb65ec4d0710/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T02:11:35Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T02:11:35Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat: implement Phase 8 admin/API key backend + FEAT3 graph extraction\n\nPhase 8 — Admin and API keys:\n- api/core/auth.py: add generate_api_key, hash_api_key, verify_api_key (SHA-256)\n- api/core/dependencies.py: X-API-Key validation with per-key rate limiting and 429/Retry-After\n- api/core/rate_limit_middleware.py: Redis sliding-window middleware as global safety cap\n- api/api/domains.py: grant/revoke/list domain access endpoints (POST/DELETE/GET /{id}/access)\n- api/services/domain_service.py: grant_access (upsert), revoke_access, list_access_grants\n- api/models/base.py: fix DomainAccess UniqueConstraint(user_id, domain_id); add APIKey, OntologyDiagram models\n- api/schemas/__init__.py: APIKeyCreate/Response/CreateResponse/ListResponse + Ontology/Diagram/Extraction schemas\n- api/main.py: wire api_keys_router, ontology_router; mount MCP server as ASGI sub-app\n\nFEAT3 — Knowledge graph (Phase 8 prerequisite for ontology-backed ingestion):\n- api/adapters/graph/neo4j_adapter.py: Neo4j GraphPort adapter\n- api/ports/graph.py: GraphPort abstract base class\n- api/services/extraction_service.py: LLM-driven entity and relation extraction from chunks\n- api/services/ontology_service.py, api/api/ontology.py: OWL concept/property management\n\nOther backend improvements:\n- api/api/search.py, ingestion.py: route ordering and schema alignment fixes\n- api/db/database.py: async session factory cleanup\n- api/core/logging_middleware.py: structured trace-id propagation\n- api/services/ingestion_service.py, search_service.py: minor robustness fixes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"afe772e36925b32e5602ca37db0b595914b108ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/trees/afe772e36925b32e5602ca37db0b595914b108ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/commits/1141ca3f9d9b65b83aab87352eaadb65ec4d0710","verification":{"paylo