:{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T18:32:51Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T18:32:51Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix(api): clean up pyproject.toml and add comprehensive README\n\n- Remove deprecated [tool.uv.scripts] section (uv doesn''t support this format)\n- Remove duplicate dev-dependencies sections\n- Move dev dependencies to [project.optional-dependencies]\n- Add comprehensive README with clear CORRECT vs INCORRECT examples\n- Explain why --app-dir src is required for imports to work\n\nThe key insight is that the code uses absolute imports (from db.database import ...)\nwhich requires uvicorn to be run with --app-dir src flag so that ''src'' becomes\nthe package root, not ''src.main''.\n\nUsage:\n  ✅ python start.py\n  ✅ uvicorn main:app --app-dir src --reload\n  ❌ uvicorn src.main:app --reload  # WRONG!","tree":{"sha":"6ff4dff7e873e714c7fb8b5fc6595f16641ec8b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/trees/6ff4dff7e873e714c7fb8b5fc6595f16641ec8b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/commits/21ae1cb83dc60ff4dde22b2ebcaca2b6b93e770f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/21ae1cb83dc60ff4dde22b2ebcaca2b6b93e770f","node_id":"C_kwDOSS0RV9oAKDIxYWUxY2I4M2RjNjBmZjRkZGUyMmIyZWJjYWNhMmI2YjkzZTc3MGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/6c29d359fbe0e093c9a16aeeea2755743a548224","sha":"6c29d359fbe0e093c9a16aeeea2755743a548224","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/6c29d359fbe0e093c9a16aeeea2755743a548224"}],"sha":"21ae1cb83dc60ff4dde22b2ebcaca2b6b93e770f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/21ae1cb83dc60ff4dde22b2ebcaca2b6b93e770f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/6c29d359fbe0e093c9a16aeeea2755743a548224/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T18:28:31Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T18:28:31Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix(api): resolve module import issues with proper package structure\n\n- Add missing __init__.py files to src/ and src/core/ directories\n- Update start scripts to use --app-dir src flag (proper uvicorn approach)\n- Add README with clear instructions on how to run the API\n\nThe --app-dir flag tells uvicorn to look for modules in the src directory,\nresolving the ''ModuleNotFoundError: No module named db'' error.\n\nUsage options:\n1. uv run dev (uses uv scripts from pyproject.toml)\n2. start.bat or ./start.sh (updated scripts)\n3. uvicorn main:app --app-dir src --reload (direct with --app-dir)\n4. python start.py (Python module approach)","tree":{"sha":"f905b1332e50d1da154833a1f50ca5eb8bde5bf0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/trees/f905b1332e50d1da154833a1f50ca5eb8bde5bf0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/commits/6c29d359fbe0e093c9a16aeeea2755743a548224","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/6c29d359fbe0e093c9a16aeeea2755743a548224","node_id":"C_kwDOSS0RV9oAKDZjMjlkMzU5ZmJlMGUwOTNjOWExNmFlZWVhMjc1NTc0M2E1NDgyMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/00b2ff4cd38c376f0a91b6820ea861def44471a8","sha":"00b2ff4cd38c376f0a91b6820ea861def44471a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/00b2ff4cd38c376f0a91b6820ea861def44471a8"}],"sha":"6c29d359fbe0e093c9a16aeeea2755743a548224","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/6c29d359fbe0e093c9a16aeeea2755743a548224"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/00b2ff4cd38c376f0a91b6820ea861def44471a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T18:23:55Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T18:23:55Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix(api): add startup scripts to fix PYTHONPATH issues\n\nCreate cross-platform startup scripts that properly set PYTHONPATH before\nrunning uvicorn. This fixes the ''ModuleNotFoundError: No module named db''\nerror when running the API locally.\n\nScripts provided:\n- start.sh: Bash script for Linux/Mac/WSL\n- start.bat: Batch script for Windows\n- start.py: Python script that works on all platforms\n\nUsage:\n  Windows: start.bat [host] [port]\n  Linux/Mac: ./start.sh\n  All platforms: python start.py\n\nAlternative: Set PYTHONPATH manually before running uvicorn:\n  set PYTHONPATH=D:\\02-PERSONAL\\01-PROJECTS\\25-KnowledgeManagement\\api\n  uvicorn src.main:app --reload","tree":{"sha":"ef1e81c9487956feef4a7f26791d5b7f5eff00a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/trees/ef1e81c9487956feef4a7f26791d5b7f5eff00a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/commits/00b2ff4cd38c376f0a91b6820ea861def44471a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/00b2ff4cd38c376f0a91b6820ea861def44471a8","node_id":"C_kwDOSS0RV9oAKDAwYjJmZjRjZDM4YzM3NmYwYTkxYjY4MjBlYTg2MWRlZjQ0NDcxYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/481f056490e149b1f8a16d994685017cfecc4bc6","sha":"481f056490e149b1f8a16d994685017cfecc4bc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/481f056490e149b1f8a16d994685017cfecc4bc6"}],"sha":"00b2ff4cd38c376f0a91b6820ea861def44471a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/00b2ff4cd38c376f0a91b6820ea861def44471a8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/481f056490e149b1f8a16d994685017cfecc4bc6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T18:19:32Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T18:19:32Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix(api): set PYTHONPATH in Dockerfile to fix module imports\n\nAdd PYTHONPATH=/app/src environment variable to ensure Python can find\nthe local modules (db, api, mcp, core) when running uvicorn.\n\nThis fixes the ModuleNotFoundError: No module named ''db'' error that\noccurs when the container starts.","tree":{"sha":"e72d4777519bcee37063fc871ce23f40892f6e6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/trees/e72d4777519bcee37063fc871ce23f40892f6e6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/commits/481f056490e149b1f8a16d994685017cfecc4bc6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/481f056490e149b1f8a16d994685017cfecc4bc6","node_id":"C_kwDOSS0RV9oAKDQ4MWYwNTY0OTBlMTQ5YjFmOGExNmQ5OTQ2ODUwMTdjZmVjYzRiYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/1ee5cb7164d6ad1b726f1829718fb49c10eeebfd","sha":"1ee5cb7164d6ad1b726f1829718fb49c10eeebfd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/1ee5cb7164d6ad1b726f1829718fb49c10eeebfd"}],"sha":"481f056490e149b1f8a16d994685017cfecc4bc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/481f056490e149b1f8a16d994685017cfecc4bc6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/1ee5cb7164d6ad1b726f1829718fb49c10eeebfd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T18:17:27Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T18:17:27Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"message":"fix(domains-ui): correct store method name in onMounted hook\n\nChange store.loadDomains() to store.fetchDomains() to match the actual\nmethod name exported by the domains store. This fixes the runtime error:\n''Uncaught TypeError: store.loadDomains is not a function''\n\nThe store exports ''fetchDomains'' but the component was calling the\nnon-existent ''loadDomains'' method.","tree":{"sha":"75e5f5ec61ba096ff6b924419866b7fbe970c91f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/trees/75e5f5ec61ba096ff6b924419866b7fbe970c91f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/commits/1ee5cb7164d6ad1b726f1829718fb49c10eeebfd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/1ee5cb7164d6ad1b726f1829718fb49c10eeebfd","node_id":"C_kwDOSS0RV9oAKDFlZTVjYjcxNjRkNmFkMWI3MjZmMTgyOTcxOGZiNDljMTBlZWViZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/7ce3dfb5dee6f0314eaf5f1c094a96577be92842","sha":"7ce3dfb5dee6f0314eaf5f1c094a96577be92842","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/7ce3dfb5dee6f0314eaf5f1c094a96577be92842"}],"sha":"1ee5cb7164d6ad1b726f1829718fb49c10eeebfd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/1ee5cb7164d6ad1b726f1829718fb49c10eeebfd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/7ce3dfb5dee6f0314eaf5f1c094a96577be92842/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T16:46:36Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T16:46:36Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs: Comprehensive pending implementations list\n\nDocument all TODOs and missing features across all phases:\n\nCritical (3):\n- Rate limiting middleware for API keys\n- API key validation in get_current_user_optional\n- Domain access check in job status endpoint\n\nHigh Priority (8):\n- MongoDB integration for document content\n- Async workers with ARQ\n- Dead Letter Queue implementation\n- Prometheus + Grafana stack\n- Kubernetes manifests\n- Helm charts\n- Automated backups\n- SSL/TLS termination\n\nMedium Priority v2 (9):\n- Qdrant/OpenAI/Ollama adapters\n- Reranking with cross-encoder\n- Webhooks and email notifications\n- OpenTelemetry tracing\n- Neo4j graph database\n- Search analytics\n- Suggestions and autocomplete\n\nLow Priority (5):\n- Docker Compose overrides\n- Build optimizations\n- Redis caching in BFF\n- CDN for assets\n- Audit logging\n\nAlso includes recommended sprint planning and production checklist.","tree":{"sha":"1cf10b4ea3800f3e680b73e235c6becb1dd3d4d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/trees/1cf10b4ea3800f3e680b73e235c6becb1dd3d4d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/commits/7ce3dfb5dee6f0314eaf5f1c094a96577be92842","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/7ce3dfb5dee6f0314eaf5f1c094a96577be92842","node_id":"C_kwDOSS0RV9oAKDdjZTNkZmI1ZGVlNmYwMzE0ZWFmNWYxYzA5NGE5NjU3N2JlOTI4NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/628b33660c75e4b4763107bd57db8b9a63570c62","sha":"628b33660c75e4b4763107bd57db8b9a63570c62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/628b33660c75e4b4763107bd57db8b9a63570c62"}],"sha":"7ce3dfb5dee6f0314eaf5f1c094a96577be92842","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/7ce3dfb5dee6f0314eaf5f1c094a96577be92842"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/628b33660c75e4b4763107bd57db8b9a63570c62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T16:38:09Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T16:38:09Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(ops): Phase 10 - Production Hardening and Observability\n\nPlan 10-01: Production Hardening\n\nStructured Logging:\n- Add logging_config.py with structlog configuration\n  - JSON format for production, colored console for dev\n  - Request context binding for correlation IDs\n  - Automatic exception formatting with stack traces\n- Add logging_middleware.py for automatic request logging\n  - Logs all HTTP requests with timing, status codes\n  - Generates unique request IDs\n  - Extracts client IP (respecting X-Forwarded-For)\n  - Binds user context when available\n\nEnhanced Health Checks:\n- Add api/health.py with comprehensive health monitoring\n  - GET /health - Basic health for load balancers\n  - GET /health/detailed - Full dependency checks\n  - GET /health/ready - Kubernetes readiness probe\n  - GET /health/live - Kubernetes liveness probe\n  - GET /metrics - Prometheus-compatible metrics\n- Health checks for: database, vector store, embedding provider\n- Response time tracking for all checks\n\nUpdated Main Application:\n- Configure structured logging on startup\n- Add GZip compression middleware\n- Add request logging middleware\n- Enhanced startup/shutdown logging with timing\n- Version endpoint with uptime tracking\n- Graceful shutdown handling\n\nCI/CD Pipeline:\n- Add .github/workflows/ci-cd.yml\n  - Test stage: linting, type checking, unit tests with coverage\n  - Build stage: Docker image building with Buildx, multi-platform support\n  - Deploy stage: Staging (main branch), Production (version tags)\n- Support for all components: API, BFF, Frontend apps\n- Container registry integration (GHCR)\n- Layer caching for faster builds\n\nProduction Configuration:\n- Add .env.production.example template\n  - All required environment variables documented\n  - Database, MongoDB, Redis, ChromaDB configuration\n  - Authentication (Keycloak) settings\n  - AI/ML API keys\n  - Security settings (session secrets, CORS)\n  - Monitoring configuration\n  - Performance tuning parameters\n  - Feature flags\n\nAll Phases Complete:\n- Phase 6: Frontend Shell + Module Federation\n- Phase 7: Core Micro UIs (Search, Domains, Ingestion)\n- Phase 8: Admin UI + API Key Management\n- Phase 9: FastMCP Server for AI Agents\n- Phase 10: Production Hardening + Observability","tree":{"sha":"91cafe74b836a8127a82bdc70203e9f8e465fe86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/trees/91cafe74b836a8127a82bdc70203e9f8e465fe86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/commits/628b33660c75e4b4763107bd57db8b9a63570c62","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/628b33660c75e4b4763107bd57db8b9a63570c62","node_id":"C_kwDOSS0RV9oAKDYyOGIzMzY2MGM3NWU0YjQ3NjMxMDdiZDU3ZGI4YjlhNjM1NzBjNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/b9b3d430e1b5bec94737e59fabb58bd06c50cf9f","sha":"b9b3d430e1b5bec94737e59fabb58bd06c50cf9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/b9b3d430e1b5bec94737e59fabb58bd06c50cf9f"}],"sha":"628b33660c75e4b4763107bd57db8b9a63570c62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/628b33660c75e4b4763107bd57db8b9a63570c62"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/b9b3d430e1b5bec94737e59fabb58bd06c50cf9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T16:28:24Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T16:28:24Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(api): Phase 9 - FastMCP Server for AI Agent Integration\n\nPlan 09-01: FastMCP Server for AI Agent Integration\n- Add MCP module with FastMCP server instance\n- Create MCP tools for AI agents:\n  - search_knowledge: Search documents (semantic, keyword, hybrid)\n  - list_domains: List all knowledge domains\n  - get_domain_info: Get detailed domain information\n  - get_document_status: Check document ingestion status\n- Add API key authentication middleware (MCPAuthMiddleware)\n  - Validates X-API-Key header\n  - Attaches scopes and domain restrictions to request state\n- Mount MCP as ASGI sub-app at /mcp following Decision D002\n- MCP endpoints:\n  - GET /mcp/sse - SSE endpoint for real-time communication\n  - POST /mcp/messages - Message endpoint for tool calls\n\nAuthentication:\n- Requires X-API-Key header for all MCP requests\n- API keys validated against database\n- Scopes control access level (read, write, admin)\n- Domain restrictions supported via API key configuration\n\nIntegration:\n- Uses existing SearchService, DomainService, IngestionService\n- Leverages AsyncSessionLocal for database sessions\n- FastMCP already in dependencies (fastmcp>=0.4.0)","tree":{"sha":"f4d32647c2b3fe4679ae4fcc3525997ec33dcd91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/trees/f4d32647c2b3fe4679ae4fcc3525997ec33dcd91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/commits/b9b3d430e1b5bec94737e59fabb58bd06c50cf9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/b9b3d430e1b5bec94737e59fabb58bd06c50cf9f","node_id":"C_kwDOSS0RV9oAKGI5YjNkNDMwZTFiNWJlYzk0NzM3ZTU5ZmFiYjU4YmQwNmM1MGNmOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/2db1cc419831b2faa3d158c906f98fd40cae3c43","sha":"2db1cc419831b2faa3d158c906f98fd40cae3c43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/2db1cc419831b2faa3d158c906f98fd40cae3c43"}],"sha":"b9b3d430e1b5bec94737e59fabb58bd06c50cf9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/b9b3d430e1b5bec94737e59fabb58bd06c50cf9f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/2db1cc419831b2faa3d158c906f98fd40cae3c43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T16:16:38Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T16:16:38Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"message":"feat(frontend): Phase 8 - Admin UI with API Key Management\n\nPlan 08-01: Admin UI with API Key Management\n- Add TypeScript types for API keys (APIKey, APIKeyCreate, APIKeyListResponse)\n- Add apiKeysApi service for Core API integration\n  - createApiKey, listApiKeys, getApiKey, revokeApiKey\n  - Error handling with ApiKeyError class\n- Add Pinia admin store with full CRUD operations\n  - State: apiKeys, totalApiKeys, isLoading, error, newlyCreatedKey\n  - Getters: activeApiKeys, revokedApiKeys, totalPages\n  - Actions: loadApiKeys, createApiKey, revokeApiKey\n- Update App.vue with comprehensive API key management UI\n  - Stats cards with live badge counts\n  - API Keys list view with pagination\n  - Create key modal with form (name, scopes, rate limit, expiry)\n  - One-time key display with copy button\n  - Revoke confirmation modal\n  - Loading skeletons and error states\n- Copy design tokens from shell for consistent styling\n- Update main.ts to initialize Pinia\n\nAll API key endpoints integrated:\n- POST /api/v1/api-keys - Create\n- GET /api/v1/api-keys - List (paginated)\n- GET /api/v1/api-keys/{id} - Get details\n- DELETE /api/v1/api-keys/{id} - Revoke","tree":{"sha":"c1677616a6ba921fe26b35ad54f423767d7afaf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/trees/c1677616a6ba921fe26b35ad54f423767d7afaf4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/commits/2db1cc419831b2faa3d158c906f98fd40cae3c43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/2db1cc419831b2faa3d158c906f98fd40cae3c43","node_id":"C_kwDOSS0RV9oAKDJkYjFjYzQxOTgzMWIyZmFhM2QxNThjOTA2Zjk4ZmQ0MGNhZTNjNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/d0dd06a1f46bbef5c14c51a2c0ab7704a4c1b498","sha":"d0dd06a1f46bbef5c14c51a2c0ab7704a4c