dis Caching\n\n- Add Socket.IO WebSocket server with authentication on /ws endpoint\n- Implement Redis pub/sub for event relay (ingestion-events channel)\n- Create ingestion event handlers for real-time job updates\n- Add Redis-based response caching with TTL support\n- Implement cache invalidation by pattern and tags\n- Add cache middleware for GET endpoints (/v1/search, /domains)\n- Enhanced health check with WebSocket and cache metrics\n- Graceful shutdown handling for all services\n\nResolves: BFF-02, BFF-04 requirements\nCompletes Phase 5: BFF layer","tree":{"sha":"671791c8e0e8371c3396031afd5e0aecaa8bcf5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/trees/671791c8e0e8371c3396031afd5e0aecaa8bcf5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/commits/07a8aecc3efa7cee5025634225785c16318fe199","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/07a8aecc3efa7cee5025634225785c16318fe199","node_id":"C_kwDOSS0RV9oAKDA3YThhZWNjM2VmYTdjZWU1MDI1NjM0MjI1Nzg1YzE2MzE4ZmUxOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/4da85c3af5918dc673879a4cf3ca38ddaeb73787","sha":"4da85c3af5918dc673879a4cf3ca38ddaeb73787","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/4da85c3af5918dc673879a4cf3ca38ddaeb73787"}],"sha":"07a8aecc3efa7cee5025634225785c16318fe199","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/07a8aecc3efa7cee5025634225785c16318fe199"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/4da85c3af5918dc673879a4cf3ca38ddaeb73787/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T14:42:56Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T14:42:56Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"message":"Phase 5 Plan 05-02: Core API Proxy + REST Exposure\n\n- Implement http-proxy-middleware for Core API forwarding\n- Add JWT Bearer token injection from Redis sessions\n- Create auth-proxy middleware for session validation\n- Add structured logging with Winston and trace IDs\n- Implement X-Trace-Id header for request tracing\n- Add error handling: 502 Bad Gateway, 504 Timeout\n- Token refresh logic on 401 from Core API\n- Sensitive data redaction in logs\n\nResolves: BFF-01, BFF-03 requirements","tree":{"sha":"f1169a9265ef3a61564a9957052c3c9b2f79304e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/trees/f1169a9265ef3a61564a9957052c3c9b2f79304e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/commits/4da85c3af5918dc673879a4cf3ca38ddaeb73787","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/4da85c3af5918dc673879a4cf3ca38ddaeb73787","node_id":"C_kwDOSS0RV9oAKDRkYTg1YzNhZjU5MThkYzY3Mzg3OWE0Y2YzY2EzOGRkYWViNzM3ODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/0785bd852b95440af1ebd53f0785fb2d41e4df7a","sha":"0785bd852b95440af1ebd53f0785fb2d41e4df7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/0785bd852b95440af1ebd53f0785fb2d41e4df7a"}],"sha":"4da85c3af5918dc673879a4cf3ca38ddaeb73787","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/4da85c3af5918dc673879a4cf3ca38ddaeb73787"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/0785bd852b95440af1ebd53f0785fb2d41e4df7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T14:32:42Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T14:32:42Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"message":"Phase 5 Plan 05-01: BFF Foundation + OAuth2 Proxy\n\n- Initialize BFF Node.js project with TypeScript and Express\n- Implement Keycloak OAuth2 client using openid-client\n- Add Redis-backed session management with HttpOnly cookies\n- Create authentication routes (/auth/login, /auth/callback, /auth/logout, /auth/session)\n- Add Dockerfile with multi-stage production build\n- Security: JWT tokens stored server-side only, never exposed to browser\n\nResolves: BFF-01, BFF-03 requirements","tree":{"sha":"fddbdccda25da4480aaf8b06e7d01bc16d82bf66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/trees/fddbdccda25da4480aaf8b06e7d01bc16d82bf66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/commits/0785bd852b95440af1ebd53f0785fb2d41e4df7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/0785bd852b95440af1ebd53f0785fb2d41e4df7a","node_id":"C_kwDOSS0RV9oAKDA3ODViZDg1MmI5NTQ0MGFmMWViZDUzZjA3ODVmYjJkNDFlNGRmN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ianache/kmportal/commit/5f960812f41013bcd9f3de46659f57e7dc7b3ac7","sha":"5f960812f41013bcd9f3de46659f57e7dc7b3ac7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/5f960812f41013bcd9f3de46659f57e7dc7b3ac7"}],"sha":"0785bd852b95440af1ebd53f0785fb2d41e4df7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/0785bd852b95440af1ebd53f0785fb2d41e4df7a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/commits/5f960812f41013bcd9f3de46659f57e7dc7b3ac7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T13:53:25Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T13:53:25Z","email":"ianache@crossnet.ws","name":"ianache"},"message":"docs(05-bff-layer): create phase 5 plans for Node.js BFF","tree":{"sha":"1464409aff1d5355dfdc4ac9c9e307ef3c7f5276","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/trees/1464409aff1d5355dfdc4ac9c9e307ef3c7f5276"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ianache/kmportal/git/commits/5f960812f41013bcd9f3de46659f57e7dc7b3ac7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_