cd9814a522757d5bf582b4d1bc66e88797aba3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/11937893d0e3c6601ee382343ff6a3226dd12955","verification":{"payload":"tree 86cd9814a522757d5bf582b4d1bc66e88797aba3\nparent 6dbf599c464f97a39ddf74f894e408f211a16671\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782600901 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782600901 +0000\n\npolish: fix dashboard header nav on mobile\n\nOn small screens the 4-button nav wrapped into two rows that crowded the\nCompass logo (visible in mobile screenshots). The header now stacks\nvertically on mobile — logo on its own line, nav wrapping cleanly beneath\nit — and returns to a single right-aligned row on sm+. Buttons get\nwhitespace-nowrap so labels never break mid-word.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJrgWkcU\ngHSe0EogcAQKzBCmYIVGQLNeJzC17ru4mkOAcTWKSRaUugNXujnLhWRBOXdhF3ORIfdrAz2bnuxu\n7A0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-27T22:55:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ahdithanu/Compass/commit/11937893d0e3c6601ee382343ff6a3226dd12955","node_id":"C_kwDOSS5DytoAKDExOTM3ODkzZDBlM2M2NjAxZWUzODIzNDNmZjZhMzIyNmRkMTI5NTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ahdithanu/Compass/commit/6dbf599c464f97a39ddf74f894e408f211a16671","sha":"6dbf599c464f97a39ddf74f894e408f211a16671","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/6dbf599c464f97a39ddf74f894e408f211a16671"}],"sha":"11937893d0e3c6601ee382343ff6a3226dd12955","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/11937893d0e3c6601ee382343ff6a3226dd12955"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/6dbf599c464f97a39ddf74f894e408f211a16671/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T19:55:44Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T19:55:44Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: dashboard demo mode for anonymous users (no more \"Not authenticated\")\n\nThe dashboard hard-errored with \"Not authenticated\" when an anonymous\nvisitor with no saved profile hit /api/recommendations — inconsistent\nwith the projection/rebalance pages, which fall back to a sample profile.\nNow both the recommendations and insights routes use a shared\nDEFAULT_PROFILE for anonymous, no-posted-profile requests and return a\n`demo` flag instead of 401. Only an authenticated user *without* a saved\nprofile is bounced to onboarding (404). The dashboard surfaces a \"Sample\nplan — set my profile\" banner in demo mode. Extracted the duplicated\ndefault profile into src/lib/profile.ts and reused it across the\nprojection/rebalance pages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2","tree":{"sha":"e15c53b0d5f48831f2c7b120afec0bd52a892499","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/e15c53b0d5f48831f2c7b120afec0bd52a892499"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/6dbf599c464f97a39ddf74f894e408f211a16671","verification":{"payload":"tree e15c53b0d5f48831f2c7b120afec0bd52a892499\nparent 1dcfb34848111f0653e114c877f70ea20ca30c50\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782590144 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782590144 +0000\n\nfix: dashboard demo mode for anonymous users (no more \"Not authenticated\")\n\nThe dashboard hard-errored with \"Not authenticated\" when an anonymous\nvisitor with no saved profile hit /api/recommendations — inconsistent\nwith the projection/rebalance pages, which fall back to a sample profile.\nNow both the recommendations and insights routes use a shared\nDEFAULT_PROFILE for anonymous, no-posted-profile requests and return a\n`demo` flag instead of 401. Only an authenticated user *without* a saved\nprofile is bounced to onboarding (404). The dashboard surfaces a \"Sample\nplan — set my profile\" banner in demo mode. Extracted the duplicated\ndefault profile into src/lib/profile.ts and reused it across the\nprojection/rebalance pages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIvsKMjm\nTyrf7zTGJNwmX4RXonEgbRx7+Y+AvItBVqSZigy/F5MW7lFhcFBX2R9lU9D+2rq4L91iHTUzCQsE\ncgQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-27T19:55:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ahdithanu/Compass/commit/6dbf599c464f97a39ddf74f894e408f211a16671","node_id":"C_kwDOSS5DytoAKDZkYmY1OTljNDY0Zjk3YTM5ZGRmNzRmODk0ZTQwOGYyMTFhMTY2NzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ahdithanu/Compass/commit/1dcfb34848111f0653e114c877f70ea20ca30c50","sha":"1dcfb34848111f0653e114c877f70ea20ca30c50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/1dcfb34848111f0653e114c877f70ea20ca30c50"}],"sha":"6dbf599c464f97a39ddf74f894e408f211a16671","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/6dbf599c464f97a39ddf74f894e408f211a16671"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/1dcfb34848111f0653e114c877f70ea20ca30c50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T15:43:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T15:43:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"projection: reverse-solver for the required monthly contribution\n\nWhen a goal is set and the projection falls short, show the actionable\nanswer: the monthly contribution that would actually reach it, with a\none-tap \"Apply\". Backed by requiredMonthlyContribution(), which inverts\nthe same ordinary-annuity model project() uses (closed form, rounds up so\nyou don''t fall short, returns 0 when the lump sum already compounds past\nthe goal). Round-trip tested: feeding the solved amount back into\nproject() lands at or just above the goal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2","tree":{"sha":"8e9781c1e9926395656dde8e16a0297f885f1209","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/8e9781c1e9926395656dde8e16a0297f885f1209"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/1dcfb34848111f0653e114c877f70ea20ca30c50","verification":{"payload":"tree 8e9781c1e9926395656dde8e16a0297f885f1209\nparent 876c9584280d2aaf75819e5c8a65917831544355\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782575019 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782575019 +0000\n\nprojection: reverse-solver for the required monthly contribution\n\nWhen a goal is set and the projection falls short, show the actionable\nanswer: the monthly contribution that would actually reach it, with a\none-tap \"Apply\". Backed by requiredMonthlyContribution(), which inverts\nthe same ordinary-annuity model project() uses (closed form, rounds up so\nyou don''t fall short, returns 0 when the lump sum already compounds past\nthe goal). Round-trip tested: feeding the solved amount back into\nproject() lands at or just above the goal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKfcJn4G\naDc762BFbLFPZEcqxy4LaG6coAIMctAuB0GLhT6l/w+OQX2v5+GH1FcznGVHgIEGE166QB7Sv1y2\ndwI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-27T15:43:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/f