file is set. Live plan with buy/sell amounts, a drift\nbadge (share of the book that must move), and per-bucket current-vs-target\ndetail. Backed by a pure computeRebalance() helper (negative-input\nflooring, tolerance band, float-noise epsilon) with unit tests. Linked\nfrom the dashboard header.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2","tree":{"sha":"bb4c66df2d3ba5ce5e93a9f6592c20c464636edf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/bb4c66df2d3ba5ce5e93a9f6592c20c464636edf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/b9a6b9fb3a3cab87c90b3051ad054f1c1a0ac4ed","verification":{"payload":"tree bb4c66df2d3ba5ce5e93a9f6592c20c464636edf\nparent f237579f1661e7d7eca5703df6883d2a2ef5cbd9\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782548858 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782548858 +0000\n\nfeat: rebalance calculator\n\nNew /rebalance surface: enter current holdings per bucket and Compass\nshows the trades that close the gap to your target mix. Target is drawn\nfrom your saved profile (same precedence as onboarding), with a sensible\ndefault when no profile is set. Live plan with buy/sell amounts, a drift\nbadge (share of the book that must move), and per-bucket current-vs-target\ndetail. Backed by a pure computeRebalance() helper (negative-input\nflooring, tolerance band, float-noise epsilon) with unit tests. Linked\nfrom the dashboard header.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHlnSN47\naTkaBmMmFx1mWtbf5Zaypre4sxs5GqGumT9YVFYE6uWElyRiz6az4IrxWgJ0AmyMNpaLQ5bRmZck\nLgU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","