deltas\n(stocks +10 pts, bonds -10 pts), plus picks added / removed / held.\nBacked by a pure diffRuns() helper (older -> newer ordering so deltas\nread as how the newer plan moved) with unit tests. Insights runs are\nnon-selectable in compare mode since only recommendations carry an\nallocation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2","tree":{"sha":"d2370359a97387ddb367c11c4b85533f2eb57134","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/d2370359a97387ddb367c11c4b85533f2eb57134"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/7f334333c2c6176977fb229b14bae133b57851c6","verification":{"payload":"tree d2370359a97387ddb367c11c4b85533f2eb57134\nparent c4cfa49d843c0c66ff9831e9d291f3710310462c\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782543009 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782543009 +0000\n\ndashboard: compare two recommendation runs\n\nAdd a \"Compare two runs\" mode to run history: pick any two\nrecommendation runs and see what changed — signed allocation deltas\n(stocks +10 pts, bonds -10 pts), plus picks added / removed / held.\nBacked by a pure diffRuns() helper (older -> newer ordering so deltas\nread as how the newer plan moved) with unit tests. Insights runs are\nnon-selectable in compare mode since only recommendations carry an\nallocation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQH4diwrR\nd8cfVYDp34uoMjUoxTCbZpsIQyLI7yW2Lmc02bbEGdnBRx7wepuwrN05BgXqhWbvrj4res6n/x3H\nNg4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-27T06:50:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.g