ved_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/c4cfa49d843c0c66ff9831e9d291f3710310462c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T23:25:11Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T23:25:11Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"onboarding: prefill saved profile + live allocation preview\n\nTwo gaps closed. (1) The form never loaded an existing profile, so\n\"Update my profile\" always showed defaults — now it prefills from the\nlocal stash and, when signed in, the authoritative profiles row. (2) The\nflat form gave no signal that choices matter — add a live target-mix\npreview driven by the same buildAllocation the pipeline uses, so the\nallocation bar updates instantly as age/risk/horizon/goal change. Risk\ntolerance becomes a tactile segmented control with plain-language hints.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2","tree":{"sha":"10238ab5092ac733313fe79b6f62fffc5fe9d7b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/10238ab5092ac733313fe79b6f62fffc5fe9d7b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/c4cfa49d843c0c66ff9831e9d291f3710310462c","verification":{"payload":"tree 10238ab5092ac733313fe79b6f62fffc5fe9d7b3\nparent dcc77c6cf0ca038acf514da6e3d656296bde0ea0\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782516311 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782516311 +0000\n\nonboarding: prefill saved profile + live allocation preview\n\nTwo gaps closed. (1) The form never loaded an existing profile, so\n\"Update my profile\" always showed defaults — now it prefills from the\nlocal stash and, when signed in, the authoritative profiles row. (2) The\nflat form gave no signal that choices matter — add a live target-mix\npreview driven by the same buildAllocation the pipeline uses, so the\nallocation bar updates instantly as age/risk/horizon/goal change. Risk\ntolerance becomes a tactile segmented control with plain-language hints.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPL+DUmU\nfuSwwEXKiA0vyVfAbXLDaFW31fJL1pKW14zsA8HAvEWqcGYLCN63p4iH8uRBV09akpRCsJzsUIgC\negc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-26T23:25:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ahdithanu/Compass/com