?id=<run> branch to GET /api/history that returns one run''s full stored\npayload (RLS- and user_id-scoped), and a RunDetailModal that re-renders\na past recommendation or insights digest read-only. Extract the\nrecommendation body into reusable sections so live and historical views\nshare one renderer. Escape-to-close and click-outside-to-dismiss.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2","tree":{"sha":"277a934eabf1567dd3eb184b8db505436f2e7c90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/277a934eabf1567dd3eb184b8db505436f2e7c90"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/dcc77c6cf0ca038acf514da6e3d656296bde0ea0","verification":{"payload":"tree 277a934eabf1567dd3eb184b8db505436f2e7c90\nparent 4e89fdeaf9a4c7e13b1489f7b3efdc8e606ffd4a\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782515997 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782515997 +0000\n\ndashboard: make run history browsable with a run-detail view\n\nEvery pipeline run already persists its full payload in the runs table,\nbut the UI only showed summary lines you couldn''t open. Add a\n?id=<run> branch to GET /api/history that returns one run''s full stored\npayload (RLS- and user_id-scoped), and a RunDetailModal that re-renders\na past recommendation or insights digest read-only. Extract the\nrecommendation body into reusable sections so live and historical views\nshare one renderer. Escape-to-close and click-outside-to-dismiss.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMKQwohJ\n1WklKyWJLoLtTREFvUA0XljCJB1GFcLmG3UWrzrdRtwWM4UqgjKHfQqeLfTIObxi8oNsJDA2n3