com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/4e89fdeaf9a4c7e13b1489f7b3efdc8e606ffd4a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T05:29:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T05:29:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"ci: add free-tier Semgrep SAST job; update security checklist\n\nAdd a non-blocking Semgrep SAST job to CI using free OSS rulesets\n(p/default, p/typescript, p/javascript, p/owasp-top-ten). Findings\nsurface in the step log; continue-on-error keeps it advisory until\ntriaged. Mark SAST done in the security checklist and reorder the\nrecommended next steps to flag which remaining items require paid tiers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2","tree":{"sha":"c412eddf13c990a3382b820ef6c8a662c3d459eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/c412eddf13c990a3382b820ef6c8a662c3d459eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/4e89fdeaf9a4c7e13b1489f7b3efdc8e606ffd4a","verification":{"payload":"tree c412eddf13c990a3382b820ef6c8a662c3d459eb\nparent 924d6ce8bc990b07c5307a8ff5478176a44b9541\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782106194 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782106194 +0000\n\nci: add free-tier Semgrep SAST job; update security checklist\n\nAdd a non-blocking Semgrep SAST job to CI using free OSS rulesets\n(p/default, p/typescript, p/javascript, p/owasp-top-ten). Findings\nsurface in the step log; continue-on-error keeps it advisory until\ntriaged. Mark SAST done in the security checklist and reorder the\nrecommended next steps to flag which remaining items require paid tiers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFR8Z9HD\nCSOD317AuU6JrAuA6qoRT+0OqwHTNafWQacZkLpUg28nRwIYa2xLn5O3bdnhwdaUPJ47Va7J/OWP\n0wA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-22T05:29:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ahdithanu/Compass/commit/4e89fdeaf9a4c7e13b1489f7b3efdc8e606ffd4a","node_id":"C_kwDOSS5DytoAKDRlODlmZGVhZjlhNGM3ZTEzYjE0ODlmN2IzZWZkYzhlNjA2ZmZkNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/a