prompt-injection, persistence, middleware,\ncookie handling, RLS policies). Codebase declared converged.\n\nOnly open findings were two Low storage-growth notes — closed by:\n- Per-user feed quota (max 50): count check before insert -> 422.\n- Per-run ingestion fan-out cap (slice feeds to 50) — bounds outbound\n  volume regardless of config.\n\n+1 quota test (112 total). Build + typecheck green. Remaining items are\nthe tracked decision/cost ones (SSO/MFA, distributed limiter, GHAS,\nenforce CSP, runs retention).","tree":{"sha":"28f4d6779939a47412cc6ab4518c90bca3b095fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/28f4d6779939a47412cc6ab4518c90bca3b095fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/924d6ce8bc990b07c5307a8ff5478176a44b9541","verification":{"payload":"tree 28f4d6779939a47412cc6ab4518c90bca3b095fd\nparent 9db5c8cc13168d9fc559ac19430aa97c9fe6538c\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782105049 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782105049 +0000\n\nThird-pass audit: converged; add per-user feed quota\n\nThird adversarial audit verified all batch-2 fixes are CORRECT (IPv6\nextractor empirically traced against URL normalization — mapped/compat/\nNAT64/deprecated/octal/hex all blocked, no false-positives; streamed cap\nnot bypassable; envLimit cannot disable the limiter) and the fresh sweep\nwas clean (log injection, prompt-injection, persistence, middleware,\ncookie handling, RLS policies). Codebase declared converged.\n\nOnly open findings were two Low storage-growth notes — closed by:\n- Per-user feed quota (max 50): count check before insert -> 422.\n- Per-run ingestion fan-out cap (slice feeds to 50) — bounds outbound\n  volume regardless of config.\n\n+1 quota test (112 total). Build + typecheck green. Remaining items are\nthe tracked decision/cost ones (SSO/MFA, distributed limiter, GHAS,\nenforce CSP, runs retention).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFOh2MOw\n3NuSPnpAt+KymT0nNrZijSVHcJdcQbZyn85KhL7CLi2umyqQnzXR4f8BUgDj1d+BRfmFAz85Sb1J\nEws=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-22T05:10:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ahdithanu/Compass/commit/924d6ce8bc990b07c5307a8ff5478176a44b9541","node_id":"C_kwDOSS5DytoAKDkyNGQ2Y2U4YmM5OTBiMDdjNTMwN2E4ZmY1NDc4MTc2YTQ0Yjk1NDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ahdithanu/Compass/commit/9db5c8cc13168d9fc559ac19430aa97c9fe6538c","sha":"9db5c8cc13168d9fc559ac19430aa97c9fe6538c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/9db5c8cc13168d9fc559ac19430aa97c9fe6538c"}],"sha":"924d6ce8bc990b07c5307a8ff5478176a44b9541","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/924d6ce8bc990b07c5307a8ff5478176a44b9541"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/9db5c8cc13168d9fc559ac19430aa97c9fe6538c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T02:31:45Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T02:31:45Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Second-pass audit fixes: IPv6-embedded SSRF, streamed size cap, env guard\n\nRe-audit confirmed the batch-1 fixes hold (redirect re-validation, IP\nencodings, rate-limit key, entity DoS, ReDoS) and found:\n- HIGH: isBlockedHost missed IPv4-compatible IPv6 (::a.b.c.d / ::a9fe:a9fe)\n  and NAT64 (64:ff9b::) forms wrapping the metadata IP. Add\n  extractEmbeddedV4 covering mapped/compatible/NAT64; block on the v4.\n- MED: feed body was fully buffered before the size check. Stream the\n  body with a hard byte cap (reader.cancel past the limit) + a\n  Content-Length pre-check; buffered fallback for non-stream responses.\n- LOW: rate-limit env values now guarded (NaN/<=0 -> safe default) so a\n  malformed override can''t fail-closed and block all traffic.\n\n+1 IPv6 SSRF test (111 total), incl. a public-IPv6 no-false-positive case.\nAudit re-confirmed clean: secrets, CSRF, IDOR/auth scoping, error leakage,\nredirect-loop mechanics, readJsonCapped. Build + typecheck green.","tree":{"sha":"895c29f5c7127b06fcd8249a5f75c9d7d944f64b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/895c29f5c7127b06fcd8249a5f75c9d7d944f64b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/9db5c8cc13168d9fc559ac19430aa97c9fe6538c","verification":{"payload":"tree 895c29f5c7127b06fcd8249a5f75c9d7d944f64b\nparent 7b4dd23266592ac645d35cda2216a4ed25678d8f\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782095505 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782095505 +0000\n\nSecond-pass audit fixes: IPv6-embedded SSRF, streamed size cap, env guard\n\nRe-audit confirmed the batch-1 fixes hold (redirect re-validation, IP\nencodings, rate-limit key, entity DoS, ReDoS) and found:\n- HIGH: isBlockedHost missed IPv4-compatible IPv6 (::a.b.c.d / ::a9fe:a9fe)\n  and NAT64 (64:ff9b::) forms wrapping the metadata IP. Add\n  extractEmbeddedV4 covering mapped/compatible/NAT64; block on the v4.\n- MED: feed body was fully buffered before the size check. Stream the\n  body with a hard byte cap (reader.cancel past the limit) + a\n  Content-Length pre-check; buffered fallback for non-stream responses.\n- LOW: rate-limit env values now guarded (NaN/<=0 -> safe default) so a\n  malformed override can''t fail-closed and block all traffic.\n\n+1 IPv6 SSRF test (111 total), incl. a public-IPv6 no-false-positive case.\nAudit re-confirmed clean: secrets, CSRF, IDOR/auth scoping, error leakage,\nredirect-loop mechanics, readJsonCapped. Build + typecheck green.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQF/wP46V\n/tvdFs1NAsedZhJtwrg6clNMJK5Yr4ZmrKb3j6aCnmuvj3OjeAqCq3ontFVNNkTc3JZln/3sOa1z\nOgc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-22T02:31:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ahdithanu/Compass/commit/9db5c8cc13168d9fc559ac19430aa97c9fe6538c","node_id":"C_kwDOSS5DytoAKDlkYjVjOGNjMTMxNjhkOWZjNTU5YWMxOTQzMGFhOTdjOWZlNjUzOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ahdithanu/Compass/commit/7b4dd23266592ac645d35cda2216a4ed25678d8f","sha":"7b4dd23266592ac645d35cda2216a4ed25678d8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/7b4dd23266592ac645d35cda2216a4ed25678d8f"}],"sha":"9db5c8cc13168d9fc559ac19430aa97c9fe6538c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/9db5c8cc13168d9fc559ac19430aa97c9fe6538c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/7b4dd23266592ac645d35cda2216a4ed25678d8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T02:21:59Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T02:21:59Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix security-audit findings: SSRF redirect/encoding bypass + XFF spoof\n\nFrom the looped security review:\n- C1 SSRF: feed ingestion now follows redirects MANUALLY and re-validates\n  each hop''s host against the blocklist (a feed could previously 30x to\n  169.254.169.254/metadata since only the add-time host was checked).\n- C2 SSRF: blocklist now parses IPs in every notation (decimal/hex/octal,\n  IPv4-mapped IPv6, expanded loopback) so http://2852039166/ etc. are caught.\n- H1: rate-limit key prefers the platform-set client IP\n  (x-vercel-forwarded-for/x-real-ip); a spoofed x-forwarded-for can no\n  longer rotate buckets to bypass limits on the LLM endpoints.\n- M1: XML parser entity processing disabled + 5MB feed-body cap (DoS).\n- M2: escape symbols before building the ticker RegExp (no ReDoS).\n\n+1 SSRF-encoding test (110 total). Build, typecheck green. Audit also\nconfirmed clean on secrets, CSRF, error-leakage, prototype pollution;\nRLS verified enabled on all tables earlier.","tree":{"sha":"b0eac9108f390dadad5e4e7f6c7519fff68596c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/b0eac9108f390dadad5e4e7f6c7519fff68596c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/7b4dd23266592ac645d35cda2216a4ed25678d8f","verification":{"payload":"tree b0eac9108f390dadad5e4e7f6c7519fff68596c9\nparent 52622b3b83bb9547f4f8a4bee2a26642c5ceff67\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782094919 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782094919 +0000\n\nFix security-audit findings: SSRF redirect/encoding bypass + XFF spoof\n\nFrom the looped security review:\n- C1 SSRF: feed ingestion now follows redirects MANUALLY and re-validates\n  each hop''s host against the blocklist (a feed could previously 30x to\n  169.254.169.254/metadata since only the add-time host was checked).\n- C2 SSRF: blocklist now parses IPs in every notation (decimal/hex/octal,\n  IPv4-mapped IPv6, expanded loopback) so http://2852039166/ etc. are caught.\n- H1: rate-limit key prefers the platform-set client IP\n  (x-vercel-forwarded-for/x-real-ip); a spoofed x-forwarded-for can no\n  longer rotate buckets to bypass limits on the LLM endpoints.\n- M1: XML parser entity processing disabled + 5MB feed-body cap (DoS).\n- M2: escape symbols before building the ticker RegExp (no ReDoS).\n\n+1 SSRF-encoding test (110 total). Build, typecheck green. Audit also\nconfirmed clean on secrets, CSRF, error-leakage, prototype pollution;\nRLS verified enabled on all tables earlier.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPU1BMBD\nbFZ/Pp4vP4h1Lac5Bg6KyU6dSIIVNotgI5IEZQoHhHuDhhHG1XvoBbNwzgOekVGXjrM2XOFs6s/q\nwwk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-22T02:22:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://gi