","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/52622b3b83bb9547f4f8a4bee2a26642c5ceff67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T02:13:55Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T02:13:55Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Enterprise security hardening (batch 1)\n\n- Security headers on every response: HSTS, X-Frame-Options, nosniff,\n  Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy; plus a CSP in Report-Only mode\n  (observe without breaking prod, enforce later).\n- Dependabot (weekly npm + actions PRs) and a CI security-audit job\n  (npm audit --omit=dev --audit-level=high; prod deps clean at high).\n- SECURITY.md responsible-disclosure policy.\n- docs/security-checklist.md: living enterprise posture tracker\n  (done/partial/todo) for security questionnaires.\n\nMulti-agent reasoning loop untouched. Build, typecheck, 109 tests green.","tree":{"sha":"741cdb3815d544b54fade706fa46265350624019","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/741cdb3815d544b54fade706fa46265350624019"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/52622b3b83bb9547f4f8a4bee2a26642c5ceff67","verification":{"payload":"tree 741cdb3815d544b54fade706fa46265350624019\nparent cd1f957cd260b233ab9744f74a9961bc69f8d653\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782094435 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782094435 +0000\n\nEnterprise security hardening (batch 1)\n\n- Security headers on every response: HSTS, X-Frame-Options, nosniff,\n  Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy; plus a CSP in Report-Only mode\n  (observe without breaking prod, enforce later).\n- Dependabot (weekly npm + actions PRs) and a CI security-audit job\n  (npm audit --omit=dev --audit-level=high; prod deps clean at high).\n- SECURITY.md responsible-disclosure policy.\n- docs/security-checklist.md: living enterprise posture tracker\n  (done/partial/todo) for security questionnaires.\n\nMulti-agent reasoning loop untouched. Build, typecheck, 109 tests green.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHz8z/+J\nQCH17aHrv6rbL9/BmerjcSSFdm0m4sVsLUB1mQ0Qi8U4qTepO+lcAZ2hvGYH2Pn5/eEwbcdPb7jA\nFQY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-22T02:13:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ahdithanu/Compass/commit/52622b3b83bb9547f4f8a4bee2a26642c5ceff67","node_id":"C_kwDOSS5DytoAKDUyNjIyYjNiODNiYjk1NDdmNGY4YTRiZWUyYTI2NjQyYzVjZWZmNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ahdithanu/Compass/commit/cd1f957cd260b233ab9744f74a9961bc69f8d653","sha":"cd1f957cd260b233ab9744f74a9961bc69f8d653","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/cd1f957cd260b233ab9744f74a9961bc69f8d653"}],"sha":"52622b3b83bb9547f4f8a4bee2a26642c5ceff67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/52622b3b83bb9547f4f8a4bee2a26642