827259d6107872974c66fdb689f4\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782091536 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782091536 +0000\n\nQuotes: support both Alpha Vantage and Finnhub\n\nMake the quote client provider-flexible: use ALPHAVANTAGE_API_KEY\n(GLOBAL_QUOTE) if set, else FINNHUB_API_KEY, else sample fallback. Both\nfree tiers cover US ETFs; handle rate-limit/no-data responses gracefully.\nUpdate env/README docs and gate tests against ALPHAVANTAGE_API_KEY.\n\nBuild, typecheck, 109 tests green.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHZJPUKo\npbC6kRh8yeaUXnp+iHSzRtibMRd8q01a723nfJiPFpeDpACMAuW7avbQhXEA/UJZjBudEkZXJGxi\nSgQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-22T01:25:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ahdithanu/Compass/commit/cd1f957cd260b233ab9744f74a9961bc69f8d653","node_id":"C_kwDOSS5DytoAKGNkMWY5NTdjZDI2MGIyMzNhYjk3NDRmNzRhOTk2MWJjNjlmOGQ2NTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ahdithanu/Compass/commit/406779d98339827259d6107872974c66fdb689f4","sha":"406779d98339827259d6107872974c66fdb689f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/406779d98339827259d6107872974c66fdb689f4"}],"sha":"cd1f957cd260b233ab9744f74a9961bc69f8d653","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/cd1f957cd260b233ab9744f74a9961bc69f8d653"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/406779d98339827259d6107872974c66fdb689f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T01:18:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T01:18:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix stale market-data check message (FMP -> FINNHUB)\n\nThe recommendation''s market_data_present check still named FMP_API_KEY\nin its fallback detail; update to FINNHUB_API_KEY to match the quote\nclient. Also forces a fresh deploy so a newly-added FINNHUB_API_KEY env\nvar binds to the running build.","tree":{"sha":"e2649f0625e18c0b01fa26bbe2c53edec919a810","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/e2649f0625e18c0b01fa26bbe2c53edec919a810"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/406779d98339827259d6107872974c66fdb689f4","verification":{"payload":"tree e2649f0625e18c0b01fa26bbe2c53edec919a810\nparent 5c22a63902181365fd3d8b042af35d23dba8db73\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782091116 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782091116 +0000\n\nFix stale market-data check message (FMP -> FINNHUB)\n\nThe recommendation''s market_data_present check still named FMP_API_KEY\nin its fallback detail; update to FINNHUB_API_KEY to match the quote\nclient. Also forces a fresh deploy so a newly-added FINNHUB_API_KEY env\nvar binds to the running build.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGQH0AUx\nJkm3Jnfj95RraGoARkmJS2FDZXydM6NgLeEA79k1oevDN8PhxBzH+DYLohgfleyncQrVlX0f6c4B\nwwQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-22T01:18:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ahdithanu/Compass/commit/406779d98339827259d6107872974c66fdb689f4","node_id":"C_kwDOSS5DytoAKDQwNjc3OWQ5ODMzOTgyNzI1OWQ2MTA3ODcyOTc0YzY2ZmRiNjg5ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ahdithanu/Compass/commit/5c22a63902181365fd3d8b042af35d23dba8db73","sha":"5c22a63902181365fd3d8b042af35d23dba8db73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/5c22a63902181365fd3d8b042af35d23dba8db73"}],"sha":"406779d98339827259d6107872974c66fdb689f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/406779d98339827259d6107872974c66fdb689f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/5c22a63902181365fd3d8b042af35d23dba8db73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T00:23:07Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T00:23:07Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Switch market quotes to Finnhub (free live ETF quotes)\n\nFMP gates all quote endpoints (legacy and /stable) behind paid plans, so\nmove quotes to Finnhub, whose free tier includes real-time US stock/ETF\nquotes. New lib/quotes.ts fetches each candidate ticker from\n/quote?symbol= in parallel (~5 per run, well under 60/min), keeps the\nsample fallback + names, and treats no-data ({c:0}) as a clean fallback.\nRepoint pipeline, drop lib/fmp.ts, gate tests against FINNHUB_API_KEY,\nand update env/README docs (FINNHUB_API_KEY for quotes; FMP now optional\nfor news).\n\nBuild, typecheck, 109 tests green.","tree":{"sha":"9bb3fa4aacbddc182cd5f513eccf024a582c015b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/9bb3fa4aacbddc182cd5f513eccf024a582c015b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/5c22a63902181365fd3d8b042af35d23dba8db73","verification":{"payload":"tree 9bb3fa4aacbddc182cd5f513eccf024a582c015b\nparent 3b3dffa098d464129ec0c6e606ff9079347f1191\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782087787 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782087787 +0000\n\nSwitch market quotes to Finnhub (free live ETF quotes)\n\nFMP gates all quote endpoints (legacy and /stable) behind paid plans, so\nmove quotes to Finnhub, whose free tier includes real-time US stock/ETF\nquotes. New lib/quotes.ts fetches each candidate ticker from\n/quote?symbol= in parallel (~5 per run, well under 60/min), keeps the\nsample fallback + names, and treats no-data ({c:0}) as a clean fallback.\nRepoint pipeline, drop lib/fmp.ts, gate tests against FINNHUB_API_KEY,\nand update env/README docs (FINNHUB_API_KEY for quotes; FMP now optional\nfor news).\n\nBuild, typecheck, 109 tests green.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQK3BSxIN\nndYk5MDWqfgYfCbL2VmOtsH+GwnY0ry31h/lM3/SlfAervm3YHIwa0nKHFonL1Mqs/ydhaZ/054Z\niQM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----"