","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/3b3dffa098d464129ec0c6e606ff9079347f1191/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T00:18:40Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T00:18:40Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Move FMP quote client to the /stable API\n\nThe legacy /api/v3/quote endpoint was retired for keys created after\n2025-08-31 (returns a 200 ''Legacy Endpoint'' error object). Switch to\n/stable/quote (one symbol per call, ~5 per recommendation), parse the\nstable field names, and treat any error-object / empty / gated response\nas a clean fallback to sample quotes. No-op on FMP''s free tier (ETF\nquotes are paid-only there) but correct + future-proof on an upgrade.\n\nBuild, typecheck, 109 tests green.","tree":{"sha":"24578d519447ef63bbfd6f524ad6b0dd9a5e4a9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/24578d519447ef63bbfd6f524ad6b0dd9a5e4a9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/3b3dffa098d464129ec0c6e606ff9079347f1191","verification":{"payload":"tree 24578d519447ef63bbfd6f524ad6b0dd9a5e4a9f\nparent ffabd6c9481ba4d13c9074c95814144a2027df76\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782087520 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782087520 +0000\n\nMove FMP quote client to the /stable API\n\nThe legacy /api/v3/quote endpoint was retired for keys created after\n2025-08-31 (returns a 200 ''Legacy Endpoint'' error object). Switch to\n/stable/quote (one symbol per call, ~5 per recommendation), parse the\nstable field names, and treat any error-object / empty / gated response\nas a clean fallback to sample quotes. No-op on FMP''s free tier (ETF\nquotes are paid-only there) but correct + future-proof on an upgrade.\n\nBuild, typecheck, 109 tests green.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQERK9cM1\nBgxgm9D2cxzpcsFRGvPhkAkE11jmFVPsyGl69DnsA8wmYUp7FKdNOXmyhzygqppvnqwtP78NrLQE\ntwM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-22T00:18:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ahdithanu/Compass/commit/3b3dffa098d464129ec0c6e606ff9079347f1191","node_id":"C_kwDOSS5DytoAKDNiM2RmZmEwOThkNDY0MTI5ZWMwYzZlNjA2ZmY5MDc5MzQ3ZjExOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ahdithanu/Compass/commit/ffabd6c9481ba4d13c9074c95814144a2027df76","sha":"ffabd6c9481ba4d13c9074c95814144a2027df76","url":"https: