{"date":"2026-06-21T18:25:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Landing page: sticky nav, OG share image, staggered reveals\n\n- Add a sticky SiteNav that turns frosted (blur + border) once scrolled,\n  with a persistent ''Build my plan'' CTA.\n- Generate a branded OG/Twitter share image (dark + green) via next/og,\n  and add openGraph/twitter metadata + metadataBase so links preview well.\n- Stagger the feature and how-it-works cards (per-card Reveal delay) for a\n  cascade instead of a single block fade.\n\nBuild (incl. OG prerender), typecheck, 109 tests green.","tree":{"sha":"12bdc731aa5737a4607d68d2b8d19240c92d3131","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/12bdc731aa5737a4607d68d2b8d19240c92d3131"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/43a112949c25ad6033d62005cac34b79e5254976","verification":{"payload":"tree 12bdc731aa5737a4607d68d2b8d19240c92d3131\nparent ec90c5927ec10c1c49b3eadfaa8396c238318194\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782066343 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782066343 +0000\n\nLanding page: sticky nav, OG share image, staggered reveals\n\n- Add a sticky SiteNav that turns frosted (blur + border) once scrolled,\n  with a persistent ''Build my plan'' CTA.\n- Generate a branded OG/Twitter share image (dark + green) via next/og,\n  and add openGraph/twitter metadata + metadataBase so links preview well.\n- Stagger the feature and how-it-works cards (per-card Reveal delay) for a\n  cascade instead of a single block fade.\n\nBuild (incl. OG prerender), typecheck, 109 tests green.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBIo61SF\narE7QPcKiTDCXB1cN4W+ZfaR0TYEAumdYPCJtiyeDmgTRuHr5RAhQqJfvrJIP8aIP/fOh+PffpQc\nSwk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-21T18:25:4