ht\n  green stat numbers, breaking up the all-white scroll.\n- Add a .lift hover utility and apply it to the marketing cards.\n\nBuild, typecheck, 109 tests green.","tree":{"sha":"9609ad6286bb746c40029fea2e56851a8803971b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/9609ad6286bb746c40029fea2e56851a8803971b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/b50a293ee9ee984760d04d10157b0e44b8113715","verification":{"payload":"tree 9609ad6286bb746c40029fea2e56851a8803971b\nparent a230ee8d8756950b2e17645200bf74966acdb83c\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782065708 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782065708 +0000\n\nRefine landing page: product preview + dark trust band\n\n- Add an illustrative product-preview card under the hero (browser\n  chrome, green allocation bar, big stat tiles, two pick rows with\n  green/red change chips) so the page shows the product, not just\n  describes it. Labeled illustrative — no implied real recommendations.\n- Convert the trust band to a Robinhood-style black panel with bright\n  green stat numbers, breaking up the all-white scroll.\n- Add a .lift hover utility and apply it to the marketing cards.\n\nBuild, typecheck, 109 tests green.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJ3FxQwq\ne8J76c0e3+Rzi0IFz4BMM1bi+0NfzzhwKc98+anBc0ft7xu8NC9rUC544wDEq88ToquggV7ABahc\npQk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-21T18:15:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"",