give the auth status message proper tone (errors -> --danger,\nthe signup confirmation -> --positive) instead of always ochre. Home:\nbalance the hero headline for cleaner serif line wrapping. Home/login\nalready inherit the warm palette + serif headings via the shared tokens.\n\nTypecheck + build green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2","tree":{"sha":"7c315dae281c82954d010e76ef995bd43556cdc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/7c315dae281c82954d010e76ef995bd43556cdc8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/36e84ef2dce8f29a6d78e10fa5fdd9dbf8d0d811","verification":{"payload":"tree 7c315dae281c82954d010e76ef995bd43556cdc8\nparent 2d9bfc47a5e0846d8536782600872dbff66b6b57\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781983901 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781983901 +0000\n\nPolish home + login for the Claude theme\n\nLogin: give the auth status message proper tone (errors -> --danger,\nthe signup confirmation -> --positive) instead of always ochre. Home:\nbalance the hero headline for cleaner serif line wrapping. Home/login\nalready inherit the warm palette + serif headings via the shared tokens.\n\nTypecheck + build green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAmE2kUZ\nwKoVF6ypbwlNOo9ioIdyjWI3eHf0EK8HzBGgvaIM4S+frxTZZmoxR2Ulv9gPlPLD8qDhQiMxG8HM\nFw4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-20T19:31:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}",