ient cases. 98 -> 109; typecheck + build green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2","tree":{"sha":"c0f3f99bc8739b19f2e7889e7dd3a10efe3ae84c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/c0f3f99bc8739b19f2e7889e7dd3a10efe3ae84c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/823d5d6fdb6983a195b323909fc1877c2c41645e","verification":{"payload":"tree c0f3f99bc8739b19f2e7889e7dd3a10efe3ae84c\nparent a4ba6cc92780aa9d0c85dee338a6de54c0068375\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781982686 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781982686 +0000\n\nAdd typed client-side API helper + surface request ids in the UI\n\nIntroduce lib/apiClient.ts (apiGet/apiPost/apiDelete) returning a\ndiscriminated ApiResult<T> with parsed data, the server x-request-id,\nfriendly per-status fallback messages, and network-failure handling.\nRefactor the dashboard and sources pages off raw fetch onto it, and show\nthe request id in error messages via withRef so users can quote a ref.\n\nTests: +11 hermetic apiClient cases. 98 -> 109; typecheck + build green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIRFiket\ngMA3H8WyhUZVmvjPIeyyRjGRNcSDhKTABYfQ44W7BdwCfaSkGS4yDx//aT4epplF4rIvrLAA7PMo\nug0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-20T19:11:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/f