"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/a4ba6cc92780aa9d0c85dee338a6de54c0068375/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T17:01:09Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T17:01:09Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Type Supabase access against the live schema\n\nGenerate src/lib/supabase/database.types.ts from the live project and\ninstantiate both clients as createClient<Database>, so every\n.from().select/insert is checked against real columns. Replace the\nhand-rolled UserFeedRow with Tables<''user_feeds''>, type getUserFeeds''\nclient, and cast the JSON payload column explicitly in persistence.\n\nUpgrade @supabase/supabase-js 2.47->2.108 and @supabase/ssr 0.5->0.12\n(same-major, required for the Postgrest 14.5 typed-client generic). Add\nthe db:types regen script. Build, typecheck, and all 98 tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2","tree":{"sha":"97f1c4b8ec18b44d7477b6c521cac1845867a23d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/97f1c4b8ec18b44d7477b6c521cac1845867a23d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/a4ba6cc92780aa9d0c85dee338a6de54c0068375","verification":{"payload":"tree 97f1c4b8ec18b44d7477b6c521cac1845867a23d\nparent 6ac29812967b9d5567af52e546991757735c3744\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781974869 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781974869 +0000\n\nType Supabase access against the live schema\n\nGenerate src/lib/supabase/database.types.ts from the live project and\ninstantiate both clients as createClient<Database>, so every\n.from().select/insert is checked against real columns. Replace the\nhand-rolled UserFeedRow with Tables<''user_feeds''>, type getUserFeeds''\nclient, and cast the JSON payload column explicitly in persistence.\n\nUpgrade @supabase/supabase-js 2.47->2.108 and @supabase/ssr 0.5->0.12\n(same-major, required for the Postgrest 14.5 typed-client generic). Add\nthe db:types regen script. Build, typecheck, and all 98 tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQD0uu2JP\nSsgxtXJ7e3MeoWbdI/su0dKARTbsKv3DjjfOquqHEHDLUu0aOMWsz9E88I3KmYCrtA29YebzJJ+w\n+w8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-20T17:01:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ahdithanu/Compass/commit/a4ba6cc92780aa9d0c85dee338a6de54c0068375","node_id":"C_kwDOSS5DytoAKGE0YmE2Y2M5Mjc4MGFhOWQwYzg1ZGVlMzM4YTZkZTU0YzAwNjgzNzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ahdithanu/Compass/commit/6ac29812967b9d5567af52e546991757735c3744","sha":"6ac29812967b9d5567af52e546991757735c3744","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/6ac29812967b9d5567af52e546991757735c3744"}],"sha":"a4ba6cc92780aa9d0c85dee338a6de54c0068375","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/a4ba6cc92780aa9d0c85dee338a6de54c0068375"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/6ac29812967b9d5567af52e546991757735c3744/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T16:53:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T16:53:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add request-id correlation + structured logging to API routes\n\nIntroduce lib/api.ts withRequest wrapper: stamps every response with an\nx-request-id (honoring a sane client-supplied one), emits structured\nrequest/response log lines via observability, and turns uncaught handler\nerrors into a clean 500 that echoes the id. Wrap all routes\n(recommendations, insights, feeds GET/POST/DELETE, history); also extend\nthe feed rate limit to DELETE. Pipeline routes now re-throw unexpected\nerrors to the wrapper instead of ad-hoc console.error + 500.\n\nTests: +4 (header present, client id honored, junk id ignored, uncaught\n-> 500 with id) and existing GET tests updated to pass a Request.\n94 -> 98; build + typecheck green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2","tree":{"sha":"15a9e6e4a54a62d44ee7cb90d3ba7644d0f527b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/15a9e6e4a54a62d44ee7cb90d3ba7644d0f527b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/6ac29812967b9d5567af52e546991757735c3744","verification":{"payload":"tree 15a9e6e4a54a62d44ee7cb90d3ba7644d0f527b7\nparent 1c79dcb13fc35304c6325ed1f4d1b89898a976ac\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781974432 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781974432 +0000\n\nAdd request-id correlation + structured logging to API routes\n\nIntroduce lib/api.ts withRequest wrapper: stamps every response with an\nx-request-id (honoring a sane client-supplied one), emits structured\nrequest/response log lines via observability, and turns uncaught handler\nerrors into a clean 500 that echoes the id. Wrap all routes\n(recommendations, insights, feeds GET/POST/DELETE, history); also extend\nthe feed rate limit to DELETE. Pipeline routes now re-throw unexpected\nerrors to the wrapper instead of ad-hoc console.error + 500.\n\nTests: +4 (header present, client id honored, junk id ignored, uncaught\n-> 500 with id) and existing GET tests updated to pass a Request.\n94 -> 98; build + typecheck green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAA