thub.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/1c79dcb13fc35304c6325ed1f4d1b89898a976ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T02:12:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T02:12:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Harden POST routes: per-client rate limiting + body-size caps\n\nAdd lib/ratelimit.ts (fixed-window, per-client/per-route limiter with\nRetry-After) and lib/http.ts (16KB body cap -> 413, standard 429/413\nresponses), and wire them into /api/recommendations, /api/insights and\n/api/feeds. Cap feed URLs at 2KB in validateFeed. Limits default to\n20/min (pipelines) and 30/min (feed writes), overridable via env.\n\nTests: 17 new (rate limiter + body cap units, route-level 429/413,\nper-client isolation, URL-length cap). 77 -> 94, build + typecheck green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2","tree":{"sha":"97bed54bddda3019840106dd1dd4579e40a289c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/97bed54bddda3019840106dd1dd4579e40a289c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/g