pic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T17:31:29Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add end-to-end feed-precedence test\n\nDrives runInsightsPipeline and asserts the source-selection ladder for\nwhich newsletter feeds get fetched: per-user feeds > NEWSLETTER_FEEDS\n(env) > curated defaults. With no FMP key the only fetches come from\ningestion, so precedence is read straight off the fetch call list; also\nverifies an empty user list falls through to env/defaults and that the\nwinning feed''s items reach the digest. +4 tests (73 -> 77).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2","tree":{"sha":"893fc8ec3873f113ace992bcd6d0574fdf487173","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/893fc8ec3873f113ace992bcd6d0574fdf487173"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/cad8da66b2cfa3710d859d2f369ff0be7958b467","verification":{"payload":"tree 893fc8ec3873f113ace992bcd6d0574fdf487173\nparent 9cac55a6c2de49367a8bbe11084b5d89c057d630\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781890289 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781890289 +0000\n\nAdd end-to-end feed-precedence test\n\nDrives runInsightsPipeline and asserts the source-selection ladder for\nwhich newsletter feeds get fetched: per-user feeds > NEWSLETTER_FEEDS\n(env) > curated defaults. With no FMP key the only fetches come from\ningestion, so precedence is read straight off the fetch call list; also\nverifies an empty user list falls through to env/defaults and that the\nwinning feed''s items reach the digest. +4 tests (73 -> 77).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1U