commendations, /api/insights and /api/history.\nSupabase, the pipelines and persistence are mocked so the handlers\nrun hermetically. +21 tests (52 -> 73).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2","tree":{"sha":"816343ed7826961cf5bf6faa14935080f029a11d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/816343ed7826961cf5bf6faa14935080f029a11d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/commits/339e05a4706e9b1430de869be166e836bd2853bb","verification":{"payload":"tree 816343ed7826961cf5bf6faa14935080f029a11d\nparent dfded9ddf61fcaca7fdeedcc51946841a2f522cb\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781853046 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781853046 +0000\n\nAdd API route-handler test suite\n\nCovers the glue layer around the pipelines: auth gating, request\nvalidation, status-code/error mapping and DB-result handling for\n/api/feeds, /api/recommendations, /api/insights and /api/history.\nSupabase, the pipelines and persistence are mocked so the handlers\nrun hermetically. +21 tests (52 -> 73).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJF0253f\n/bXlp1QcKcbj0hh2SyiV5co0ByaPNfYPhdlqn+8MIPSAkPIvkJxabTCmjwg4kCLfaEurJyIoUcIL\nOw8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-19T07:10:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://ap