/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/commits/38f0e6f5b2bf3f4b536a7948de8b330b17bf5827/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T01:36:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T01:36:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Persist run history + checker audit log\n\n- Supabase tables: runs (full payload + summary) and run_checks (one row per\n  checker gate), both with row-level security scoped to the owner.\n- persistence.ts: best-effort write of each recommendation/insights run and its\n  checks; never throws, skips anonymous/demo runs.\n- Wired into both API routes after generation.\n- GET /api/history returns a signed-in user''s recent runs (empty for demo).\n- Dashboard: collapsible \"Run history\" panel; refetches after generating.\n- schema.sql updated to match.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N83uEBBrTrwF9KY8ZXcze2","tree":{"sha":"bea0ab3388f790e7c021321bfe550068e705a6a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahdithanu/Compass/git/trees/bea0ab3388f790e7c021321bfe550068e705a6a0"},"url":"