","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/1a1a1972347973e3f3604f027d34db598beed483/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T03:42:18Z","email":"sunpeng@hiqlcd.com","name":"孙鹏"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T03:42:18Z","email":"sunpeng@hiqlcd.com","name":"孙鹏"},"message":"fix(session): 空思考块不再渲染「内容被加密」占位\n\nOpus 4.7/4.8 把思考块持久化为「空明文 + 加密 signature」（明文不落盘，\n只留重放令牌），原来空块也渲染、展开提示「内容被加密」是无意义空壳。\n改为解析阶段直接跳过空思考块（与 search-session 已有行为一致），\n仅当 thinking 有明文时（如 Sonnet 4.6 会话）才渲染——对齐参考实现。\n\n- server/lib/load-session.ts: thinking 为空不再 push\n- web/src/components/ToolBlock.tsx: 删掉 hasText 分支与加密占位\n- web/src/lib/i18n.ts: 删掉用不到的 tool.thinkingEncrypted（zh+en）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"788e02738c4fbf67c40e60b54d9c81c642be6944","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/788e02738c4fbf67c40e60b54d9c81c642be6944"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/1a1a1972347973e3f3604f027d34db598beed483","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6