d17137a1bd8c0fda1022c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/abd7770cb6a9a82852d17137a1bd8c0fda1022c8"}],"sha":"731be04ef1716201cd80c2485a25742ffca564d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/731be04ef1716201cd80c2485a25742ffca564d6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/abd7770cb6a9a82852d17137a1bd8c0fda1022c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T01:54:02Z","email":"sunpeng@192.168.1.240","name":"孙鹏"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T01:54:02Z","email":"sunpeng@192.168.1.240","name":"孙鹏"},"message":"feat(session): 「修改的文件」改为内容区右侧拆分面板，不再开新标签\n\n点页脚「修改的文件」不再 window.open 独立整页，改为复用会话流文件预览那套\n右侧拆分栏：内容区一分为二，右侧铺本会话变更文件清单（单列 master-detail——\n列表态文件树，点文件切到左旧右新合并 diff，返回键回列表）。\n\n- SessionDetail：右栏状态升级为互斥联合 {kind:''file''|''modified''}，文件卡预览与\n  修改文件清单同栖一栏、二选一；页脚按钮改 toggle + 按下态高亮；新增 open-file\n  mutation。宽屏=可拖宽侧栏，窄屏=修改文件清单接管整片内容区（文件预览仍 lg+）。\n- ModifiedFilesView.tsx → 重命名 ModifiedFilesPanel.tsx：复用 buildTree/TreeRow/\n  FileDetail/buildFileRows，砍掉整页三栏壳 / 对话栏 / fixed 模态 / 内置 Splitter\n  / 滚动跟随（净 -296 行）。\n- 删 ModifiedFilesPage.tsx + App.tsx 的 /modified 路由与 lazy import（死代码）。\n- i18n 加 session.modified.backToList（中/英）。\n\n验证：npm run typecheck / build / test 全绿（61/61）；build 产物已无\nModifiedFilesPage chunk，确认路由摘除生效。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8faf5d9e183fe0671000b9e65b4f6ee34199495f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/8faf5d9e183fe0671000b9e65b4f6ee34199495f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/abd7770cb6a9a82852d17137a1bd8c0fda1022c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/abd7770cb6a9a82852d17137a1bd8c0fda1022c8","node_id":"C_kwDOSTCADNoAKGFiZDc3NzBjYjZhOWE4Mjg1MmQxNzEzN2ExYmQ4YzBmZGExMDIyYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/2ddaa185450bedb5fde32943244e635a22c9268a","sha":"2ddaa185450bedb5fde32943244e635a22c9268a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/2ddaa185450bedb5fde32943244e635a22c9268a"}],"sha":"abd7770cb6a9a82852d17137a1bd8c0fda1022c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/abd7770cb6a9a82852d17137a1bd8c0fda1022c8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/2ddaa185450bedb5fde32943244e635a22c9268a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T01:21:38Z","email":"sunpeng@192.168.1.240","name":"孙鹏"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T01:21:38Z","email":"sunpeng@192.168.1.240","name":"孙鹏"},"message":"feat(ui): 左侧侧栏底部卡片改为 footer 平铺 + hairline 分隔\n\n去掉 surface-card 卡片盒（边框/圆角/底色/阴影/左右外边距），改为\n顶部一条 hairline 分隔、贴侧栏 sunken 底色平铺的 <footer>，与既有\n页脚约定（ExportDialog / VersionNotice / SessionDetail）一致，也符合\n设计系统「surface-card 仅留给真实卡片面」的规则。内容（语言/主题/\n版本/footnote）原样保留。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a08785c69503d7668b2bde85dc21b98103be07f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/2a08785c69503d7668b2bde85dc21b98103be07f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/2ddaa185450bedb5fde32943244e635a22c9268a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/2ddaa185450bedb5fde32943244e635a22c9268a","node_id":"C_kwDOSTCADNoAKDJkZGFhMTg1NDUwYmVkYjVmZGUzMjk0MzI0NGU2MzVhMjJjOTI2OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/e1f289a810b2a3338ecc6999a093d4dafb0b160a","sha":"e1f289a810b2a3338ecc6999a093d4dafb0b160a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/e1f289a810b2a3338ecc6999a093d4dafb0b160a"}],"sha":"2ddaa185450bedb5fde32943244e635a22c9268a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/2ddaa185450bedb5fde32943244e635a22c9268a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/e1f289a810b2a3338ecc6999a093d4dafb0b160a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T00:50:00Z","email":"sunpeng@192.168.1.240","name":"孙鹏"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T00:50:00Z","email":"sunpeng@192.168.1.240","name":"孙鹏"},"message":"feat(session): 会话页打开文件预览时自动收起左侧侧栏\n\n点会话流文件卡拆出右侧预览时，临时收起左侧侧栏让出宽度，关闭预览/切换会话/\n离开本页即恢复用户原本的折叠偏好。\n\n实现：把侧栏折叠状态从 Sidebar 内部提升到 ChromeLayout——\n- web/src/lib/sidebar.ts（新）：抽出 useCollapsedState（持久化用户偏好）+\n  SidebarContext（仅暴露临时 setAutoCollapsed，不持久化）\n- App.tsx：实际折叠 = 用户偏好 || 自动收起；用户主动展开时一并清掉自动收起态\n- Sidebar.tsx：改为从 props 接收 collapsed/setCollapsed\n- SessionDetail.tsx：随 paneOpen 置/清 setAutoCollapsed（cleanup 兜底离开本页）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"da21b35a05bb02bfb13c7f8803661c98073ce9df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/da21b35a05bb02bfb13c7f8803661c98073ce9df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/e1f289a810b2a3338ecc6999a093d4dafb0b160a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/e1f289a810b2a3338ecc6999a093d4dafb0b160a","node_id":"C_kwDOSTCADNoAKGUxZjI4OWE4MTBiMmEzMzM4ZWNjNjk5OWEwOTNkNGRhZmIwYjE2MGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/d99c600199c0b996ea0158858ba049b97045c72c","sha":"d99c600199c0b996ea0158858ba049b97045c72c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/d99c600199c0b996ea0158858ba049b97045c72c"}],"sha":"e1f289a810b2a3338ecc6999a093d4dafb0b160a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/e1f289a810b2a3338ecc6999a093d4dafb0b160a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/d99c600199c0b996ea0158858ba049b97045c72c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T17:05:16Z","email":"peng_zzu@163.com","name":"zzusp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T17:05:16Z","email":"peng_zzu@163.com","name":"zzusp"},"message":"feat(session): 会话页铺满右侧 + 页脚分隔/1M 上下文 + 命令/Read/思考展示优化\n\n- 布局: header/content/footer 铺满右侧主区，移除 max-w-6xl 外壳；各层自定 padding\n  (header px-4 / content px-8 lg:px-12 / footer px-6)\n- 预览面板: 去圆角/边距/阴影，贴满中间层 (左侧分隔线由 Splitter 画)\n- 页脚: 左侧各字段间加竖发丝线分隔符 (FooterDivider)\n- 上下文上限: 默认 1M，仅 Haiku / Claude 3.x / 2.x 退回 200K\n- 命令消息: <command-name> 等 XML 解析为命令胶囊 (CommandMessage)，不再裸渲染\n- Read: 退回「读取 + 路径」动词折叠行，不再用文件卡 / 右侧预览\n- 思考: 改为工具调用式轻量折叠 (无条状边框)，展开正文落浅卡片\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"84930f6bf86de73827a05d04c2522c411f78e121","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/84930f6bf86de73827a05d04c2522c411f78e121"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/d99c600199c0b996ea0158858ba049b97045c72c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/d99c600199c0b996ea0158858ba049b97045c72c","node_id":"C_kwDOSTCADNoAKGQ5OWM2MDAxOTljMGI5OTZlYTAxNTg4NThiYTA0OWI5NzA0NWM3MmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/cc0628e8c097f5642086c9235e5b94d976c1e518","sha":"cc0628e8c097f5642086c9235e5b94d976c1e518","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/cc0628e8c097f5642086c9235e5b94d976c1e518"}],"sha":"d99c600199c0b996ea0158858ba049b97045c72c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/d99c600199c0b996ea0158858ba049b97045c72c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/cc0628e8c097f5642086c9235e5b94d976c1e518/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T15:45:33Z","email":"645541506@qq.com","name":"Aaron Sun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T15:45:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ui): 工具调用内联返回 + PowerShell 对齐 Bash + 会话页三层定高布局 (#75)\n\n三处会话页改动（纯前端表现层 + 布局结构，server/wire 不变）：\n\n1. 工具调用↔返回配对：tool_result 按 toolUseId 内联到调用块展开体尾部\n   （命令/参数 + 空行 + 返回），并行调用各自配对，移除独立「工具」标头消息。\n   - SessionDetail：indexed 剔除可配对的纯 result 消息并把正文折进拥有 tool_use\n     的消息 haystack（保搜索命中）；resultLookup→toolResults{content,isError}；\n     hasError 认 tool_use 配对返回的 isError；新增 focusRedirect 修全局搜索命中\n     tool_result 后的 deep-link 失焦。\n   - MessageBubble：新增可选 toolResults 透传到 ToolUseBlock。\n   - ToolBlock：ToolUseBlock 新增 result，展开体尾部渲染 PairedResult。\n\n2. PowerShell 对齐 Bash：toolVerb/toolSummary/buildToolBody 各加 case ''PowerShell''\n   （折叠「运行+description」、展开终端命令块 + 配对返回）。\n\n3. 三层定高布局：右侧内容改页头/中间/页脚三层，中间层内部滚动、左右拆分，预览面板\n   self-stretch 填满中间层，不压页脚、滚到底不脱离（原 sticky 叠加伪三层实测重叠 55px）。\n   - App.tsx：会话路由走 fullBleed 全高外壳。\n   - SessionDetail：section 定高 flex 列，topbar/footer shrink-0，时间线内部滚动容器\n     scrollRef，aside self-stretch，滚动逻辑从 window 改 scrollRef。\n   - Splitter：抓手改分割条内居中。\n\n验证：typecheck + 61 单测全过；Playwright 量盒子 header{0..53}/aside{65..909}/\nfooter{921..1000}（不重叠、窗口不滚、滚动后三层不动）；错误过滤/搜索 result 正文/\nfocus 重定向均通过；修改文件页 0 报错。证据见 docs/acceptance/session-tool-pairing-layout/。\n\nCo-authored-by: zzusp <peng_zzu@163.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7b52979a55bdceff012f5b5ec0c33e5414e68c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/f7b52979a55bdceff012f5b5ec0c33e5414e68c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/cc0628e8c097f5642086c9235e5b94d976c1e518","verification":{"payload":"tree f7b52979a55bdceff012f5b5ec0c33e5414e68c1\nparent f9772aa8928606e46c4d17fe47d699bbdee43efc\nauthor Aaron Sun <645541506@qq.com> 1781279133 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781279133 +0800\n\nfeat(ui): 工具调用内联返回 + PowerShell 对齐 Bash + 会话页三层定高布局 (#75)\n\n三处会话页改动（纯前端表现层 + 布局结构，server/wire 不变）：\n\n1. 工具调用↔返回配对：tool_result 按 toolUseId 内联到调用块展开体尾部\n   （命令/参数 + 空行 + 返回），并行调用各自配对，移除独立「工具」标头消息。\n   - SessionDetail：indexed 剔除可配对的纯 result 消息并把正文折进拥有 tool_use\n     的消息 haystack（保搜索命中）；resultLookup→toolResults{content,isError}；\n     hasError 认 tool_use 配对返回的 isError；新增 focusRedirect 修全局搜索命中\n     tool_result 后的 deep-link 失焦。\n   - MessageBubble：新增可选 toolResults 透传到 ToolUseBlock。\n   - ToolBlock：ToolUseBlock 新增 result，展开体尾部渲染 PairedResult。\n\n2. PowerShell 对齐 Bash：toolVerb/toolSummary/buildToolBody 各加 case ''PowerShell''\n   （折叠「运行+description」、展开终端命令块 + 配对返回）。\n\n3. 三层定高布局：右侧内容改页头/中间/页脚三层，中间层内部滚动、左右拆分，预览面板\n   self-stretch 填满中间层，不压页脚、滚到底不脱离（原 sticky 叠加伪三层实测重叠 55px）。\n   - App.tsx：会话路由走 fullBleed 全高外壳。\n   - SessionDetail：section 定高 flex 列，topbar/footer shrink-0，时间线内部滚动容器\n     scrollRef，aside self-stretch，滚动逻辑从 window 改 scrollRef。\n   - Splitter：抓手改分割条内居中。\n\n验证：typecheck + 61 单测全过；Playwright 量盒子 header{0..53}/aside{65..909}/\nfooter{921..1000}（不重叠、窗口不滚、滚动后三层不动）；错误过滤/搜索 result 正文/\nfocus 重定向均通过；修改文件页 0 报错。证据见 docs/acceptance/session-tool-pairing-layout/。\n\nCo-authored-by: zzusp <peng_zzu@163.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLCmdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANBIQAIsVAxsljM5R6m/j1YeaanLx\n51gasG9+7sDuCHlk4jN+4l93PD1ru0RhQsTcMgOMtMXJmkWIUtc2AIVG7vTV0Mv2\ncfcRVLEN4VjFR7nB85G6AJQxtxUTz5ftk5SgANXEysMjduYiIe5Abyw9AREDSWDX\n1tBugZJ1+9kgrqiiWfYpZO5Rn/GiCe4B8XS+AKPW1VlkSg+eiOH0HFEua8YrMTRG\nJaYxaTtu+rtSh4RSUyj6fMU9BJMyTJdsqQ4yB7lR/H995j7BMs3lEM101FInjxlC\nmtdRnQv/qVI9P11r/qMYyXHPn/KWJ8+gxRxSSvKpgjfmmhIy06+szZYeZXdG6Y5Z\nAq5yV4jqta6u9kdSgjoMMGzTXbv0A5ul+DShKdS8rPfUX1gbSfjQUl1fi+qfCUE5\nTIDALcK6k+HJDmXFvefX1WaqSbdtr8jOe5YB8ilzC7wFhUrKFvjO2ZA4jzFk/zUu\nzYU+cp5ipF0oe2EESPkn0tIZ0Y3D7WCkz6Dnh+RBBZcYf5SKc7y+wAu3B2vIqHi8\no96iwQphig8uFSBJ8vNau4PpbxKHtT/XPrJH+BvgbajVaCz41urXf3TdamyoLRZ7\nReCHxHDI9etTk1IxTTL8vu9Ux1ZbjR064cBfugiA0hz2jMf6495Nd7ugN374LqKu\n+Z+8wEjmiiFhjpQk4HtD\n=fLD/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-12T15:45:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https:/