"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T14:06:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ui): 会话消息文件卡点击在右侧拆出可调宽文件预览面板 (#73)\n\n点击会话时间线里的文件卡（Read/Write/Edit/MultiEdit/NotebookEdit），从内容区\n右侧拆出一栏铺该文件，不再行内展开、也不是弹窗；左侧时间线随之收窄，中间分割线\n可拖拽调宽，并带一枚随视口竖直居中的抓手（sticky，长会话里随处可拖）。\n\n- Read/Write/NotebookEdit → 文件正文（行号网格，复用 Read 自带行号）；\n  Edit/MultiEdit → 左右对照 diff。数据全取自已加载的会话消息，不发二次请求。\n- 面板 sticky 钉在顶栏之下、页脚之上，滚动会话时始终在视野里。\n- 再次点同一张卡 / Esc / 关闭按钮收起；仅 lg+ 视口启用拆分，更窄视口退回行内展开。\n- 抽出共享 SplitDiff 组件（从 ModifiedFilesView 提取）+ 新增可拖拽 Splitter；\n  文件卡通过 FilePreviewContext 把「打开预览」回调下发到深层 ToolBlock。\n\n验证（worktree dev:5173 + 缓存版 chromium 真机驱动）：54 张文件卡→点击出面板\n(width 480, 标题=文件名, 卡选中态)；拖分割线 480→636；滚动 1800px 后面板 top=53\n仍钉住；再点收起回到单栏；窄屏 820px 无 aria-pressed 卡、点击不出面板（行内回退）；\nEdit 卡→面板两栏 diff。typecheck + build + 61 server 测试全过。\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e9b38daf32d3e565a273c232c70c035e5c26904a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/e9b38daf32d3e565a273c232c70c035e5c26904a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/f9772aa8928606e46c4d17fe47d699bbdee43efc","verification":{"payload":"tree e9b38daf32d3e565a273c232c70c035e5c26904a\nparent 77b53353096d3e1297c2b2751978a322b59e87a0\nauthor Aaron Sun <645541506@qq.com> 1781273180 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781273180 +0800\n\nfeat(ui): 会话消息文件卡点击在右侧拆出可调宽文件预览面板 (#73)\n\n点击会话时间线里的文件卡（Read/Write/Edit/MultiEdit/NotebookEdit），从内容区\n右侧拆出一栏铺该文件，不再行内展开、也不是弹窗；左侧时间线随之收窄，中间分割线\n可拖拽调宽，并带一枚随视口竖直居中的抓手（sticky，长会话里随处可拖）。\n\n- Read/Write/NotebookEdit → 文件正文（行号网格，复用 Read 自带行号）；\n  Edit/MultiEdit → 左右对照 diff。数据全取自已加载的会话消息，不发二次请求。\n- 面板 sticky 钉在顶栏之下、页脚之上，滚动会话时始终在视野里。\n- 再次点同一张卡 / Esc / 关闭按钮收起；仅 lg+ 视口启用拆分，更窄视口退回行内展开。\n- 抽出共享 SplitDiff 组件（从 ModifiedFilesView 提取）+ 新增可拖拽 Splitter；\n  文件卡通过 FilePreviewContext 把「打开预览」回调下发到深层 ToolBlock。\n\n验证（worktree dev:5173 + 缓存版 chromium 真机驱动）：54 张文件卡→点击出面板\n(width 480, 标题=文件名, 卡选中态)；拖分割线 480→636；滚动 1800px 后面板 top=53\n仍钉住；再点收起回到单栏；窄屏 820px 无 aria-pressed 卡、点击不出面板（行内回退）；\nEdit 卡→面板两栏 diff。typecheck + build + 61 server 测试全过。\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLBJcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3fkQAJmkmY4Dns2E0fjNxmAEx/GA\nzG4gf06GKJHun9xlBK3vZjTqaIjlw0AsjOH36wX3Z9AFodOcJy085T5ZcSUN7P3F\nC80YTkGqWHTrgHLwDDSAO+ipc5Y3vYd0R9Y3cPJqRiVHVAlicCOAy7QAPWyLX3JV\n/DalIAOF8rfqTs63Yupk4X0zLPInyRhnUwx8jzd0nqwCz1RyssZ9Pk6Hl6B5ymCg\nq76uGeoMKICW/yE/clY9OteZPT5x/2DKVJgeSn7LjeDy5axtcTnmx1ms6Wz4uPr0\nx4OSZpnIgFijL5tz+7KP2UYmrbQWO19U9Oeghnn+sj/e/FdYQIEhEYa7Ev1k03ZO\ncTxQXLGevXA3c2edse+NWNpyfR3TJfoqg58Gf+pk9WWaN1gHR8gaGY88sFSjSeff\n53vc8ws2I7AYd7gzXMzzTAmhUjpursvUDLqt5qXBhV/JJ8jCykHU5JdQqwtntA2f\nchcdaPvZCRy9RhNbwwAo3aL4ms3cEY4ErUmfWbmq/k8SjDJKLzHyR7DbEtNkvpdK\nJNtGzN4++WSt3wUqssyggtoaW746ld/FuSotXhlmyyPevTgvoaRuZR14A6LmENw2\np81QwPBtYlDHlffTb82uS5fIRvLruogOzgIufI3zXd3qvHWIoXWxyNIvGA8gJfeE\n93guGepP6QKveqxcVCCu\n=zncl\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-12T14:06:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"h