s://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/28bf632df6b3d47692fb601631cb13baf3444134/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T09:36:45Z","email":"645541506@qq.com","name":"Aaron Sun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T09:36:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ui): 对齐 claude.ai —— 暖象牙底色/顶部对齐/工具卡/品牌图标/消息单选筛选/上下文环形图 (#69)\n\n六个功能点（参考 claude.ai web）：\n1. 页面背景：canvas 由近中性 #F8F8F6 → 暖象牙 #FAF9F5（claude.ai 真实聊天底色），\n   surface 近白、sunken（侧栏）加深一档暖 ~#F0EEE6（web/src/index.css）。\n2. 会话顶部对齐：会话流容器补 px-3，与 sticky 面包屑/footer 同左缘，消除消息比\n   标题左移 12px 的错位（SessionDetail 内容包裹层）。\n3. 工具渲染：通用 tool_use 折叠头改近白 surface + hairline、左侧 accent 色块包住\n   工具图标，更轻更可扫读（ToolBlock.tsx）。\n4. 左上角品牌图标：稀疏 8 芒星 → 12 芒 Anthropic 风密集星芒（Sidebar.tsx Glyph）。\n5. 系统/仅我/错误：3 个独立开关 → 单选分段控件 [全部|系统|仅我|错误]（filter 单态，\n   showMeta/onlyUser/onlyError 派生；SessionDetail SegmentedFilter）。\n6. 底部上下文用量小环形图：server 从 assistant message.usage 透出 contextTokens\n   （input+cache_creation+cache_read）与 contextWindow（峰值 >200k 自适应判 1M），\n   footer 渲染 ContextRing 环形（<70% 绿 / 70-90% clay / >90% 红）。\n\n验证：npm run typecheck 通过；npm test 61/61 通过；本地 build + start(:3132) 实跑，\n真实会话 240e638b API 返回 contextTokens=427246 / contextWindow=1000000，\nPlaywright 截图确认六点视觉均生效。\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f5ba64ebfe8793c6776368b966a430810168bf9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/f5ba64ebfe8793c6776368b966a430810168bf9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/28bf632df6b3d47692fb601631cb13baf3444134","verification":{"payload":"tree f5ba64ebfe8793c6776368b966a430810168bf9f\nparent 50f2e2d82606e5cbe108935b72e14b29d71636e7\nauthor Aaron Sun <645541506@qq.com> 1781257005 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781257005 +0800\n\nfeat(ui): 对齐 claude.ai —— 暖象牙底色/顶部对齐/工具卡/品牌图标/消息单选筛选/上下文环形图 (#69)\n\n六个功能点（参考 claude.ai web）：\n1. 页面背景：canvas 由近中性 #F8F8F6 → 暖象牙 #FAF9F5（claude.ai 真实聊天底色），\n   surface 近白、sunken（侧栏）加深一档暖 ~#F0EEE6（web/src/index.css）。\n2. 会话顶部对齐：会话流容器补 px-3，与 sticky 面包屑/footer 同左缘，消除消息比\n   标题左移 12px 的错位（SessionDetail 内容包裹层）。\n3. 工具渲染：通用 tool_use 折叠头改近白 surface + hairline、左侧 accent 色块包住\n   工具图标，更轻更可扫读（ToolBlock.tsx）。\n4. 左上角品牌图标：稀疏 8 芒星 → 12 芒 Anthropic 风密集星芒（Sidebar.tsx Glyph）。\n5. 系统/仅我/错误：3 个独立开关 → 单选分段控件 [全部|系统|仅我|错误]（filter 单态，\n   showMeta/onlyUser/onlyError 派生；SessionDetail SegmentedFilter）。\n6. 底部上下文用量小环形图：server 从 assistant message.usage 透出 contextTokens\n   （input+cache_creation+cache_read）与 contextWindow（峰值 >200k 自适应判 1M），\n   footer 渲染 ContextRing 环形（<70% 绿 / 70-90% clay / >90% 红）。\n\n验证：npm run typecheck 通过；npm test 61/61 通过；本地 build + start(:3132) 实跑，\n真实会话 240e638b API 返回 contextTokens=427246 / contextWindow=1000000，\nPlaywright 截图确认六点视觉均生效。\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqK9MtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlicQAG5SCVpkfpxHKZX9a3+a32Qq\nfGM7VfIS+jSmQNincVhU3RDwOXx1w4JQSCf5O7GPQo74TlRfyG0va22t+n6qki/Q\nUGi68X