wing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/db462f1efffdddcf570403baa3a03557a7242fbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T05:46:58Z","email":"645541506@qq.com","name":"Aaron Sun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T05:46:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ui): 侧栏加 Recents 与 Close sidebar，会话详情仿 chat 简化 (#67)\n\n续仿 Claude web 聊天页：\n\n- Close sidebar：桌面端可一键收起侧栏（localStorage 持久化），收起后\n  左上浮出再展开 handle；主区自动占满。\n- Recents：新增只读接口 GET /api/sessions/recent（跨项目按 mtime 选近\n  N 条再解析，active map 只建一次；?limit= 1-50 默认 12，复用\n  SessionSummary）。侧栏列出最近会话，复用 StatusDot 出活跃效果\n  （working 行进点 / live 脉冲点 / idle 空心点），当前会话高亮，\n  有 live/recent 时 5s 条件轮询、全 idle 自停。\n- 会话详情简化：删重型 masthead + sticky-follower 测量，换精简 chat\n  风 sticky header（状态+可改标题+Modified files+Delete）+ 精简搜索\n  过滤行 + max-w-4xl 居中消息流；实时轮询/跟随尾部/窗口化/URL-focus\n  逻辑原样保留。sticky 容器用不透明 surface 底，钉住不透字。\n\nscan.ts 抽 buildSessionSummary 供单项目列表与 recents 共用；删除/重命名\n后 invalidate recentSessions。README + spec + acceptance(round-1 真机\n截图) 同步。\n\n验证：typecheck / 61 tests / build / curl recent 标志正确 / Playwright\nlight+dark+collapsed+scrolled 真机截图。\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b181500aec66f849e377a5b8ddfe1baf11b568c2"