ithub.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/29058b3451de2416aaec52a349fdbb4518aa282f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T03:15:34Z","email":"645541506@qq.com","name":"Aaron Sun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T03:15:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ui): 仿 Claude 桌面端重塑视觉与聊天式布局 (#65)\n\n* feat(ui): 仿 Claude 桌面端重塑视觉与聊天式布局\n\n把 UI 从 editorial/黄绿 accent 改为 Claude 桌面端「暖米白纸感 + 陶土 coral\n+ Fraunces 衬线标题 + 聊天式卡片」。纯表现层：不动路由/数据获取/删除导出\n安全网/i18n 文案/任何业务逻辑。\n\n- index.css：@theme 与 .dark 两组 OKLCH token 重配色（灰阶迁暖色 hue 带，\n  accent 黄绿→陶土 coral hue 44/46）；--font-display 改 Fraunces 衬线、\n  base h1-h3 跟随；pulse-amber 硬编码黄→coral；grain 噪点调淡贴近纸面\n- Sidebar：品牌换实心 coral 方块 + Claude 风 sunburst 标记；nav 活跃态从\n  白卡+阴影改为 coral-soft 柔色高亮\n- MessageBubble：用户气泡从糖果桃改为暖奶油卡，贴近 Claude 中性人类气泡；\n  会话详情的 sticky/滚动 JS 逻辑未动（仅改视觉）\n- 新增 @fontsource-variable/fraunces 依赖；CLAUDE.md 设计系统说明同步；\n  docs/spec/claude-desktop-redesign.md 落档配色映射与改版说明\n\n验证：npm run typecheck / build / test 全绿（9 files 61 tests，安全网未受影响）；\nPlaywright 真机截图（生产构建 + start，读真实 ~/.claude）home/project/session\n× light/dark 共 6 张，确认暖米白+coral+衬线+聊天气泡在两套主题下按预期渲染。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(acceptance): 仿 Claude 改版验收截图与再生成脚本入库\n\n6 张明暗双主题截图(hom