区 + Outlet）。一并修掉侧栏\n  （aside fixed z-50）盖住最左对话栏的问题。\n- ModifiedFilesDrawer.tsx → ModifiedFilesView.tsx: 删掉 backdrop + 右滑动画 + variant\n  prop，只留 fixed inset-0 整页 shell。\n- ModifiedFilesPage.tsx（新）: 独立路由组件，用相同 query key 自取 session +\n  modified-files，复用三栏渲染；Esc / ✕ 导航回会话页。\n- SessionDetail.tsx: 「修改的文件」按钮改为 window.open(''/modified'',''_blank'')；删掉抽屉\n  state / AnimatePresence 渲染块，及随之失效的 conversationMessages / openFileMutation /\n  AnimatePresence / OpenFileResult import。\n\n验证：npm run typecheck 通过；npm test 61/61 通过；Playwright 实跑确认新页面三栏渲染、\n无 app 侧栏、header 在 (0,0)、对话栏左缘 settle 到 x=0 不裁切、会话页按钮新标签打开 /modified。\n\nCo-authored-by: 孙鹏 <sunpeng@192.168.1.240>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8028c20b2dc4aafe59756c81eeee92fdc8338c14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/8028c20b2dc4aafe59756c81eeee92fdc8338c14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/b1a908ed768c72b1b6e5abdafba32b4555eefc7c","verification":{"payload":"tree 8028c20b2dc4aafe59756c81eeee92fdc8338c14\nparent 2790ff62d07c5c28f3de81082efc4b3afcf56435\nauthor Aaron Sun <645541506@qq.com> 1781201307 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781201307 +0800\n\nfeat(modified-files): 改为独立整页（新标签打开），根治滚动卡顿 (#64)\n\n「修改的文件」原先是叠在 SessionDetail 之上的右滑抽屉。抽屉内 diff 栏触摸板滚动\n卡顿（主线程几乎闲置却持续掉帧），根因是抽屉与仍在运行的会话页并存渲染：实时轮询\nrefetch + window 滚动监听 + ResizeObserver + 数百条消息的时间线 DOM。改为在新标签里\n打开独立整页后脱离这层并存渲染，滚动恢复顺滑（真机触摸板 trace + Playwright 实测背书）。\n\n- App.tsx: 用 react-router layout route 拆分——/modified 不套 app chrome（无侧栏 /\n  无 max-w 盒），其余路由套进 ChromeLayout（侧栏 + 主区 + Outlet）。一并修掉侧栏\n  （aside fixed z-50）盖住最左对话栏的问题。\n- ModifiedFilesDrawer.tsx → ModifiedFilesView.tsx: 删掉 backdrop + 右滑动画 + variant\n  prop，只留 fixed inset-0 整页 shell。\n- ModifiedFilesPage.tsx（新）: 独立路由组件，用相同 query key 自取 session +\n  modified-files，复用三栏渲染；Esc / ✕ 导航回会话页。\n- SessionDetail.tsx: 「修改的文件」按钮改为 window.open(''/modified'',''_blank'')；删掉抽屉\n  state / AnimatePresence 渲染块，及随之失效的 conversationMessages / openFileMutation /\n  AnimatePresence / OpenFileResult import。\n\n验证：npm run typecheck 通过；npm test 61/61 通过；Playwright 实跑确认新页面三栏渲染、\n无 app 侧栏、header 在 (0,0)、对话栏左缘 settle 到 x=0 不裁切、会话页按钮新标签打开 /modified。\n\nCo-authored-by: 孙鹏 <sunpeng@192.168.1.240>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKvmbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYyoQADyNMwPY2bdV6xSR4IjVNN4z\nan+R9lmeCH5AW0mF/Dj0kcpCM9pIrxA4lDYg63vAKougDCd/pnUNj+nE/5GrD1XP\nqeX2HqjStKm9j+d5+Z4n+p8Kxh2p2kZ3QE1IYFww1SifFJx2bKHPsQHeSW49HT2n\n1Yoa63qR5X6Spi2C0xixS1PHsaFP+L4ma29DtqYsP+8ejGXt5t92DVeuUq2U1D/P\n7eTB621zDRzdLtb98kKRUlgdeVugzSzY5fD1al0rd4baGcgDR1x/U25YF+drYQSE\ni+dokLgQtZz3JgTVnqSf6G0YYvcmoexLtPHUOBrPZfaOAqkfKURUvycbw+/0uhoG\nnpkgzJ69VmI/zfZjp/GuWFfqHDQ/1OZcPHbK5J4JefgOsDdnhRWktPM/MNuNjON6\nYb/HdTBmdMhahPajqEjEe/VxIDAv+mSXUZrK4cvnSBgN5K7e5SKeAIdTH4WO8aXI\nyrEWCTYJDnymVqhx/qQYU6n9CUnSrS95kj9PQY6uRQbZzifcZYzGtOS0L5tJu0GD\n9E0zGa8mxOIdYkIGPOiB8ZzCkeUMcCN88IrtETf1C1IWzxKv793OuxP2frd5n7nF\nylmIC6w2LpaJ1ATMLOLi016ZJ9ADx2VDBwwRVhFSt85dhBLE87keH8R2Bzh6ejVq\nz4uuwRLzyi8GJOQocfRI\n=X69p\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-11T18:08:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/b1a908ed768c72b1b6e5abdafba32b4555eefc7c","node_id":"C_kwDOSTCADNoAKGIxYTkwOGVkNzY4YzcyYjFiNmU1YWJkYWZiYTMyYjQ1NTVlZWZjN2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/2790ff62d07c5c28f3de81082efc4b3afcf56435","sha":"2790ff62d07c5c28f3de81082efc4b3afcf56435","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/2790ff62d07c5c28f3de81082efc4b3afcf56435"}],"sha":"b1a908ed768c72b1b6e5abdafba32b4555eefc7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/b1a908ed768c72b1b6e5abdafba32b4555eefc7c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/2790ff62d07c5c28f3de81082efc4b3afcf56435/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T15:54:05Z","email":"645541506@qq.com","name":"Aaron Sun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T15:54:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(release): npm version 命令补 -m 满足 commitlint (#63)\n\n实测 1.0.3 发版时发现：裸 `npm version <x.y.z>` 的默认 commit message 是版本号本身\n（如 \"1.0.3\"），无 conventional type，会被 commit-msg 钩子（commitlint config-conventional\n的 type-empty/subject-empty）拒绝。文档命令补 -m \"chore(release): v%s\" 并注明原因。\n\nCo-authored-by: zzusp <peng_zzu@163.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"af116229cf7b72940ea86f5f612e5288d475cc53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/af116229cf7b72940ea86f5f612e5288d475cc53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/2790ff62d07c5c28f3de81082efc4b3afcf56435","verification":{"payload":"tree af116229cf7b72940ea86f5f612e5288d475cc53\nparent dc227d6c0485f4ce66d11a0d8648ab7f5dbb55d0\nauthor Aaron Sun <645541506@qq.com> 1781193245 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781193245 +0800\n\ndocs(release): npm version 命令补 -m 满足 commitlint (#63)\n\n实测 1.0.3 发版时发现：裸 `npm version <x.y.z>` 的默认 commit message 是版本号本身\n（如 \"1.0.3\"），无 conventional type，会被 commit-msg 钩子（commitlint config-conventional\n的 type-empty/subject-empty）拒绝。文档命令补 -m \"chore(release): v%s\" 并注明原因。\n\nCo-authored-by: zzusp <peng_zzu@163.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKtodCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEawQAJda4+eV5Av773/xZ4jmm2xL\ndRHJeU3CYWJm8Kvp3Ja8r/C9FWS5Aw7OXR3+Ax8ukniks6c2l9hTV6M2QaOJChwj\ny91WChpsATaJdEZwyPjdIKTojyuGPqorFGmD8XRclQUBxfQ5H9jNoTed46uLd+ID\nkda1qcFfCII1uBZ69VFZxhKX3DnsmsPGWq9Yasz2dgr+wbPg2ZFsUP9ya8ZJLLIV\nchZrvDp+mWwGACv9FAyjLScAjWBiMa7l0o2NnnMD1T2tF/Jwmx+OCWrXthXMsTEi\nAMWWrU2X+qaiKR0lp2Yj7PuLfqD70pDgQay2Q5SS/zxcPODV5TID2WwnC1w4g/Dw\nBUPk5FbLMwBxl6w3kL5Xs27BUreLwgKTB0Y8lGKIVSU3Ke01f9CkcWKkG28atSJM\nVPlz0pL+a7HvhYEFKLFz2FIKlUoQTXm232dDnhK4OMZfQ2JtjD2zMznGXQz/VsNX\nYLKJhCjT