://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/4050131671bf6e89e5e862695cfb675d193a6295/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T15:45:57Z","email":"645541506@qq.com","name":"Aaron Sun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T15:45:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci(release): 改为 tag 触发发布，移除 release-it (#62)\n\n* ci(release): 改为 tag 触发发布，移除 release-it\n\n发版模型从「本地 release-it 驱动」改为「本地 npm version 打 tag → push tag → CI 发布」：\n\n- .github/workflows/release.yml: on push tags v*；校验 tag==package.json 版本 → npm test +\n  typecheck 闸门 → npm publish（NPM_PUBLISH_TOKEN）→ conventional-changelog 生成中文 notes →\n  gh release create。不写回 main。\n- 移除 release-it：删 .release-it.json、package.json 的 release/release:dry scripts 及\n  release-it + @release-it/conventional-changelog 两个 devDep（避免本地 npm run release 打 tag\n  反而触发 CI 重复发布）。npm install 同步 lockfile（移除 178 个传递依赖）。\n- 同步文档：release-process.md 重写第四–七节、CONTRIBUTING 发版段、README、CHANGELOG 尾注。\n\n本地验证：npm test (61 passed) + typecheck + build 三关全绿；workflow YAML 解析通过。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci(release): release notes 无 conventional 条目时回退 GitHub 自动生成\n\n本版若只含 ci/chore 等不入 changelog 的 commit，conventional-changelog 的本版段会空或被跳过，\n直接用会得到空 notes 或错位成上一版内容。改为：仅当首段标题确为当前版本且有实质条目才用\nconventional notes，否则 gh release --generate-notes 兜底。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: zzusp <peng_zzu@163.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"020e4bffe33d08f2b8848c1c6ac2e3e3011dcf1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/020e4bffe33d08f2b8848c1c6ac2e3e3011dcf1b"},"url":"https://api.