eceived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/8c7e55e9751aeabd8f971ddfe8a456e6e5a5f7ab","node_id":"C_kwDOSTCADNoAKDhjN2U1NWU5NzUxYWVhYmQ4Zjk3MWRkZmU4YTQ1NmU2ZTVhNWY3YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/2589aeb6b1b6943bc4acd1dca6a8fd8f000233a4","sha":"2589aeb6b1b6943bc4acd1dca6a8fd8f000233a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/2589aeb6b1b6943bc4acd1dca6a8fd8f000233a4"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/b6ee1e547a36c311cfec320b6de80fa3ecb4466e","sha":"b6ee1e547a36c311cfec320b6de80fa3ecb4466e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/b6ee1e547a36c311cfec320b6de80fa3ecb4466e"}],"sha":"8c7e55e9751aeabd8f971ddfe8a456e6e5a5f7ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/8c7e55e9751aeabd8f971ddfe8a456e6e5a5f7ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/b6ee1e547a36c311cfec320b6de80fa3ecb4466e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T04:26:44Z","email":"sunpeng@hiqlcd.com","name":"孙鹏"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T04:26:44Z","email":"sunpeng@hiqlcd.com","name":"孙鹏"},"message":"Merge origin/main into worktree-session-sticky-header\n\n冲突文件 web/src/routes/SessionDetail.tsx：本分支把搜索栏 FilterLedger 包进\nsticky 轨道 + 压缩浮层，main(#56) 给 FilterLedger 新增了「错误」筛选\n(onlyError/onOnlyError)。解决：保留 sticky 轨道结构，并把 onlyError/\nonOnlyError 两个 props 透传给 FilterLedger，两特性并存。\n\n顺手修一处合并后才暴露的观感问题：压缩浮层各行之间的透明间隙会透出下方滚动\n的消息文字，给浮层加 topbar-glass 毛玻璃底（设计系统专为粘性栏覆盖滚动内容\n提供），并把行间下边距改为浮层自身 pb-2，pinTop 相应改为 offsetHeight。\n\n本地实跑验证（生产构建 + Playwright，1440px 真实 345 条消息会话）：\n- 粘性浮层：scrollHeight 顶部/滚动后恒定(零重排)、顶部隐藏滚动后显示、\n  修改的文件按钮在位、面包屑/卡片/搜索栏依次堆叠且左对齐。\n- 错误筛选：顶部切换「错误」总数 345→8(恰为 8 条错误)并可还原；轨道\n  钉住(滚动态)下切换同样 345→8，浮层保持可见。\n- typecheck 通过、build 通过。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8100689d7d2b1e1f7265d5fc7939ce6f44e2f2e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/8100689d7d2b1e1f7265d5fc7939ce6f44e2f2e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/b6ee1e547a36c311cfec320b6de80fa3ecb4466e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/b6ee1e547a36c311cfec320b6de80fa3ecb4466e","node_id":"C_kwDOSTCADNoAKGI2ZWUxZTU0N2EzNmMzMTFjZmVjMzIwYjZkZTgwZmEzZWNiNDQ2NmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/7b66d6042c2aee716e9081726840f55e566d9ae7","sha":"7b66d6042c2aee716e9081726840f55e566d9ae7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/7b66d6042c2aee716e9081726840f55e566d9ae7"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/2589aeb6b1b6943bc4acd1dca6a8fd8f000233a4","sha":"2589aeb6b1b6943bc4acd1dca6a8fd8f000233a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/2589aeb6b1b6943bc4acd1dca6a8fd8f000233a4"}],"sha":"b6ee1e547a36c311cfec320b6de80fa3ecb4466e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/b6ee1e547a36c311cfec320b6de80fa3ecb4466e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/7b66d6042c2aee716e9081726840f55e566d9ae7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T04:13:58Z","email":"sunpeng@hiqlcd.com","name":"孙鹏"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T04:13:58Z","email":"sunpeng@hiqlcd.com","name":"孙鹏"},"message":"feat(session): 会话详情滚动时面包屑+卡片+搜索栏整体粘顶\n\n向下滚动时，面包屑、会话卡片与搜索栏一起钉在顶部；卡片压缩为与面包屑/\n搜索栏等高的单行，保留「修改的文件」按钮（含计数）、删除按钮、实时状态点\n与标题，其余信息（tagline / facts / 重命名）压缩隐藏。\n\n实现：把已有搜索栏 FilterLedger 放进一个 sticky 轨道容器，轨道内用一个\n绝对定位浮层（absolute bottom-full）叠在搜索栏正上方，放压缩版面包屑 +\n新增的 CompactMasthead 单行卡片。浮层脱离文档流，显隐不会引起页面重排/内容\n跳动；pinTop 由 ResizeObserver 量出浮层高度后在 lg 下下压搜索栏留出空间，\nstuck 由滚动监听切换浮层淡入。lg 以下保持原行为（浮层 display:none、搜索栏\n仍 top-2 粘顶）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e9fafbeb4fc0b8cd257f015639c45469d5806db1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/e9fafbeb4fc0b8cd257f015639c45469d5806db1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/7b66d6042c2aee716e9081726840f55e566d9ae7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations