d-session.ts 的 isError 判定一致）。\n\n- shared/types.ts: SessionSummary 新增 errorCount 字段（wire 协议）\n- server/lib/parse-jsonl.ts: parseJsonlMeta 统计 errorCount，\n  新增 countErrorResults 遍历 message.content 的 tool_result.is_error\n- server/lib/scan.ts: listSessionsForProject 把 errorCount 填入 summary\n- web/src/routes/ProjectDetail.tsx: 会话表在\"消息\"列后新增\"错误\"列，\n  >0 用 danger 色，0 用 faint 色\n- web/src/routes/SessionDetail.tsx: FilterLedger 在\"系统/仅我\"旁新增\n  \"错误\"开关（onlyError），筛选含 is_error tool_result 的消息；\n  新增 hasError 判定，错误筛选时跳过窗口化以显示全部命中\n- web/src/lib/i18n.ts: 新增 common.onlyError / project.col.errors（zh+en）\n\n验证：npm run typecheck（server+web）EXITCODE=0；npm test 61 passed；\n对真实 ~/.claude 数据跑 listSessionsForProject，143 会话中 102 个\nerrorCount>0，数值合理（1-8，均 < 消息数）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"23042137f4b02d72913b75f62eb7c1031fe3ab3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/23042137f4b02d72913b75f62eb7c1031fe3ab3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/31a3d85fdcab25b4cbad97faa342733853e9a131","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/31a3d85fdcab25b4cbad97faa342733853e9a131","node_id":"C_kwDOSTCADNoAKDMxYTNkODVmZGNhYjI1YjRjYmFkOTdmYWEzNDI3MzM4NTNlOWExMzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/c9d2ecf4eb8846f906780a9e4f85d5d5876cdbc3","sha":"c9d2ecf4eb8846f906780a9e4f85d5d5876cdbc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/c9d2ecf4eb8846f906780a9e4f85d5d5876cdbc3"}],"sha":"31a3d85fdcab25b4cbad97faa342733853e9a131","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/31a3d85fdcab25b4cbad97faa342733853e9a131"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/72404bc9bd4a033000d34546ec617e50336f1a95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T03:28:18Z","email":"sunpeng@hiqlcd.com","name":"孙鹏"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T03:28:18Z","email":"sunpeng@hiqlcd.com","name":"孙鹏"},"message":"fix(modified-files): 空修改文件时保留三栏框架与对话栏\n\n打开「修改的文件」弹窗时，若本会话零修改文件（count===0），原先整页塌成\n一句「本次会话没有修改任何文件」居中提示，左侧对话栏与三栏框架全被吞掉。\n\n合并 count===0 / count>0 两个互斥分支为单一 !loading && !error 守卫，三栏\n框架（对话栏 + 两条分割线 + 右两栏表头）零文件时照常渲染；中间内容栏空态\n文案按 count 区分（零文件用 empty，否则 selectFile），右侧文件树栏 tree 为空\n时自然不渲染行即「无内容」。复用既有 i18n key，无新增文案。\n\n验证：npm run typecheck 通过；docs/acceptance/empty-modified-drawer\nverify-empty-drawer.mjs ALL GREEN(9/9) + 截图。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6e7ba36e7c2fd78842671045dc310ae2c874796","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/a6e7ba36e7c2fd78842671045dc310ae2c874796"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/72404bc9bd4a033000d34546ec617e50336f1a95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/72404bc9bd4a033000d34546ec617e50336f1a95","node_id":"C_kwDOSTCADNoAKDcyNDA0YmM5YmQ0YTAzMzAwMGQzNDU0NmVjNjE3ZTUwMzM2ZjFhOTU","