12f6493ff8ccda009eb63678c78b580fb","sha":"9c8eb1412f6493ff8ccda009eb63678c78b580fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/9c8eb1412f6493ff8ccda009eb63678c78b580fb"}],"sha":"a5837e02553f3f76832da00fbfdd13b91945e329","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/a5837e02553f3f76832da00fbfdd13b91945e329"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/9c8eb1412f6493ff8ccda009eb63678c78b580fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T14:12:50Z","email":"peng_zzu@163.com","name":"zzusp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T14:12:50Z","email":"peng_zzu@163.com","name":"zzusp"},"message":"fix(session): 修复抽屉新消息跟随引用已删除的 pendingJump 报错\n\nPR #49 的实时跟随 effect 引用了抽屉跳转功能的 pendingJump ref；随后 PR #50\n删除了跳转功能(连同 pendingJump 声明)但未清理该引用，合并后 pendingJump 不存在\n-> 新消息触发 effect 时抛 ReferenceError: pendingJump is not defined，对话栏不跟随。\n\n删去 pendingJump.current 引用，仅保留 restoreFromBottom 让位守卫；同步修正注释。\nPlaywright 4/4 PASS 且无 console error，证据见 round-2.md。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a1eb9e24f57ff2aa8e97403b6553659c37448a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/9a1eb9e24f57ff2aa8e97403b6553659c37448a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/9c8eb1412f6493ff8ccda009eb63678c78b580fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/9c8eb1412f6493ff8ccda009eb63678c78b580fb","node_id":"C_kwDOSTCADNoAKDljOGViMTQxMmY2NDkzZmY4Y2NkYTAwOWViNjM2NzhjNzhiNTgwZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/e605a4e19ecc18bed573469ea85aad3870737da7","sha":"e605a4e19ecc18bed573469ea85aad3870737da7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/e605a4e19ecc18bed573469ea85aa