thor":{"date":"2026-06-09T13:58:21Z","email":"peng_zzu@163.com","name":"zzusp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T13:58:21Z","email":"peng_zzu@163.com","name":"zzusp"},"message":"feat(session): 处理中新消息到达时对话自动滚到底\n\n「修改的文件」抽屉对话栏此前完全没有实时跟随——处理中新消息到来纹丝不动。\nSessionDetail 时间线已有按 messageCount 增长的贴底跟随，但处理中指示器\n(WorkingIndicator)出现时不增长 messageCount，故指示器冒出时不跟随。\n\n- ModifiedFilesDrawer: 新增贴底跟随(CONV_BOTTOM_STICK_PX + stickToBottom/\n  prevMsgCount/prevIsWorking)，消息增长或刚进入处理中且停在底部时滚到底，\n  让位于 pendingJump/restoreFromBottom 重排。\n- SessionDetail: 新增 isWorking false->true 时的跟随，补 messageCount 不变那类更新的缺口。\n\n均保留「往上翻历史不被拽回」语义。Playwright 4/4 PASS，证据见\ndocs/acceptance/drawer-autoscroll-working/report.md。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ff28f67f606388a009b5d7c6ddcddfe81876a37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/5ff28f67f606388a009b5d7c6ddcddfe81876a37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/69321bbb9ee430c7079d9d1282098bbf2b7ad5e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/69321bbb9ee430c7079d9d1282098bbf2b7ad5e7","node_id":"C_kwDOSTCADNoAKDY5MzIxYmJiOWVlNDMwYzcwNzlkOWQxMjgyMDk4YmJmMmI3YWQ1ZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/96173b54efe59a840a66f34039b8f32d81e4153b","sha":"96173b54efe59a840a66f34039b8f32d81e4153b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/96173b54efe59a840a66f34039b8f32d81e4153b"}],"sha":"69321bbb9ee430c7079d9d1282098bbf2b7ad5e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/69321bbb9ee430c7079d9d1282098bbf2b7ad5e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.git