m","name":"zzusp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T13:11:58Z","email":"peng_zzu@163.com","name":"zzusp"},"message":"feat(session): 修改文件抽屉对话落底 + 分屏 diff + 文件名变更色\n\n三项改进（web 端，wire/server 未动）：\n\n1. 对话栏默认落底、只渲染尾部最新 20 条，更早折叠在顶部「显示更早」按钮后\n   逐批（步长 40）展开；展开保持离底距离，跳转命中折叠区先全量展开再滚动。\n2. 中间文件变更由单栏统一 diff 改为 GitHub 风格左右分屏：旧→左栏、新→右栏，\n   del↔add 配对、多出一侧 empty 占位，两栏行级对齐，保留 word-level 行内高亮。\n3. 右侧文件名按变更类型着色：新增(A) moss 绿 / 修改(M) accent 琥珀，errored 仍优先红点。\n\ni18n 新增 showEarlier / added / modified（中英）。\n验证：typecheck OK · test 61 OK · build OK · Playwright verify-split-diff 13/13 全绿。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2445af3b4bb06b06b2eeddd48fb883104b8b24fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/2445af3b4bb06b06b2eeddd48fb883104b8b24fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/94efe05bd28846a9f72960f6911d088c33d4bd0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/94efe05bd28846a9f72960f6911d088c33d4bd0b","node_id":"C_kwDOSTCADNoAKDk0ZWZlMDViZDI4ODQ2YTlmNzI5NjBmNjkxMWQwODhjMzNkNGJkMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/05121c65f7049acfc744663ca4d075acb8bed99f","sha":"05121c65f7049acfc744663ca4d075acb8bed99f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/05121c65f7049acfc744663ca4d075acb8bed99f"}],"sha":"94efe05bd28846a9f72960f6911d088c33d4bd0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/94efe05bd28846a9f72960f6911d088c33d4bd0b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/6114040be9e3009a3d88fb12b8b65f80b3b36770/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T13:11:58Z","email":"peng_zzu@163.com","name":"zzusp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T13:11:58Z","email":"peng_zzu@163.com","name":"zzusp"},"message":"fix(session): 修复处理中指示器错位 + 修改文件弹窗对话同步显示处理中\n\nWorkingIndicator 里名称用的是 inline <span>，与下方 inline-flex 的气泡\n<article> 同处一行并排，导致「Claude」名称与气泡错位（docs/tmp/processing.png）。\n正常 MessageBubble 的 Header 是 block 级，名称应在气泡上方。\n\n- MessageBubble.tsx: 把 WorkingIndicator 从 SessionDetail 抽出为命名导出并复用；\n  名称 span 加 `block` 使其占整行，气泡换到下一行（web/src/components/MessageBubble.tsx:204）\n- SessionDetail.tsx: 删除本地 WorkingIndicator，改 import 共享组件；向 drawer 传 isWorking\n- ModifiedFilesDrawer.tsx: 新增 isWorking prop，对话栏尾部按 isWorking 渲染同一指示器\n  （messages 为空且 working 时也显示）\n\n验证：typecheck 通过、61 项单元测试全过；Playwright mock 会话进入 working 态，\n时间线与弹窗对话栏均渲染指示器，名称均在气泡上方（name y < bubble y），无控制台错误。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe27b85e81f90c6dd3dd864ff87f0d1771194cdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/fe27b85e81f90c6dd3dd864ff87f0d1771194cdd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/6114040be9e3009a3d88fb12b8b65f80b3b36770","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/6114040be9e3009a3d88fb12b8b65f80b3b36770","node_id":"C_kwDOSTCADNoAKDYxMTQwNDBiZTllMzAwOWEzZDg4ZmIxMmI4YjY1ZjgwYjNiMzY3NzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/05121c65f7049acfc744663ca4d075acb8bed99f","sha":"05121c65f7049acfc744663ca4d075acb8bed99f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/05121c65f7049acfc744663ca4d075acb8bed99f"}],"sha":"6114040be9e3009a3d88fb12b8b65f80b3b36770","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/6114040be9e3009a3d88fb12b8b65f80b3b36770"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"http