king（wire 变更）\n- shared/constants.ts: INTERRUPTED_MARKER_RE（server/web 共享）\n- server/lib/parse-jsonl.ts: 产出 lastTurnIncomplete\n- web StatusDot 新增 working 变体；SessionDetail 尾部「Claude 正在处理…」指示 +\n  masthead 工作中徽章；ProjectDetail 工作中计数（三态互斥）；i18n 中英文案\n- README + docs/acceptance/session-working-status（方案/报告/复验脚本）\n\n验证：typecheck + 60 单测 + build 全绿；真实数据 isWorking 正确、中断反证 0 误判。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"89571f06b0b1a067d49a25600bab6f82a30accca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/89571f06b0b1a067d49a25600bab6f82a30accca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/e6292e7cf837420080bc934092b7724114d191e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/e6292e7cf837420080bc934092b7724114d191e4","node_id":"C_kwDOSTCADNoAKGU2MjkyZTdjZjgzNzQyMDA4MGJjOTM0MDkyYjc3MjQxMTRkMTkxZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/f0e86b9e984460ec1db92564e181efa6a977d0bd","sha":"f0e86b9e984460ec1db92564e181efa6a977d0bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/f0e86b9e984460ec1db92564e181efa6a977d0bd"}],"sha":"e6292e7cf837420080bc934092b7724114d191e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/e6292e7cf837420080bc934092b7724114d191e4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/c93298c84f2761db42215f895c90ce660c161b05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T11:09:00Z","email":"sunpeng@hiqlcd.com","name":"孙鹏"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T11:09:43Z","email":"sunpeng@hiqlcd.com","name":"孙鹏"},"message":"feat(modified-files): structuredPatch 驱动的 GitHub 风格统一 diff\n\n「修改的文件」抽屉过去只用 tool 输入(old_string/new_string/content)渲染：\n新建文件(Write)纯文本无色、覆盖删除的旧内容根本不显示、行号是片段内\n从 1 起的相对值且不省略未改动区。\n\n改用会话 jsonl 里 toolUseResult.structuredPatch(真实文件行号的 hunk)作为\n数据源，渲染为单栏统一视图：红删/绿增/灰上下文、旧+新两个行号 gutter、\nhunk 间折叠成「N unchanged lines」。create(空 patch)与仍 pending 时退回\n从输入文本生成(全绿/相对行号)。\n\n- shared/ty