2s 轮询重读\njsonl，新消息 / tool 调用自动追加，无需手动刷新：\n\n- 给 session 详情 query 加 refetchInterval（函数形式），每次 tick 用\n  新鲜 Date.now() 判定 isWithinLiveWindow(meta.lastAt)；运行中每写一行\n  lastAt 推进 → 持续轮询，停写超窗口 → 返回 false 自动停（响应字节不变也能停）\n- masthead 显示脉冲 LIVE 徽标，复用 pulse-amber / accent token\n- 贴底自动跟随：用户停在底部时新消息滚到底；上翻历史 / 搜索 / ?focus\n  深链时不打扰\n- 纯前端，零 wire / 后端改动，复用现有详情端点与 meta.lastAt\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"06d591ee260538c61951c2f085be24a5e1cd1693","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/06d591ee260538c61951c2f085be24a5e1cd1693"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/1cd590088eae60691f0c25d99d0bf6c302f80b64","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/1cd590088eae60691f0c25d99d0bf6c302f80b64","node_id":"C_kwDOSTCADNoAKDFjZDU5MDA4OGVhZTYwNjkxZjBjMjVkOTlkMGJmNmMzMDJmODBiNjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/b27977ca163e91ff1aac8d317c78aab75581ac1e","sha":"b27977ca163e91ff1aac8d317c78aab75581ac1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/b27977ca163e91ff1aac8d317c78aab75581ac1e"}],"sha":"1cd590088eae60691f0c25d99d0bf6c302f80b64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/1cd590088eae60691f0c25d99d0bf6c302f80b64"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/0cc42858f0370dd846f8016276ca0e7df4942460/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T10:20:21Z","email":"sunpeng@hiqlcd.com","name":"孙鹏"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T10:20:21Z","email":"sunpeng@hiqlcd.com","name":"孙鹏"},"message":"perf(disk): 磁盘占用页加载从 ~109s 降到 ~2.5s\n\n磁盘占用页加载时并发触发两个接口（/api/disk-usage 与\n/api/disk-cleanup/suggestions），二者都走 listProjects() + 逐项目\nlistSessionsForProject()。而 listSessionsForProject 内部每个项目调用一次\nbuildActiveSessionMap()，Windows 下即一次 tasklist spawn（~400-700ms/次）。\n32 个项目 × 2 接口 = 64 次 tasklist，实测页面加载墙钟 ~109s。两个磁盘视图\n都不展示 live-PID / recently-active，这部分纯属浪费。\n\n修复：新增 scan.ts:scanProjectsForDisk()——磁盘视图专用单遍扫描，逐会话算\nrelatedBytes + 解析一次 jsonl meta，项目 totalBytes = 会话之和；不建 active\nmap（去掉 tasklist），也消除了 listProjects/listSessionsForProject 之间重复的\nsize 遍历。disk-usage.ts 与 cleanup-suggestions.ts 改为消费它。size/meta 原语\n（dirSize/fileSize/parseJsonlMeta/decodeProjectId）全部复用，未改动\nlistProjects/listSessionsForProject（session 列表页 / import 仍依赖其 live-PID\n信息）。\n\n实跑（真实 ~/.claude，32 项目 144 会话）：\n- 并发墙钟 109s -> 2.5s（约 44x）\n- 输出数据一致：projects=32 sessions=144 months=2 top=20\n  cleanup large=10 orphFH=23 orphSE=0；totalBytes 同次确定性一致（公式不变，\n  跨次差异是测量间隔内 live 会话追加写导致的磁盘自然增长）\n- npm run typecheck 通过；npm test 54/54 通过\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1fe7c985f5d1a4e39abcdcd427b319514ac0be9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/1fe7c985f5d1a4e39abcdcd427b319514ac0be9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/0cc42858f0370dd846f8016276ca0e7df4942460","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url"