s":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/32a73e5c673ad636fac55f224b03afc9f80d0b7a","sha":"32a73e5c673ad636fac55f224b03afc9f80d0b7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/32a73e5c673ad636fac55f224b03afc9f80d0b7a"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/4a2a812ba8016697b2392a11875190a1aea4c84b","sha":"4a2a812ba8016697b2392a11875190a1aea4c84b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/4a2a812ba8016697b2392a11875190a1aea4c84b"}],"sha":"d5e8f18e2a12cf871e205a3326ce6ff87945c1da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/d5e8f18e2a12cf871e205a3326ce6ff87945c1da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/4a2a812ba8016697b2392a11875190a1aea4c84b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T01:45:34Z","email":"sunpeng@hiqlcd.com","name":"孙鹏"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T01:45:34Z","email":"sunpeng@hiqlcd.com","name":"孙鹏"},"message":"refactor(delete): 提炼 safeRemove 共享删除单元，统一两条删除路径的安全网 (#32)\n\ndeleteSessions（5 处级联）和 deleteOrphan（孤儿目录）此前各写一份「isUnderClaudeRoot\n路径校验 + 实际 rm」：前者用本地 rmFile/rmDir，后者直接 fs.rmSync。改删除约束时极易\n只改一边、改一边漏一边。\n\n按 issue 推荐方向 A 提炼 server/lib/safe-remove.ts 的 safeRemove(target)：先过\nisUnderClaudeRoot 再 rm（文件/目录统一 recursive，对文件无副作用），逃出 root 抛错兜底。\n- delete.ts：4 处级联删除（jsonl/subdir/file-history/session-env）改走 safeRemove，\n  删掉本地 rmFile/rmDir。\n- cleanup-suggestions.ts：deleteOrphan 的 fs.rmSync 改走 safeRemove。\n两条路径差异只剩前置判定（deleteSessions 跳过 live PID / 5 分钟内活跃；deleteOrphan\n二次确认仍是孤儿）。CLAUDE.md「删除流程的 5 个位置」补充孤儿场景 + safeRemove 说明。\n\n新增 safe-remove.test.ts 覆盖共享单元：删文件/目录返 true、不存在返 false 幂等、\n逃出 ~/.claude 子树抛错且不删 root 外文件。既有 delete.test.ts 级联用例仍全绿。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a53b5a5285b435b87e671becf6c87d6515b9211c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/a53b5a5285b435b87e671becf6c87d6515b9211c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/4a2a812ba8016697b2392a11875190a1aea4c84b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/4a2a812ba8016697b2392a11875190a1aea4c84b","node_id":"C_kwDOSTCADNoAKDRhMmE4MTJiYTgwMTY2OTdiMjM5MmExMTg3NTE5MGExYWVhNGM4NGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/2dcd9d4b5e65c6d3032e23b81f6c47081277ce4a","sha":"2dcd9d4b5e65c6d3032e23b81f6c47081277ce4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/2dcd9d4b5e65c6d3032e23b81f6c47081277ce4a"}],"sha":"4a2a812ba8016697b2392a11875190a1aea4c84b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/4a2a812ba8016697b2392a11875190a1aea4c84b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/2dcd9d4b5e65c6d3032e23b81f6c47081277ce4a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T01:45:20Z","email":"sunpeng@hiqlcd.com","name":"孙鹏"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T01:45:20Z","email":"sunpeng@hiqlcd.com","name":"孙鹏"},"message":"fix(claude-paths): 按平台显式选 path.win32/path.posix，单测可跑真实 Windows 路径 (#31)\n\nisUnderClaudeRoot 之前走 node:path 默认导出，POSIX runtime 上把 `C:\\...` 喂给\npath.resolve 会被当相对路径，所以 Windows 大小写折叠分支只能用 POSIX 假根模拟。\n\n改为 `const platformPath = process.platform === ''win32'' ? path.win32 : path.posix`，\n所有 join/resolve/sep 走 platformPath。真实运行时与默认导出等价（行为零变化），\n但单测能在 macOS/Linux 上把 process.platform 设成 ''win32'' 后喂真实 `C:\\...` / UNC\n形式，跑通盘符正规化 + 大小写折叠全分支。\n\n测试改写 Windows describe 块：真实 `C:\\Users\\Foo` 盘符大小写折叠 + UNC 两个用例，\n取代原 POSIX 模拟。withWin32 包装必须 async + `return await fn()`，否则 finally 的\n平台还原会在动态 import 求值模块前触发。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a71074c9670728f14b911de95d3ea5c0be35fb5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/a71074c9670728f14b911de95d3ea5c0be35fb5e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/2dcd9d4b5e65c6d3032e23b81f6c47081277ce4a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp/claude-code-session/commit/2dcd9d4b5e65c6d3032