thor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/commits/4c397e447317e19d7b94a3f6005ec6b10052e75b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T09:35:24Z","email":"sunpeng@hiqlcd.com","name":"孙鹏"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T09:35:24Z","email":"sunpeng@hiqlcd.com","name":"孙鹏"},"message":"Feat: add `ccsm` CLI for npm install / npx usage\n\nMirror claudecodeui''s CLI install + run experience for this manager.\n\n- bin/cli.mjs: plain-JS launcher (runs under bare node). --help/--version\n  are answered locally; otherwise it registers tsx''s ESM loader (resolved\n  from THIS package, so it works regardless of cwd) and imports the TS\n  server entry — the same path `npm run start` (`tsx server/index.ts`) takes.\n- server/index.ts: parse --port/--host/--open via node:util parseArgs.\n  An explicit --port is used as-is (exits if busy); otherwise it scans\n  3131-3140 as before. Prints a security warning on non-loopback binds and\n  opens the default browser on --open.\n- package.json: drop `private`; add bin{ccsm}, files whitelist,\n  publishConfig.access=public, prepublishOnly build; move tsx to\n  dependencies (needed at runtime for global install / npx).\n- README: \"Install as a CLI\" section (npx / global / flags / local install)\n  + security note for the --host LAN override.\n\nVerified locally: typecheck + build green; `ccsm --version`/`--help` work;\nran `ccsm --port 3137` and served /api/health + SPA root + a deep link (all\n200); busy-port / invalid-port / unknown-flag each exit 1 with a clean\nmessage; `npm pack --dry-run` bundles dist + server + shared + bin (65 files).\n\nNote: package name is the placeholder `@your-npm-scope/ccsm` — set your real\nnpm scope in package.json before `npm publish`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c3bd3549ff52376312c589edeec8265028f7f17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/trees/5c3bd3549ff52376312c589edeec8265028f7f17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zzusp/claude-code-session/git/commits/4c397e447317e19d7b94a3f6005ec6b10052e75b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22272602?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zzusp","id":22272602,"login":"zzusp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcyNjAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzusp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"http