_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ravikumarch040/Cloud-QAMS/commits/017de30fed1ac4ef8771234a0623d5dc5612c622/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-04T18:21:07Z","email":"ravikumarch040@gmail.com","name":"Ravi Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-04T18:21:07Z","email":"ravikumarch040@gmail.com","name":"Ravi Kumar"},"message":"Add integration tests for various APIs in the Qams.BuildingBlocks project\n\n- Implemented AuditLedgerApiIntegrationTests to verify health check and audit entry creation.\n- Implemented ChangeControlApiIntegrationTests to verify health check and change request creation and approval.\n- Implemented ComplaintsApiIntegrationTests to verify health check and complaint creation and resolution.\n- Implemented DocumentControlApiIntegrationTests to verify health check and document creation and approval.\n- Implemented ESignatureApiIntegrationTests to verify health check and e-signature creation.\n- Implemented EquipmentCalibrationApiIntegrationTests to verify health check and equipment calibration creation and scheduling.\n- Implemented IdentityApiIntegrationTests to verify health check and tenant creation.\n- Implemented IntegrationApiIntegrationTests to verify health check and connector creation and testing.\n- Implemented ManagementReviewApiIntegrationTests to verify health check and review pack creation.\n- Implemented NotificationApiIntegrationTests to verify health check and notification creation and acknowledgment.\n- Implemented ProductMasterApiIntegrationTests to verify health check and product creation.\n- Implemented RiskDesignControlsApiIntegrationTests to verify health check and risk assessment creation.\n- Implemented SupplierQualityApiIntegrationTests to verify health check and supplier score creation and update.\n- Implemented TrainingApiIntegrationTests to verify health check and training course creation and enrollment.","tree":{"sha":"11633fe607e466707491fbf1420bfe878e0d4c70","u