b7dbcd14479db474e4f789a843e04d10098455/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T14:14:39Z","email":"divyanksrivastava@Divyanks-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Divyank Srivastava"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T14:14:39Z","email":"divyanksrivastava@Divyanks-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Divyank Srivastava"},"message":"feat: migrate all MFEs from Next.js to Vite + React with Module Federation\n\n- Replaced Next.js with Vite + @vitejs/plugin-react across all 3 apps\n- mfe-auth (3001): exposes LoginPage, RegisterPage, DashboardPage via remoteEntry.js\n- mfe-editor (3002): exposes EditorPage via remoteEntry.js\n- shell (3000): single host app — consumes remote MFEs via Module Federation\n- All routing moved to React Router v6 (useNavigate, Link)\n- Removed all ''use client'' directives and Next.js-specific APIs\n- process.env → import.meta.env throughout\n- Shell has global Navbar, LandingPage, LoadingScreen\n- Full flow on ONE port: localhost:3000/{login,register,dashboard,editor}\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ff952eae6a091e99c7ee99cc586b2845d8e59b8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divyank1997/patternforge/git/trees/ff952eae6a091e99c7ee99cc586b2845d8e59b8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divyank1997/patternforge/git/commits/0ab7dbcd14479db474e4f789a843e04d10098455","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/divyank1997/patternforge/commit/0ab7dbcd14479db474e4f789a843e04d10098455","node_id":"C_kwDOSTGustoAKDBhYjdkYmNkMTQ0NzlkYjQ3NGU0Zjc4OWE4NDNlMDRkMTAwOTg0NTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/divyank1997/patternforge/commit/8c88a64671d284d3420d8092576efa82529c80d8","sha":"8c88a64671d284d3420d8092576efa82529c80d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divyank1997/patternforge/commits/8c88a64671d284d3420d8092576efa82529c80d8"}],"sha":"0ab7dbcd14479db474e4f789a843e04d10098455","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divyank1997/patternforge/commits/0ab7dbcd14479db474e4f789a843e04d10098455"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divyank1997/patternforge/commits/8c88a64671d284d3420d8092576efa82529c80d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T13:55:30Z","email":"divyanksrivastava@Divyanks-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Divyank Srivastava"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T13:55:30Z","email":"divyanksrivastava@Divyanks-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Divyank Srivastava"},"message":"feat: Phase 2 — AI generation + 3D pattern editor\n\nai-service:\n- Claude API integration (claude-sonnet-4-6) for text-to-PatternParameters\n- Demo mode (mock response) when API key not set — editor works out of the box\n- POST /ai/generate and POST /ai/refine with JWT auth\n- dotenv loading for local dev\n\nmfe-editor (port 3002):\n- 5 pattern renderers: geometric, organic, fractal, noise, parametric\n- React Three Fiber canvas with OrbitControls, Stars, dynamic lighting\n- Zustand store for reactive parameter state\n- AI tab: prompt input → generate/refine → live 3D update\n- Manual tab: style picker, sliders (complexity/scale/rotation/symmetry), material controls, color pickers\n- Dynamic import of canvas (SSR disabled — WebGL requires browser)\n- Wireframe toggle, glow/metalness/roughness controls\n\nmfe-auth:\n- Fixed post-login redirect to /dashboard (was 404)\n- Dashboard page shows logged-in user info + logout\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"57c92fb26a476f2aaf06c5c5149874226a362238","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divyank1997/patternforge/git/trees/57c92fb26a476f2aaf06c5c5149874226a362238"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divyank1997/patternforge/git/commits/8c88a64671d284d3420d8092576efa82529c80d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/divyank1997/patternforge/commit/8c88a64671d284d3420d8092576efa82529c80d8","node_id":"C_kwDOSTGustoAKDhjODhhNjQ2NzFkMjg0ZDM0MjBkODA5MjU3NmVmYTgyNTI5YzgwZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/divyank1997/patternforge/commit/b1f1e834450affca927bd7b8fad9af377c5882f7","sha":"b1f1e834450affca927bd7b8fad9af377c5882f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divyank1997/patternforge/commits/b1f1e834450affca927bd7b8fad9af377c5882f7"}],"sha":"8c88a64671d284d3420d8092576efa82529c80d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divyank1997/patternforge/commits/8c88a64671d284d3420d8092576efa82529c80d8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divyank1997/patternforge/commits/b1f1e834450affca927bd7b8fad9af377c5882f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T13:31:32Z","email":"divyanksrivastava@Divyanks-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Divyank Srivastava"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T13:31:32Z","email":"divyanksrivastava@Divyanks-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Divyank Srivastava"},"message":"feat: complete auth flow — register, login, refresh, logout, /me\n\n- auth-service: Fastify + Prisma + PostgreSQL, bcrypt hashing, JWT access/refresh tokens\n- mfe-auth: Next.js 14 login + register pages with Tailwind dark UI\n- docker-compose: PostgreSQL 16 for local dev\n- Prisma migration: users + refresh_tokens tables\n- All endpoints tested and verified\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c3b046131dcae99bd0638e421496c4897007a582","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divyank1997/patternforge/git/trees/c3b046131dcae99bd0638e421496c4897007a582"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divyank1997/patternforge/git/commits/b1f1e834450affca927bd7b8fad9af377c5882f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/divyank1997/patternforge/commit/b1f1e834450affca927bd7b8fad9af377c5882f7","node_id":"C_kwDOSTGustoAKGIxZjFlODM0NDUwYWZmY2E5MjdiZDdiOGZhZDlhZjM3N2M1ODgyZjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/divyank1997/patternforge/commit/b84d01145a278dcd2302a74a9fc9f0469cdd1db4","sha":"b84d01145a278dcd2302a74a9fc9f0469cdd1db4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divyank1997/patternforge/commits/b84d01145a278dcd2302a74a9fc9f0469cdd1db4"}],"sha":"b1f1e834450affca927bd7b8fad9af377c5882f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divyank1997/patternforge/commits/b1f1e834450affca927bd7b8fad9af377c5882f7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divyank1997/patternforge/commits/b84d01145a278dcd2302a74a9fc9f0469cdd1db4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T13:07:12Z","email":"divyanksrivastava@Divyanks-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Divyank Srivastava"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T13:07:12Z","email":"divyanksrivastava@Divyanks-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Divyank Srivastava"},"message":"feat: initial monorepo scaffold — MFE + microservices architecture\n\n- Turborepo monorepo with 5 MFE apps (shell, auth, editor, gallery, dashboard)\n- 6 Fastify microservices (api-gateway, auth, pattern, search, ai, notification)\n- Shared packages: types, ui, utils, config\n- PostgreSQL/Prisma schema for auth-service\n- DynamoDB (pattern-service), OpenSearch (search-service), Claude API (ai-service)\n- GitHub Actions CI pipeline\n- Architecture documented in README\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"134bbc8465706e2233dbd5162f86a6dbf58c6245","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divyank1997/patternforge/git/trees/134bbc8465706e2233dbd5162f86a6dbf58c6245"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divyank1997/patternforge/git/commits/b84d01145a278dcd2302a74a9fc9f0469cdd1db4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/divyank1997/patternforge/commit/b84d01145a278dcd2302a74a9fc9f0469cdd1db4","node_id":"C_kwDOSTGustoAKGI4NGQwMTE0NWEyNzhkY2QyMzAyYTc0YTlmYzlmMDQ2OWNkZDFkYjQ","parents":[],"sha":"b84d01145a278dcd2302a74a9fc9f0469cdd1db4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/divyank1997/patternforge/commits/b84d01145a278dcd2302a74a9fc9f0469cdd1db4"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/divyank1997/patternforge/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=0ab7dbcd14479db474e4f789a843e04d10098455&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A00%3A10.723Z"}');
