8a0b3024b76160e628b0e262"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:52:49.931Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25696352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","id":25696352,"login":"SEO-Agentur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Njk2MzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/278d4c9a79e242cced0da84f9c1f8a6224ebe627/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T17:47:53Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T17:47:53Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"message":"feat(hero): drop / paste / + Brief on the landing-page prompt\n\nThe drop-a-file-as-prompt flow shipped earlier only lived inside the\neditor''s chat panel. The landing hero needed it too — that''s the\nmoment a visitor with an existing brief (PRD, design doc, content\nspreadsheet) reaches for it.\n\nFactored out apps/web/lib/read-file-as-prompt.ts as the single\nimplementation. Handles .md/.txt/source/.csv inline, lazy-imports\nmammoth for .docx and SheetJS for .xls/.xlsx/.ods. Same MIME-type and\nextension allowlist. 10 MB raw cap, no text truncation. Also exposes\nthe PROMPT_FILE_ACCEPT constant so both UIs keep their file pickers\nin sync.\n\nHeroPrompt now:\n- Highlights when a file is dragged over the textarea container\n- Accepts drop, Cmd+V (file in clipboard), and a \"+ Brief\" picker\n- Surfaces parse errors inline (e.g. legacy .doc rejection) without\n  blocking the visitor from typing a prompt manually\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c01d625988aa385f8c8d9a22ee25cfa1d85cb64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/trees/4c01d625988aa385f8c8d9a22ee25cfa1d85cb64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/commits/278d4c9a79e242cced0da84f9c1f8a6224ebe627","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25696352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","id":25696352,"login":"SEO-Agentur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Njk2MzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commit/278d4c9a79e242cced0da84f9c1f8a6224ebe627","node_id":"C_kwDOSTcMU9oAKDI3OGQ0YzlhNzllMjQyY2NlZDBkYTg0ZjljMWY4YTYyMjRlYmU2Mjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commit/dc7cf1e3ad8cce5d5514d44c42344395c4a3cc10","sha":"dc7cf1e3ad8cce5d5514d44c42344395c4a3cc10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/dc7cf1e3ad8cce5d5514d44c42344395c4a3cc10"}],"sha":"278d4c9a79e242cced0da84f9c1f8a6224ebe627","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/278d4c9a79e242cced0da84f9c1f8a6224ebe627"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25696352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","id":25696352,"login":"SEO-Agentur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Njk2MzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/dc7cf1e3ad8cce5d5514d44c42344395c4a3cc10/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T17:44:16Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T17:44:16Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"message":"feat(trial): remove input/output squeeze — match model ceiling\n\nThree coordinated changes so prompts and rewrites aren''t artificially\ncapped:\n\n- trial_ai_config (live DB UPDATE on the VPS): max_input_tokens\n  1800 → 150_000, max_output_tokens 16000 → 48_000. Haiku 4.5''s\n  hard ceilings are 200k context and 64k output; we sit just under\n  both so a multi-file rewrite or a dropped docx brief goes through\n  in one shot.\n- chat-panel.tsx: drop the 20k-char extracted-text truncation\n  entirely. The orchestrator''s per-request estimateTokens check is\n  the real cap and returns a clear 413 with token counts if it does\n  fire. Raw-upload byte cap kept (but raised 5 MB → 10 MB) as a\n  sanity guard against accidentally loading a binary into memory.\n- index.ts: express.json body limit 5mb → 25mb so a chat history\n  with several dropped briefs doesn''t 413 on the way in.\n\nDaily $ cap ($50/day) is still the real ceiling and stays unchanged\n— that''s the only knob that actually protects the trial Anthropic\nkey from a viral leak.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b7d2c9e0795bd400cea385414d80f0d9b259f82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/trees/9b7d2c9e0795bd400cea385414d80f0d9b259f82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/commits/dc7cf1e3ad8cce5d5514d44c42344395c4a3cc10","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25696352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","id":25696352,"login":"SEO-Agentur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Njk2MzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commit/dc7cf1e3ad8cce5d5514d44c42344395c4a3cc10","node_id":"C_kwDOSTcMU9oAKGRjN2NmMWUzYWQ4Y2NlNWQ1NTE0ZDQ0YzQyMzQ0Mzk1YzRhM2NjMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commit/2fd8a05433b9b1a94d5497969b4bbaf5d9e110f4","sha":"2fd8a05433b9b1a94d5497969b4bbaf5d9e110f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/2fd8a05433b9b1a94d5497969b4bbaf5d9e110f4"}],"sha":"dc7cf1e3ad8cce5d5514d44c42344395c4a3cc10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/dc7cf1e3ad8cce5d5514d44c42344395c4a3cc10"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25696352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","id":25696352,"login":"SEO-Agentur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Njk2MzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/2fd8a05433b9b1a94d5497969b4bbaf5d9e110f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T17:41:27Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T17:41:27Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"message":"feat(chat): accept .docx / .xlsx / .csv / etc. as prompt sources\n\nThe chat-panel \"drop a file\" flow now handles Office documents in\naddition to plain text. Parsers are lazy-imported so they don''t\nbloat the initial bundle.\n\n- .docx → mammoth.extractRawText → plain text. Legacy .doc rejected\n  with a \"save as .docx in Word first\" message (no browser-friendly\n  parser for the old binary format).\n- .xls / .xlsx / .xlsm / .xlsb / .ods → SheetJS (xlsx). Each sheet\n  rendered as CSV under a \"# Sheet: <name>\" header so the AI can\n  tell tabs apart.\n- .csv / .tsv / .log / .rtf — already covered, just listed\n  explicitly in the file-picker accept attribute.\n\nCaps:\n- Raw upload cap raised 500 KB → 5 MB so a typical .docx/.xlsx fits.\n- Extracted text capped at 20k chars (~5k tokens) with a truncation\n  note appended, so the chat stays inside the trial pool''s input\n  budget.\n\nDeps added: mammoth ^1.8, xlsx ^0.18.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e34f9b30d02938d891a179e1575f34c3151af6eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/trees/e34f9b30d02938d891a179e1575f34c3151af6eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/commits/2fd8a05433b9b1a94d5497969b4bbaf5d9e110f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25696352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","id":25696352,"login":"SEO-Agentur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Njk2MzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commit/2fd8a05433b9b1a94d5497969b4bbaf5d9e110f4","node_id":"C_kwDOSTcMU9oAKDJmZDhhMDU0MzNiOWIxYTk0ZDU0OTc5NjliNGJiYWY1ZDllMTEwZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commit/301ba70766081d14171fdf0f7e7e87258beea5f4","sha":"301ba70766081d14171fdf0f7e7e87258beea5f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/301ba70766081d14171fdf0f7e7e87258beea5f4"}],"sha":"2fd8a05433b9b1a94d5497969b4bbaf5d9e110f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/2fd8a05433b9b1a94d5497969b4bbaf5d9e110f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25696352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","id":25696352,"login":"SEO-Agentur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Njk2MzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/301ba70766081d14171fdf0f7e7e87258beea5f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T17:36:29Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T17:36:29Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"message":"feat(chat): master prompt pinning + ?infinity VIP bypass\n\nMASTER PROMPT\nThe first user message of a chat session becomes the master prompt for\nthat project — the user''s original brief that every subsequent edit\nshould remain compatible with. Persisted in localStorage under\n`seo_master_prompt_<projectId>` so it survives reloads.\n\nUI: pinned amber-tinted strip at the top of the chat panel showing\nthe prompt, with an Edit affordance (inline textarea + Save / Cancel /\nClear). When onboarding hands off `initialDraft`, that becomes the\nseed master.\n\nPrompt: systemPrompt() now takes a masterPrompt arg and prepends a\n\"MASTER PROMPT — source of truth\" block above the SEO rules so the\nmodel is reminded on every turn. It''s told to surface conflicts and\nask before contradicting the master.\n\n?INFINITY VIP BYPASS\nVisiting any seowebsitesbuilder.com URL with `?infinity` (or\n`?infinity=anything`, or `?=infinity`) sets `seo_vip_until` in\nlocalStorage for 24h. The URL param is stripped from the address bar\non detection so it doesn''t get accidentally shared into a screenshot.\n\nWhile the pass is active, the web app sends `x-seo-vip: 1` on chat\nrequests. The orchestrator''s trial-AI gateway reads the header and\npasses `vipBypass: true` to checkAvailability, which skips the\nper-user prompt count limit. The daily $ cap remains enforced server-\nside — by design — so a leaked pass URL can''t nuke our monthly\nAnthropic spend.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f1661cb3c919540af7977e0d39d45a6f243bb83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/trees/7f1661cb3c919540af7977e0d39d45a6f243bb83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/commits/301ba70766081d14171fdf0f7e7e87258beea5f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25696352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","id":25696352,"login":"SEO-Agentur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Njk2MzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commit/301ba70766081d14171fdf0f7e7e87258beea5f4","node_id":"C_kwDOSTcMU9oAKDMwMWJhNzA3NjYwODFkMTQxNzFmZGYwZjdlN2U4NzI1OGJlZWE1ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commit/47f8a0b1df289d8418c94f893ce1fbc74340f54f","sha":"47f8a0b1df289d8418c94f893ce1fbc74340f54f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/47f8a0b1df289d8418c94f893ce1fbc74340f54f"}],"sha":"301ba70766081d14171fdf0f7e7e87258beea5f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/301ba70766081d14171fdf0f7e7e87258beea5f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25696352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","id":25696352,"login":"SEO-Agentur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Njk2MzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/47f8a0b1df289d8418c94f893ce1fbc74340f54f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T17:26:41Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T17:26:41Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"message":"feat(chat): drop / paste / attach a file as the prompt\n\nThe chat input now accepts text files three ways:\n  - Drag-and-drop onto the input area (highlights while hovering)\n  - Cmd/Ctrl+V with a file in the clipboard\n  - \"+ Attach\" button that opens a file picker\n\nEach file''s UTF-8 text gets appended to the textarea wrapped in a\n`--- <filename> ---` separator so the user can drop multiple files and\nstill tell them apart. Guarded by:\n  - 500 KB per-file cap (so we don''t load binaries into the textarea)\n  - whitelist of text-like MIME types + extensions (.md, .txt, .json,\n    .yml, source files etc.) — binary types are rejected with a friendly\n    message\n\nUseful for pasting briefs (PRDs, design specs, handoff docs) without\ncopy-pasting through a tiny textarea.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3daaa9138c8b960720e411c138f41d3fd09d91db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/trees/3daaa9138c8b960720e411c138f41d3fd09d91db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/commits/47f8a0b1df289d8418c94f893ce1fbc74340f54f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25696352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","id":25696352,"login":"SEO-Agentur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Njk2MzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commit/47f8a0b1df289d8418c94f893ce1fbc74340f54f","node_id":"C_kwDOSTcMU9oAKDQ3ZjhhMGIxZGYyODlkODQxOGM5NGY4OTNjZTFmYmM3NDM0MGY1NGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commit/bafe6d1761db05d9b2911f3dd3531dbc26cbac03","sha":"bafe6d1761db05d9b2911f3dd3531dbc26cbac03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/bafe6d1761db05d9b2911f3dd3531dbc26cbac03"}],"sha":"47f8a0b1df289d8418c94f893ce1fbc74340f54f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/47f8a0b1df289d8418c94f893ce1fbc74340f54f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25696352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","id":25696352,"login":"SEO-Agentur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Njk2MzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/bafe6d1761db05d9b2911f3dd3531dbc26cbac03/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T14:36:21Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T14:36:21Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"message":"fix(start): kill 409 conflict on container creation\n\nTwo layers of defense:\n\napps/orchestrator/src/docker.ts — replace the silent \"stop + remove\"\nthat only catches errors with a docker.listContainers({ all: true,\nfilters: { name: ... } }) sweep that removes every container claiming\nthis project''s reserved name regardless of state (running/paused/\nexited/dead). A 200ms grace period after the sweep lets Docker release\nthe name before we recreate.\n\napps/orchestrator/src/projects.ts — add per-project start locks\n(Map<projectId, Promise>). A second POST /:id/start while the first\nis in flight awaits the existing promise instead of kicking off a\nparallel docker.create, so a user double-clicking Start can''t race\nthrough two concurrent container creations on the same name.\n\nAlso bumped trial_ai_config.max_output_tokens from 10k → 16k via SQL\non the VPS so a full-page rewrite from Haiku doesn''t truncate mid-file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0dbbd67e83693b0c400f3d40058aca87d003525e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/trees/0dbbd67e83693b0c400f3d40058aca87d003525e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/commits/bafe6d1761db05d9b2911f3dd3531dbc26cbac03","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25696352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","id":25696352,"login":"SEO-Agentur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Njk2MzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commit/bafe6d1761db05d9b2911f3dd3531dbc26cbac03","node_id":"C_kwDOSTcMU9oAKGJhZmU2ZDE3NjFkYjA1ZDliMjkxMWYzZGQzNTMxZGJjMjZjYmFjMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commit/e2fd39c120e3ff982fa92dd8abb0655a2121d347","sha":"e2fd39c120e3ff982fa92dd8abb0655a2121d347","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/e2fd39c120e3ff982fa92dd8abb0655a2121d347"}],"sha":"bafe6d1761db05d9b2911f3dd3531dbc26cbac03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/bafe6d1761db05d9b2911f3dd3531dbc26cbac03"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25696352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","id":25696352,"login":"SEO-Agentur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Njk2MzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/e2fd39c120e3ff982fa92dd8abb0655a2121d347/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T14:28:44Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T14:28:44Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"message":"fix(templates): make sidebar link real + cards auth-aware\n\nThe \"Templates\" sidebar entry across dashboard/settings/billing/domains\nwas a dead <a> tag with no href. It now links to /templates.\n\nThe /templates cards previously always linked to /signup?template=...,\nuseless for already-signed-in users. Split the card into a client\ncomponent (templates/template-card.tsx):\n  - Authed user: clicks → api.createProject(name, framework, \"none\",\n    templateId) → router.push to the editor. 402 errors (Free-plan\n    project limit) redirect to /billing.\n  - Public visitor: behaves as before but also stashes templateId in\n    localStorage so the onboarding step after signup can pre-select it.\n\nSignup checks localStorage for either seo_pending_prompt OR\nseo_pending_template before deciding whether to redirect to /onboarding.\n\nOnboarding''s useEffect now considers a stashed template after the\nprompt match — so a user who clicked \"Lawyer template\" on /templates\nlands at the right card in onboarding even if they didn''t type a prompt.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a602071cd7a369de994c33d076e9cf6306cbda65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/trees/a602071cd7a369de994c33d076e9cf6306cbda65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/commits/e2fd39c120e3ff982fa92dd8abb0655a2121d347","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25696352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","id":25696352,"login":"SEO-Agentur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Njk2MzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commit/e2fd39c120e3ff982fa92dd8abb0655a2121d347","node_id":"C_kwDOSTcMU9oAKGUyZmQzOWMxMjBlM2ZmOTgyZmE5MmRkOGFiYjA2NTVhMjEyMWQzNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commit/4b564977299dc109ec61983a27404a5073f8aeef","sha":"4b564977299dc109ec61983a27404a5073f8aeef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/4b564977299dc109ec61983a27404a5073f8aeef"}],"sha":"e2fd39c120e3ff982fa92dd8abb0655a2121d347","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/e2fd39c120e3ff982fa92dd8abb0655a2121d347"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25696352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","id":25696352,"login":"SEO-Agentur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Njk2MzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/4b564977299dc109ec61983a27404a5073f8aeef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T14:18:57Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T14:18:57Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"message":"fix(chat): auto-send initialDraft once files + keys are ready\n\n\"Build it →\" in /onboarding hands the user''s prompt to the editor as\n`initialDraft`, which previously pre-filled the chat textarea but did\nNOT send. Users would land on the editor, see the generic starter\ntemplate untouched, and not realise they still needed to hit Send.\n\nNow the chat panel fires `send()` exactly once on mount when:\n  - initialDraft is non-empty\n  - the project''s file list has loaded (so the system prompt sees real\n    files for the AI to edit)\n  - the AI-keys state has resolved (so we know BYOK vs trial tier)\n  - no chat history exists yet (don''t re-fire on follow-up renders)\n\nGuarded with `autoSentRef` so React Strict-mode double-invocation\ndoesn''t double-fire.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac755362563ab94571a737a0b657ec8d509d192f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/trees/ac755362563ab94571a737a0b657ec8d509d192f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/commits/4b564977299dc109ec61983a27404a5073f8aeef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25696352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","id":25696352,"login":"SEO-Agentur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Njk2MzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commit/4b564977299dc109ec61983a27404a5073f8aeef","node_id":"C_kwDOSTcMU9oAKDRiNTY0OTc3Mjk5ZGMxMDllYzYxOTgzYTI3NDA0YTUwNzNmOGFlZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commit/22cb7f08e6a078a728580dbdf47b33bc7011d396","sha":"22cb7f08e6a078a728580dbdf47b33bc7011d396","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/22cb7f08e6a078a728580dbdf47b33bc7011d396"}],"sha":"4b564977299dc109ec61983a27404a5073f8aeef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/4b564977299dc109ec61983a27404a5073f8aeef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25696352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","id":25696352,"login":"SEO-Agentur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Njk2MzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/22cb7f08e6a078a728580dbdf47b33bc7011d396/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T14:15:23Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T14:15:23Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"message":"fix(docker): wait for dev server to bind port before marking running\n\nDocker returns from container.start() the moment the container is *up*,\nbut the dev server inside (pnpm dev / npx serve / etc.) still needs a\nbeat to actually listen on its port. The frontend was marking the\nproject as running right after, and the iframe''s first request would\nland in that window — proxy returned ECONNRESET, iframe permanently\ndisplayed \"Preview unavailable: read ECONNRESET\" until the user hit ↺.\n\nNow startContainer() polls the upstream port after container.start()\nand only returns once a real HTTP response (any status) comes back.\nTimeout 15s for html/php, 45s for next/astro (which can do pnpm install\nat boot if the prebuilt image isn''t available).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5344b86c2dc21a9b3c4fb3876e19f5e3f816fe64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/trees/5344b86c2dc21a9b3c4fb3876e19f5e3f816fe64"},"url