ivacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","id":25696352,"login":"SEO-Agentur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Njk2MzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/79efd2f94d4c8466c3543b08b3e02f0348715b0c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T14:10:49Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T14:10:49Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"message":"fix(auth): stop auto-seeding the \"My first SEO site\" starter on signup\n\nEvery new user got a starter project created at signup, which used up\nthe Free plan''s 1-project quota — so the moment they finished the\nhero-prompt → /onboarding flow and clicked \"Build it\", the create-\nproject call 402''d with \"Your Free plan allows 1 project.\"\n\nThe starter was useful when the dashboard was an empty room. Now that\nthe hero-prompt → onboarding flow IS the first-project path, the seed\njust gets in the way. Removing it.\n\nExisting users with stale \"My first SEO site\" rows can delete them via\nthe dashboard. They are still gated at 1 project on Free until they do.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b4b1eb8f91e6b0017b3813a942e435e8db1d294","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/trees/9b4b1eb8f91e6b0017b3813a942e435e8db1d294"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/commits/79efd2f94d4c8466c3543b08b3e02f0348715b0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25696352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","id":25696352,"login":"SEO-Agentur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Njk2MzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commit/79efd2f94d4c8466c3543b08b3e02f0348715b0c","node_id":"C_kwDOSTcMU9oAKDc5ZWZkMmY5NGQ0Yzg0NjZjMzU0M2IwOGIzZTAyZjAzNDg3MTViMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commit/1d365b7a02cabfade0d5c6da4783bac559d139d6","sha":"1d365b7a02cabfade0d5c6da4783bac559d139d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/1d365b7a02cabfade0d5c6da4783bac559d139d6"}],"sha":"79efd2f94d4c8466c3543b08b3e02f0348715b0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/79efd2f94d4c8466c3543b08b3e02f0348715b0c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25696352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","id":25696352,"login":"SEO-Agentur","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Njk2MzUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/commits/1d365b7a02cabfade0d5c6da4783bac559d139d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T19:20:58Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T19:20:58Z","email":"cyrusbadde@gmail.com","name":"Cyrus Badde"},"message":"feat(editor): Slice B — v0-style layout + file ops + greyed export\n\nUI restructure to match the v0/Lovable editor we agreed on:\n\n- Top nav: logo · scope-switcher placeholder · project breadcrumb ·\n  framework crumb · status pill · saving indicator · Terminal toggle ·\n  Start/Stop · Settings/Share placeholders · Publish · Export dropdown\n  (Deploy / GitHub / .zip) · avatar.\n- Left pane: ChatPanel only, full-height, collapsible via the « toggle\n  in the right pane''s tab bar.\n- Right pane: 4-way tabbed — 👁 Preview · </> Code · 🗄 Database\n  (hidden when backend=none) · 📊 SEO. Per-tab toolbar follows the\n  tabs row; mobile/path/refresh/↗ live in the Preview row, \"+ New\"\n  + active-path crumb live in the Code row.\n- Code tab: file tree (left subpane, 224 px) + Monaco (right subpane).\n  Files now support:\n  • + New: prompts for path, writes empty file, opens it\n  • Double-click filename: inline rename input (Esc cancels, blur or\n    Enter commits via the new /file/rename endpoint)\n  • Hover delete icon (🗑) per row with confirm\n  • Drag-and-drop upload: text files go through writeFile, binaries\n    through the new base64 upload path in the same /file PUT route\n- Export icon:\n  • canExport=true → solid border + ⤴ + dropdown (Deploy / GitHub / .zip)\n  • canExport=false → greyed + 🔒 + link to /billing?from=export, with\n    tooltip explaining what unlocks it\n- Backend additions:\n  • POST /projects/:id/file/rename ({from, to})\n  • PUT /projects/:id/file now accepts {base64: true} and decodes\n    before writing (skipping the file_versions text snapshot)\n\nSEO panel folded into the right-pane tabs (4th tab) instead of a\nseparate sidebar. Terminal stays as a slide-up drawer under Monaco\ninside the Code tab.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f79c191391e8662a12494028c5b8bba0e0b2292","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/trees/9f79c191391e8662a12494028c5b8bba0e0b2292"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SEO-Agentur/seowebsitesbuilder/git/commits/1d365b7a02cabfade0d5c6da4783bac559d139d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25696352?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SEO-Agentur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SEO-Agentur","i