nda@gmail.com","name":"Mounika"},"message":"feat: streaming chat with skeleton loader; role wording fixes; remove em dashes\n\n- Chatbot now streams the AI reply: a skeleton loader (shimmering text\n  lines) shows while waiting, then swaps to a message bubble that grows\n  token by token with a blinking caret. Falls back to plain JSON replies\n  from older API deployments.\n- lib/api.ts: new streamChat() helper parsing Server-Sent Events.\n- Complyia engagement reworded: part of the frontend team who contributed\n  (not \"sole frontend architect\"); platform named Complyia instead of C-Cloud.\n- Experience headers now always show role titles, deduped across grouped\n  engagements (previously missing for multi-client companies).\n- Remove em dashes from all site copy and the README.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6361923d6884d8faf5be588e4127b80e584834bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mounikamurugonda/portfolio/git/trees/6361923d6884d8faf5be588e4127b80e584834bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mounikamurugonda/portfolio/git/commits/4e9da525bc0e984ad2ec4bad7fee605f0e66c7b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62608823?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mounikamurugonda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mounikamurugonda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mounikamurugonda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mounikamurugonda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mounikamurugonda","id":62608823,"login":"mounikamurugonda","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNjA4ODIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mounikamurugonda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mounikamurugonda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mounikamurugond