7-app Nx micro-frontend monorepo, RAG v1 integration (streaming chat,\n  citations, function calling), 55+ component design system, Azure DevOps\n  CI/CD with Nx affected builds, testing strategy, and ~6-engineer team lead.\n- PwC presented as one continuous 12-month engagement (Cloud for Tax +\n  Entity Operations) with updated bullets (yFiles graphs, Power BI embedding,\n  GraphQL APIs, Prisma migrations).\n- HFMA MapApp updated: Angular 12, 10 lazy-loaded feature modules, NgRx/RxJS.\n- WTP project renamed to Modernized Processing System (MPS).\n- Skills grid matched to resume taxonomy (Testing & Quality, CI/CD & Build,\n  Recharts/Power BI/Highcharts; removed CMS & E-commerce category).\n- Title standardized to \"Senior Frontend Engineer\"; SEO meta updated from\n  6+ to 13+ years.\n\nCleanup:\n- Remove unused apps/ux-showcase (no longer linked from the site) and its\n  package.json scripts.\n- Remove implementation_plan.md and commit-changes.bat working files.\n- Fold SUPABASE_SETUP.md into the rewritten README.\n\nDocs:\n- New README with step-by-step setup, mermaid architecture and RAG sequence\n  diagrams, and security notes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d83757622d9cfe782bfc5cb15125fe85e055a239","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mounikamurugonda/portfolio/git/trees/d83757622d9cfe782bfc5cb15125fe85e055a239"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mounikamurugonda/portfolio/git/commits/914cba69228699cfa525fee83ea84df6c19f2a4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62608823?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mounikamurugonda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mounikamurugonda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mounikamurugonda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mounikamurugonda/gists{/gist_id}