x to Caddy migration\n\nBackend:\n- 8 JPA entities + 8 repositories for RBAC + AI model config\n- AdminController + AiModelConfigController with full CRUD\n- AdminService + AiModelConfigService business logic\n- V7 + V8 Flyway migrations (evolve V1 tables with missing columns)\n- Fix ScopedValueTenantContext NPE (ThreadLocal fallback)\n- Fix SecurityFilterChainConfig dev-mode API bypass\n- Fix @PrePersist updatedAt null constraint violation\n\nFrontend:\n- 6 enterprise views (Users, Roles, Menus, Buttons, DataRules, AI Models)\n- Real fetch API contracts (admin-contract.ts, ai-contract.ts)\n- Router + LayoutView enterprise nav integration\n- MenusView sorted display with parent-child hierarchy\n\nInfrastructure:\n- Migrate Nginx to Caddy (handle block isolation, :8088)\n- deploy/caddy-local.Caddyfile + deploy/frontend/Caddyfile\n- scripts/caddy.bat + start-caddy.sh management scripts\n- promtail-config.yaml updated for Caddy JSON logs\n- Remove all nginx config files and scripts\n\nDocs:\n- Update AGENTS.md, ARCHITECTURE.md, .claude_memory.md\n- MICRO_FRONTEND_GUIDE.md CSP reference updated","tree":{"sha":"ca93d02de43d3852a497467c472386c08202bc37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zc86-bir/aurora-lowcode/git/trees/ca93d02de43d3852a497467c472386c08202bc37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zc86-bir/aurora-lowcode/git/commits/93b7be03d9a2fb128e10ee7e9ffdcf3ee38329c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/193842023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zc86-bir","id":193842023,"login":"Zc86-bir","node_id":"U_kgDOC43LZw","organizations_url"