023,"login":"Zc86-bir","node_id":"U_kgDOC43LZw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zc86-bir/aurora-lowcode/commits/e0624e949c5807cbc83479ee7542c6875c85bcc7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T05:51:29Z","email":"dengyyh@gmail.com","name":"Zc86-bir"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T05:51:29Z","email":"dengyyh@gmail.com","name":"Zc86-bir"},"message":"fix: PHASE 9 code review — 5 CRITICAL + 8 HIGH fixes [skip ci]\n\nCRITICAL:\n- C1: ApiKeyService.validateApiKey removed readOnly=true (EXPIRED status + lastUsedAt now persisted)\n- C2: WebhookSecretEncryptor (AES-256-GCM) — secrets encrypted at rest\n- C3: constantTimeEquals no longer leaks length (XOR-based with minLen)\n- C4/C5: UrlValidator blocks SSRF (private/loopback/link-local IPs, AWS IMDS, GCP metadata)\n- H3: SecurityFilterChain /api/v1/external/** changed from permitAll() to authenticated()\n\nHIGH:\n- H2: ApiKeyAuthenticationFilter try/finally narrowed (no spurious clearContext calls)\n- H4: Consistent 401 response format\n- H5: Removed duplicate findByTenantIdAndActiveTrue (consolidated into findActiveByTenantId)\n- H6: HttpClient.followRedirects(NEVER) on webhook dispatcher\n- H7: Retry only on retryable exceptions (IOException, ConnectException, HttpTimeoutException)\n- H8: OptimisticLockException caught on counter updates (concurrent delivery safe)\n- M4: Duplicate query method removed\n\nOTHER:\n- M1: Key length doc corrected (44→43 chars)\n- M5: SecureRandom moved to static final field\n- M8/M10: Dead YAML retry config removed (programmatic config used instead)\n- Removed response body from webhook error logs (privacy)","tree":{"sha":"0b916880fe1d152a209e530e0d82d1055d11877d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zc86-bir/aurora-lowcode/git/trees/0b916880fe1d152a209e530e0d82d1055d11877d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zc86-bir/aurora-lowcode/git/commits/e0624e949c5807cbc83479ee7542c6875c85bcc7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/193842023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zc86-bir","id":193842023,"login":"Zc86-bir","node_id":"U_kgDOC43LZw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Zc86-bir/aurora-lowcode/commit/e0624e949c5807cbc83479ee7542c6875c85bcc7","node_id":"C_kwDOSTpzH9oAKGUwNjI0ZTk0OWM1ODA3Y2JjODM0NzllZTc1NDJjNjg3NWM4NWJjYzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Zc86-bir/aurora-lowcode/commit/9ada0b225d1f58403ffd1ba2f4b933ce50eca3e2","sha":"9ada0b225d1f58403ffd1ba2f4b933ce50eca3e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zc86-bir/aurora-lowcode/commits/9ada0b225d1f58403ffd1ba2f4b933ce50eca3e2"}],"sha":"e0624e949c5807cbc83479ee7542c6875c85bcc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zc86-bir/auror