son)\n- WebhookDispatcher (StructuredTaskScope + virtual threads + Resilience4j retry)\n- WebhookConfiguration (auto-subscribes to all DomainEvent types)\n- WebhookController (CRUD + secret regeneration)\n- Flyway V5: webhook_endpoint table\n\nTASK 3: JMH Performance Benchmarking (T18)\n- VirtualThreadVsPlatformThreadBenchmark (virtual/fixed200/fixed16/cached)\n- BenchmarkRunner (outputs JSON to target/)\n- run-benchmark.sh + batch script\n\nTASK 4: Chaos Engineering & Resilience Validation\n- ChaosResilienceIntegrationTest (latency assault + circuit breaker open)\n- chaos-monkey-spring-boot 3.1.0 dependency (test scope)\n- application-chaos.yml (NEVER production)\n- Resilience4j config: llmGateway CB + webhookDispatcher retry\n\nTASK 5: V1.0.0 GA\n- pom.xml: 1.0.0-SNAPSHOT → 1.0.0\n- README.md: version badge, 4 new features (API key, webhook, JMH, chaos), updated stats\n- .claude_memory.md: PHASE 9 records, T18 marked done, version history\n- ARCHITECTURE.md: Section 14 (PHASE 9), updated file counts (175 total)","tree":{"sha":"7a238637c1413e18531a5d875542e768379ba819","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zc86-bir/aurora-lowcode/git/trees/7a238637c1413e18531a5d875542e768379ba819"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zc86-bir/aurora-lowcode/git/commits/9ada0b225d1f58403ffd1ba2f4b933ce50eca3e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/193842023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zc86-bir","id":193842023,"login":"Zc86-bir","node_id":"U_kgDOC43LZw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zc86-bir/orgs","received_events_url":"https://ap