ments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-04T13:08:27Z","email":"railcennetov@gmail.com","name":"RailJannatov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-04T13:08:27Z","email":"railcennetov@gmail.com","name":"RailJannatov"},"message":"Initial commit: micro frontend admin shell\n\n- Host (port 3000) composing two remotes via Webpack 5 Module Federation\n- remote-dashboard (3001): nested routes, lazy sub-pages, dashboard hook\n- remote-users (3002): lazy routes, complex form (RHF + Zod), localStorage-backed users API\n- shared workspace: MUI theme + tokens, reusable components (PageHeader, StatCard,\n  EmptyState, RemoteBoundary), form layer (FormTextField/Select/Checkbox/ErrorSummary),\n  hooks (useDebounce), test utils (customRender + MSW), formatters\n- Singleton sharing of React, react-router-dom, MUI, Emotion across all configs\n- splitChunks: vendor-mui / vendor-router / vendors cache groups (production)\n- Bundle analyzer behind ANALYZE=1, fork-ts-checker for parallel type checking\n- Tests: Vitest + Testing Library + MSW + jsdom; SideNav, RemoteBoundary, StatCard,\n  CreateUserForm, useDebounce, useDashboardData, formatters\n- Tooling: ESLint + Prettier + EditorConfig; npm workspaces; concurrently for dev\n- README documents architecture, chunk strategy, testing, scaling risks, strengths/weaknesses","tree":{"sha":"4357ff2fd066c8eb729988affc9f8914c94d5657","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RailJannatov/mf-admin/git/trees/4357ff2fd066c8eb729988affc9f8914c94d5657"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RailJannatov/mf-admin/git/commits/a77ee40701eca818f0e48a91ac9fd2f921d77877","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83506243?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RailJannatov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RailJannatov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RailJannat