t(launchpad): wire generation flow to new BFF contract (JSON metadata + ZIP)\n\nGeneration flow now uses two-step approach per confirmed BFF contract:\n1. POST /api/v1/generate → returns JSON metadata with per-artifact status\n2. POST /api/v1/generate/zip → returns ZIP blob (same request body)\n\nChanges:\n- generation.model.ts: add GenerationArtifact and GenerationMetadataResult\n  interfaces matching BFF response shape (target, serviceType, status,\n  path, files, error)\n- generation-api.service.ts: generateService() now returns JSON metadata;\n  add downloadServiceZip() for ZIP blob download\n- mock-generation-api.service.ts: mock both methods with artifact data\n  including web/mobile artifacts when uiTargets are present\n- generation-wizard.component.ts: generateService() calls metadata first,\n  then auto-downloads ZIP; result card shows per-artifact status badges\n  with success/failed indicators and error messages","tree":{"sha":"b530e8de7dd5e4f60f1af6f43a2832b88a2f7811","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/git/trees/b530e8de7dd5e4f60f1af6f43a2832b88a2f7811"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/git/commits/b92e0b29cc08d2430263ba5dcb83cf4d4d50bdb3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276426437?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anand-clarivex","id":276426437,"login":"anand-clarivex","node_id":"U_kgDOEHnuxQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/receiv