feNames (was always empty, hardcoded /api/v1/mat-mfe in template)\n- Replace NgModule pattern (module.ts + routing.module.ts) with Angular 18 standalone component;\n  Canvas modules now imported directly into the component''s imports array\n- Add routes.tstemplate.sbn exporting MFE_ROUTES as a plain Routes array (no NgModule)\n- Add license headers to component.ts, api.service.ts, index.ts, routes.ts\n- Fix index.ts public API: remove NgModule/RoutingModule exports, export MFE_ROUTES instead\n- Fix CLAUDE.md.sbn: replace non-existent model.names.mfe_name/model.manifest.name\n  with model.manifest.service_name; fix Canvas modules blank-line whitespace\n- Add missing Nx workspace files: nx.json, package.json, tsconfig.json\n- Add missing Nx lib config: libs/__APP__/project.json, tsconfig.lib.json, tsconfig.spec.json\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"02ac90e99b247baaefbdadaba4b2d7662c6af778","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/git/trees/02ac90e99b247baaefbdadaba4b2d7662c6af778"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/git/commits/03c00a868da7c15b89afbfe50337309478ff2924","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/commit/03c00a868da7c15b89afbfe50337309478ff2924","node_id":"C_kwDOSUDy3toAKDAzYzAwYTg2OGRhN2MxNWI4OWFmYmZlNTAzMzczMDk0NzhmZjI5MjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/commit/6559259c7d5bdf56b644c1465a73cf662af3f0ae","sha":"6559259c7d5bdf56b644c1465a73cf662af3f0ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/commits/6559259c7d5bdf56b644c1465a73cf662af3f0ae"}],"sha":"03c00a868da7c15b89afbfe50337309478ff2924","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/commits/03c00a868da7c15b89afbfe50337309478ff2924"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserc