mail":"I30253@verisk.com","name":"Anand Jayaseelan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T19:54:08Z","email":"I30253@verisk.com","name":"Anand Jayaseelan"},"message":"fix(angular-shell-scaffold): remove extra blank lines in Canvas modules list\n\nSwitch for/end to {{- for/end to strip whitespace so the Canvas modules\nlist renders as a tight bullet list without blank lines between entries.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2c350240762a5988eae084c89116aab65f9b42d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/git/trees/2c350240762a5988eae084c89116aab65f9b42d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/git/commits/c7a1007cc0184a0c81e3c543503fbd53f7c60c7c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/commit/c7a1007cc0184a0c81e3c543503fbd53f7c60c7c","node_id":"C_kwDOSUDy3toAKGM3YTEwMDdjYzAxODRhMGM4MWUzYzU0MzUwM2ZiZDUzZjdjNjBjN2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/commit/7c53f2b1eea7d555fc5630798ff01a09d16fc763","sha":"7c53f2b1eea7d555fc5630798ff01a09d16fc763","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/commits/7c53f2b1eea7d555fc5630798ff01a09d16fc763"}],"sha":"c7a1007cc0184a0c81e3c543503fbd53f7c60c7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/commits/c7a1007cc0184a0c81e3c543503fbd53f7c60c7c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/commits/7c53f2b1eea7d555fc5630798ff01a09d16fc763/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T19:44:23Z","email":"I30253@verisk.com","name":"Anand Jayaseelan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T19:44:23Z","email":"I30253@verisk.com","name":"Anand Jayaseelan"},"message":"fix(angular-shell-scaffold): fix blank CLAUDE.md, broken routes, missing files, wrong paths\n\nFixes all 6 issues found in the enterprise review of the Angular shell scaffold:\n\n- [Issue 1] CLAUDE.md: replace model.names.shell_name / model.manifest.name with\n  model.manifest.service_name — those variables don''t exist in DerivedNames or\n  ForgeManifest, causing blank title/service name in the generated file\n- [Issue 2] app.routes.ts: remove home route that lazy-loaded AppComponent into\n  itself (shell-inside-shell); replace with a redirect to the derived route path\n  and a documented placeholder comment for domain feature routes\n- [Issue 3] app.component.ts: remove Canvas module imports[] — providers are\n  already spread in app.config.ts; importing them into a component with only\n  <router-outlet /> was dead weight. Keep only RouterOutlet.\n- [Issue 4] Add missing files required for the scaffold to build and run:\n    apps/__APP__/src/main.ts      — bootstrapApplication entry point\n    apps/__APP__/src/index.html   — host page with component-prefix root element\n    apps/__APP__/src/styles.scss  — global styles placeholder\n    apps/__APP__/tsconfig.app.json — extends root tsconfig, points to main.ts\n    apps/__APP__/tsconfig.spec.json — extends root tsconfig, includes spec files\n    nx.json                        — Nx workspace config with target defaults,\n                                     generator defaults, and cache settings\n- [Issue 5] Add Clarivex license headers to all 3 .ts template files\n  (app.component, app.config, app.routes) and main.ts\n- [Issue 6] angular.json: fix root/sourceRoot and all asset/style/tsconfig paths\n  from flat src/ to apps/{{ service_name }}/src/ to match the Nx workspace\n  directory structure\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"63a580eb9e18e9694b0345f732523a77d87a8bab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/git/trees/63a580eb9e18e9694b0345f732523a77d87a8bab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/git/commits/7c5