pi.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/commit/4aff9225af46d913a31129146affb44d21089430","node_id":"C_kwDOSUDy3toAKDRhZmY5MjI1YWY0NmQ5MTNhMzExMjkxNDZhZmZiNDRkMjEwODk0MzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/commit/c76e3eb94050679845ae1d2b824b7dd9c9349721","sha":"c76e3eb94050679845ae1d2b824b7dd9c9349721","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/commits/c76e3eb94050679845ae1d2b824b7dd9c9349721"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/commit/9e7d96e417ad7921ad1580eeb33c6e33beddd5b2","sha":"9e7d96e417ad7921ad1580eeb33c6e33beddd5b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/commits/9e7d96e417ad7921ad1580eeb33c6e33beddd5b2"}],"sha":"4aff9225af46d913a31129146affb44d21089430","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/commits/4aff9225af46d913a31129146affb44d21089430"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/commits/9e7d96e417ad7921ad1580eeb33c6e33beddd5b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T00:15:36Z","email":"I30253@verisk.com","name":"Anand Jayaseelan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T00:15:36Z","email":"I30253@verisk.com","name":"Anand Jayaseelan"},"message":"fix(grpc-scaffold): apply enterprise hardening across all gRPC generator templates\n\nAddresses all priority items and the majority of findings from the enterprise\nscaffold review documented in docs/GRPC_SCAFFOLD_GENERATOR_REVIEW.md.\n\nSecurity fixes:\n- [1.2.1] CRITICAL: move UseAuthentication/UseAuthorization before audit middleware\n  so actor in audit logs reflects authenticated identity, not always \"anonymous\"\n- [1.1.1] Cache resolved Secrets Manager API key in IMemoryCache (5-min TTL)\n  to eliminate per-RPC AWS network calls\n- [1.1.3] Derive stable per-client identity from SHA-256 hash of API key\n- [1.1.4] Add named \"ForgeServiceConsumer\" authorization policy for per-RPC decoration\n- [1.5.1] Add UseForwardedHeaders + X-Forwarded-For rate limit partitioning\n- [1.5.2] Make rate limiter QueueLimit configurable via Forge:RateLimiting:QueueLimit\n- [1.4.2] Add X-Frame-Options: DENY and Referrer-Policy security headers\n- [1.6.1/7.5] Add ValidateDataAnnotations + ValidateOnStart to all options registrations\n- [7.3] Production appsettings: Warning log level + UseSecretsManager: true\n- [8.1] Dockerfile: run as non-root appuser\n- [8.3] Dockerfile: emit HEALTHCHECK pointing to /healthz\n- [8.4] Emit .dockerignore template excluding .git, tests, .claude, bin, obj\n\nQuality & standards:\n- [2.2.1] Add ConfigureAwait(false) to all async calls in templates\n- [2.2.4/2.2.6] Add TargetFramework net10.0 and AnalysisMode All to csproj.sbn\n- [2.3.1] Remove unused Microsoft.Extensions.Http.Resilience package reference\n- [1.3.2/5.1.1] ServiceImpl: split catch to handle OperationCanceledException\n  separately; add activity.SetStatus(Error) on exceptions\n\nResilience:\n- [2.4.1] Wire ForgeResilienceOptions.TimeoutSeconds into CancellationTokenSource\n  in retry handler — was previously configured but never enforced\n- [2.4.3] Skip retry for non-idempotent HTTP methods (POST, PATCH)\n\nPerformance & config:\n- [3.1.1] Read gRPC message size limits from Forge:Grpc config keys\n- [3.1.3] Enable gRPC response compression (gzip) by default\n- [3.2.1] Emit HasDefaultSchema from manifest database_schema in DbContext\n- [3.3.1] Register AddMemoryCache() in Program.cs\n- [4.1.2] Configure HostOptions.ShutdownTimeout from Forge:Shutdown:TimeoutSeconds\n- [4.2.2] Emit /healthz and /readyz HTTP health probe endpoints\n- [5.3.2] Extend histogram boundary to 10000ms\n\nConfiguration:\n- [7.1] Emit AllowedHosts in appsettings.json\n- [7.2] Emit explicit Kestrel endpoints (HTTP/2 on 7001, HTTP/1 on 8080)\n- [5.2.1] Emit Logging section with per-namespace level defaults\n- [8.5] Align EXPOSE port with Kestrel HTTP endpoint (8080)\n\nObservability:\n- [5.2.2] Audit log uses endpoint display name (route template) not raw path (PII risk)\n- [5.2.3] Add SpanId alongside TraceId in audit log for trace correlation\n\nTesting & CI:\n- [6.1.2] TestBase: wire WebApplicationFactory<Program> with GrpcChannel + IAsyncLifetime\n- [6.2.1] Align xunit.runner.visualstudio to v2.* to match xunit framework version\n- [9.2.3] Add explicit dotnet build step for test project in CI workflow\n- [9.2.1] Add dotnet format --verify-no-changes check to CI\n- [9.1.1] Add dotnet list package --vulnerable gate to CI\n- [9.2.2] Upload coverage artifact (30-day retention) in CI\n- [11.3] Fix cache key string literals to interpolated strings in FORGE_DEVELOPER_GUIDE.md\n\nDocs:\n- Remove superseded GRPC_ENTERPRISE_DEV_CHECKLIST.md and GRPC_REVIEW_CURATED_CHECKLIST.md\n- Add GRPC_SCAFFOLD_GENERATOR_REVIEW.md with completed items marked\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb90517b62c1bfea50e217ac0dd07f264c5f9a9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/git/trees/bb90517b62c1bfea50e217ac0dd07f264c5f9a9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/git/commits/9e7d96e417ad7921ad1580eeb33c6e33beddd5b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/commit/9e7d96e417ad7921ad1580eeb33c6e33beddd5b2","node_id":"C_kwDOSUDy3toAKDllN2Q5NmU0MTdhZDc5MjFhZDE1ODBlZWIzM2M2ZTMzYmVkZGQ1YjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/commit/c76e3eb94050679845ae1d2b824b7dd9c9349721","sha":"c76e3eb94050679845ae1d2b824b7dd9c9349721","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/commits/c76e3eb94050679845ae1d2b824b7dd9c9349721"}],"sha":"9e7d96e417ad7921ad1580eeb33c6e33beddd5b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-forge/commits/9e7d96e417ad