/juancho275/tractor-store/commit/871ea4177f3e5c07bf204d969b816a66acb83997","sha":"871ea4177f3e5c07bf204d969b816a66acb83997","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juancho275/tractor-store/commits/871ea4177f3e5c07bf204d969b816a66acb83997"}],"sha":"da18332cd78c19cd6f0fdf929cf45425c6c26ed4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juancho275/tractor-store/commits/da18332cd78c19cd6f0fdf929cf45425c6c26ed4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90466431?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juancho275","id":90466431,"login":"juancho275","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNDY2NDMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juancho275/tractor-store/commits/871ea4177f3e5c07bf204d969b816a66acb83997/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T06:11:03Z","email":"juan.viteri@quind.io","name":"juan.viteri"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T06:11:03Z","email":"juan.viteri@quind.io","name":"juan.viteri"},"message":"feat(SCRUM-37): add Prometheus + Grafana observability stack with dashboards and alerts\n\nSe agrego un stack completo de observabilidad local compuesto por Prometheus, Grafana y Alertmanager, levantable con un solo comando usando docker-compose.observability.yml. No modifica el despliegue en Railway ni Vercel ya que es exclusivo para el entorno de desarrollo.\n\nEn el backend se agregaron dos metricas nuevas: tractor.catalog.products.viewed se incrementa en CatalogService cada vez que un usuario consulta el detalle de un producto, y tractor.api.errors se incrementa en RequestCorrelationFilter al finalizar cada request con status 400 o mayor, etiquetado con el status HTTP y la URI. Esto complementa las metricas orders.placed y cart.items.added que ya existian desde SCRUM-30.\n\nPrometheus se configura para hacer scraping del endpoint /actuator/prometheus del backend cada 10 segundos. Se definen 4 reglas de alerta: backend caido, latencia p95 mayor a 500ms, tasa de errores 5xx mayor al 5%, y uso de heap JVM mayor al 80%.\n\nGrafana se provisiona automaticamente con el datasource de Prometheus y tres dashboards listos para usar: JVM Dashboard con heap, threads, GC y CPU; API Dashboard con throughput, tasa de errores, latencia p50/p95/p99 y estado de la instancia; Business Dashboard con el embudo de conversion mostrando productos vistos, items al carrito y ordenes creadas tanto en totales como en series de tiempo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5755c9125d0506c534c238beadca7ae70618fbff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juancho275/tractor-store/git/trees/5755c9125d0506c534c238beadca7ae70618fbff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juancho275/tractor-store/git/commits/871ea4177f3e5c07bf204d969b816a66acb83997","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90466431?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":""