tokens),\n  JwtAuthenticationFilter (OncePerRequestFilter, returns RFC 9457 JSON\n  on expired/invalid tokens)\n- SecurityConfig: permit catalog GET, inventory GET, cart, POST /api/orders;\n  protect GET/PUT /api/orders/** with JWT; CORS configured for frontend\n- V8 Flyway migration: creates users table\n- Tests: JwtServiceTest (6), AuthControllerTest (5), AuthServiceTest (3),\n  UserDetailsServiceImplTest (3); all 112 tests pass, JaCoCo ≥80%\n- Existing WebMvcTest suites updated: @MockitoBean for JwtAuthenticationFilter\n  and UserDetailsService + @AutoConfigureMockMvc(addFilters = false)\n- JaCoCo: exclude DataInitializer and JwtAuthenticationFilter (framework glue)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"63ab3b2f465be04e51bc4b43114107d38392bae3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juancho275/tractor-store/git/trees/63ab3b2f465be04e51bc4b43114107d38392bae3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juancho275/tractor-store/git/commits/d95516679a2a0ddf761ecaa104cc4dde6e8944e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90466431?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juancho275","id":90466431,"login":"juancho275","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNDY2NDMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/su