_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juancho275","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juancho275/tractor-store/commits/57cc9ad52b89e5069fa64ec19de5707dd2f9348d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T01:53:24Z","email":"juan.viteri@quind.io","name":"juan.viteri"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T01:53:24Z","email":"juan.viteri@quind.io","name":"juan.viteri"},"message":"docs(SCRUM-36): add technical documentation — README, ARCHITECTURE, ADRs, CONTRIBUTING, DEPLOYMENT\n\n- README.md: reemplaza boilerplate Nx con guia real del proyecto (badges, quick start, URLs de prod)\n- ARCHITECTURE.md: diagrama de modulos backend/frontend y tabla de stack tecnico\n- CONTRIBUTING.md: flujo GitFlow, Conventional Commits y checklist de PR\n- DEPLOYMENT.md: pipeline CI/CD, variables de entorno, rollback < 5 min, smoke tests\n- CHANGELOG.md: historial de v1.0.0 con todas las funcionalidades entregadas\n- PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md: template con checklist para GitHub PRs\n- docker-compose.yml: PostgreSQL 17 para desarrollo local (docker compose up -d)\n- ADR-002: Angular 19 + Module Federation (antes vacio)\n- ADR-003: Nx como herramienta de monorepo (antes vacio)\n- ADR-004: Patron Outbox para Domain Events via Spring Modulith (nuevo)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c93d0431c1d1dac6759db17cbe773350a17392ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juancho275/tractor-store/git/trees/c93d0431c1d1dac6759db17cbe773350a17392ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juancho275/tractor-store/git/commits/57cc9ad52b89e5069fa6